WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

2
00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:14.792
<i>I aspired to reach
the pinnacle of wrestling.</i>

3
00:01:15.792 --> 00:01:16.875
But I couldn't make it.

4
00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:21.589
However. I hope my child will one day
represent our country in wrestling.

5
00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.437
If I'm married to you.
it won't happen.

6
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.500
You may leave.

7
00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:29.292
Why are you doubting your ability?

8
00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:30.809
It's not like you're
too old to achieve it.

9
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:32.042
I will help you achieve it.

10
00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:35.958
Are you serious?

11
00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:38.875
I swear on our unborn child.

12
00:01:56.708 --> 00:01:57.750
RAILWAY QUARTERS

13
00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:00.792
Hey. the water tanker has arrived!
Hurry up!

14
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:04.593
Hey! Everyone. be patient
and fill your pots.

15
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:08.018
It's been four days since the metro
pipe broke. and it's still not fixed.

16
00:02:08.042 --> 00:02:09.042
Damn you!

17
00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:11.667
Filling one pot alone
feels like a huge task.

18
00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:13.143
And someone's here with so many pots!

19
00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:14.208
Who the hell are you?

20
00:02:14.292 --> 00:02:16.542
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

21
00:02:16.625 --> 00:02:18.875
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

22
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.167
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

23
00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:23.667
- Sister. make way.
<i>- Take it easy. buddy.</i>

24
00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.875
Step aside. sister.
Auntie. step aside.

25
00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:32.458
<i>Will life stop
While it's racing ahead?</i>

26
00:02:32.542 --> 00:02:33.542
Hey. don't shove me!

27
00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:36.375
Sister. I'm getting late.
Hey. help her get up.

28
00:02:36.917 --> 00:02:37.833
Come on. fill up your pots.

29
00:02:37.917 --> 00:02:42.167
<i>Problems chase us every day
Will they ever let go?</i>

30
00:02:44.875 --> 00:02:47.042
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

31
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:54.542
<i>Who created this divide
Between men's and women's work. dear?</i>

32
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:59.208
<i>He who understands
The woman he loves lives like a King.</i>

33
00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:01.458
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

34
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:03.458
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

35
00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:06.167
<i>Don't take it too hard. buddy.</i>

36
00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:08.667
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

37
00:03:08.833 --> 00:03:10.792
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

38
00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:13.500
<i>Take it easy. buddy.</i>

39
00:03:14.042 --> 00:03:15.042
Mathi!

40
00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:16.583
Mathi!

41
00:03:16.917 --> 00:03:18.757
Sweetie. wake up.
It's getting late for school.

42
00:03:19.292 --> 00:03:20.708
Come on. wake up.
It's getting late.

43
00:03:20.792 --> 00:03:23.309
- Please give me two minutes. Pa.
- Your two minutes are very long.

44
00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:24.351
- Come on. wake up.
- I'm still sleepy. Pa.

45
00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:25.375
No more excuses. Wake up!

46
00:03:25.875 --> 00:03:26.875
Be a sweetheart.

47
00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.000
<i>Love has no barriers.</i>

48
00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:34.750
<i>Duty seeks no reward.</i>

49
00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:41.125
<i>A smile turns
Everything into joy.</i>

50
00:03:41.792 --> 00:03:45.250
<i>To a hopeful heart.
Even stones seem like sugar.</i>

51
00:03:45.333 --> 00:03:48.250
Dad. don't forget to buy an eraser
on our way to school.

52
00:03:48.333 --> 00:03:50.125
How many erasers would you lose?

53
00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:52.583
It's not like an eraser is a big item.

54
00:03:52.958 --> 00:03:53.958
It's a tiny item.

55
00:03:54.292 --> 00:03:55.375
It's bound to get lost.

56
00:03:55.542 --> 00:03:57.000
Fine. I'll buy you one.

57
00:03:57.708 --> 00:03:59.083
Dad. lock up quick.
Let's leave.

58
00:03:59.458 --> 00:04:00.738
Did your husband leave for work?

59
00:04:00.792 --> 00:04:03.000
- He...
- No! Why do you ask?

60
00:04:03.667 --> 00:04:05.542
Nothing. I just asked.

61
00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:06.997
With so many houses around.

62
00:04:07.042 --> 00:04:08.917
why do you specifically
ask my wife about it?

63
00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:10.542
Why shouldn't I suspect you?

64
00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:12.357
Sir. why would you ask such a thing?

65
00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.792
Isn't it normal to ask someone
whether you've left for work?

66
00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:17.018
You're making a big deal about it.

67
00:04:17.042 --> 00:04:19.625
A man who is a house husband…

68
00:04:19.917 --> 00:04:21.500
Goes to a newlywed woman.

69
00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:24.417
and inquiring if the husband is home
or at work isn't normal.

70
00:04:24.833 --> 00:04:28.333
In my case. I'm a TTR on the train. and
it takes me 3 days to get home from work.

71
00:04:28.458 --> 00:04:30.583
During these three days.
my heart keeps beating fast.

72
00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:33.601
- Damn. he left!
<i>- Mani. did you switch on the motor?</i>

73
00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:35.083
<i>I just switched on the motor.</i>

74
00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.691
- Hey. watchman. come over here.
- Sir!

75
00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.434
- I'm assigning you a task.
- Sir.

76
00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:41.167
- Watch the CCTV 24 hours carefully.
- Okay. Sir.

77
00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:44.333
If someone is entering another flat
besides their own…

78
00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:45.667
Inform me.

79
00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:47.226
Sir. why are you beating around the bush?

80
00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.625
It's my duty to catch him
and your wife red-handed.

81
00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:52.292
Don't worry about it and head to work.

82
00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:53.375
I'll handle it.

83
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.833
What?
You'll catch them red-handed. you say?

84
00:05:00.792 --> 00:05:01.917
Come on. hurry up!

85
00:05:02.917 --> 00:05:04.268
Once again. you're late to school.

86
00:05:04.292 --> 00:05:05.667
This is not right. sweetie.

87
00:05:06.042 --> 00:05:07.042
What's not right?

88
00:05:07.083 --> 00:05:09.583
You woke up a child from deep sleep.

89
00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:13.542
It's better for a child
to arrive late than

90
00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:15.347
to be forced
to arrive at school too early.

91
00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.809
If you keep talking like this you'll
get beatings from your Teacher.

92
00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:18.833
Hurry up!

93
00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:21.333
Madam!

94
00:05:23.542 --> 00:05:25.302
- Bye. bye.
- Bye. I'll see you in the evening.

95
00:05:26.583 --> 00:05:27.708
Where are you leaving?

96
00:05:28.042 --> 00:05:29.750
We have a Parents-Teacher meeting today.

97
00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:31.893
No. teacher.
today I have a wrestling match to go to.

98
00:05:31.917 --> 00:05:32.917
I'm already running late.

99
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.101
I'll finish it and come back.

100
00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:35.750
I can't wait for you.

101
00:05:35.833 --> 00:05:38.193
Now that you're here.
attend the meeting. and you may leave.

102
00:05:40.208 --> 00:05:41.083
So. tell me. teacher.

103
00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:43.167
What do I even say?
See for yourself.

104
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:48.083
She failed in all the subjects.

105
00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:50.708
She can't even finish a rhyme.

106
00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.708
Her homework is always incomplete.

107
00:05:53.917 --> 00:05:55.837
Do you make any effort
to help her study at home?

108
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.375
Do you make any effort
to help her study at school?

109
00:05:58.708 --> 00:06:00.269
Do you even realize what you're saying?

110
00:06:00.542 --> 00:06:01.976
No matter how much effort we put in.

111
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.720
it never seems enough to survive
in today's highly competitive world.

112
00:06:05.125 --> 00:06:06.125
Okay. Teacher. What else?

113
00:06:07.167 --> 00:06:08.167
What else?

114
00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:09.875
She's very talkative!

115
00:06:10.125 --> 00:06:12.208
She's always yapping during the class.

116
00:06:12.417 --> 00:06:14.497
She's becoming a bad influence
on the other students.

117
00:06:16.417 --> 00:06:17.937
Last week I checked my blood pressure.

118
00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:20.375
- It's beyond 200 now.
- Oh. no!

119
00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:22.208
I truly can't take this anymore.

120
00:06:22.458 --> 00:06:24.143
Didn't you mention the same
during the last PTA meeting?

121
00:06:24.167 --> 00:06:25.167
I don't see anything new.

122
00:06:25.792 --> 00:06:27.042
Should I sign here?

123
00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:30.667
- Here. go sign it!
- Thank you. Teacher.

124
00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:34.292
I have a wrestling match to go to.
So I cut the line.

125
00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:35.417
Sorry. sorry. I'm leaving.

126
00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.417
Bye! Everyone. bye.

127
00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.375
- Bye!
- Bye!

128
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.583
Is he a wrestler?

129
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:40.750
Don't be fooled!

130
00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:44.417
Even a wrestler won't mention
about a match so many times.

131
00:06:44.708 --> 00:06:47.167
He's not a wrestler. but his wife is.

132
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:51.625
Keerthi! Keerthi!

133
00:06:51.958 --> 00:06:52.958
Come on. start!

134
00:07:03.667 --> 00:07:05.292
<i>Fierce wrestling.</i>

135
00:07:10.667 --> 00:07:12.208
<i>Fierce wrestling.</i>

136
00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:14.914
Come on. Keerthi. Come on. Keerthi.
Come on. Come on.

137
00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:18.208
Defend!

138
00:07:18.667 --> 00:07:19.667
Coach!

139
00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.583
Hold her down. Lock! Lock!

140
00:07:25.125 --> 00:07:26.417
Hey. flip her! Flip her!

141
00:07:27.458 --> 00:07:28.917
Come on. flip her.

142
00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.250
Did you see that move?

143
00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:39.875
Come on!

144
00:07:41.667 --> 00:07:43.083
<i>Fierce wrestling.</i>

145
00:07:45.125 --> 00:07:47.375
Come on. Keerthi! Come on!
Hold her down!

146
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.708
Come on. come on! Break the lock.

147
00:07:52.458 --> 00:07:53.458
<i>Fierce.</i>

148
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.000
<i>Wrestling.</i>

149
00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:02.042
Yayy! Hey! Hey!

150
00:08:09.792 --> 00:08:10.792
<i>Fierce.</i>

151
00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:14.208
<i>Wrestling.</i>

152
00:08:20.917 --> 00:08:22.458
<i>Fierce wrestling.</i>

153
00:08:31.083 --> 00:08:33.708
I thought you'd lose
when she locked you in.

154
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.000
Thank goodness you broke her hold
and attacked her.

155
00:08:36.083 --> 00:08:37.643
What did they say during the PTA meeting?

156
00:08:37.667 --> 00:08:39.083
Nothing much to say. though.

157
00:08:39.167 --> 00:08:40.042
They said she's a good girl.

158
00:08:40.125 --> 00:08:41.458
She's studying well.

159
00:08:41.625 --> 00:08:43.500
Also. she's the teacher's pet.

160
00:08:43.917 --> 00:08:44.917
Phew!

161
00:08:45.417 --> 00:08:47.250
- She's her mother's daughter.
- Of course!

162
00:08:47.875 --> 00:08:49.125
Congratulations. Keerthi!

163
00:08:49.292 --> 00:08:50.875
- Well played!
- Thank you. Coach.

164
00:08:51.667 --> 00:08:53.583
Veera. why are you carrying
so many bottles?

165
00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:54.917
This is ABC juice.

166
00:08:55.417 --> 00:08:58.958
And this is mixed-nut juice.
exclusively prepared by me.

167
00:08:59.333 --> 00:09:01.167
And this is millet flour porridge
for lunch.

168
00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:05.125
If a wife has a husband like him.
she'll be unstoppable.

169
00:09:05.375 --> 00:09:06.917
You're really gifted. Keerthi.

170
00:09:07.333 --> 00:09:08.542
- Bye.
- Okay. Coach.

171
00:09:16.208 --> 00:09:17.750
- Who is it?
- My aunt from hometown.

172
00:09:18.292 --> 00:09:20.417
- Hi. auntie. how are you?
- I'm doing well. Veera!

173
00:09:20.708 --> 00:09:22.458
How are Keerthi and Mathi?

174
00:09:22.583 --> 00:09:24.292
No complaints. they're doing very well.

175
00:09:24.458 --> 00:09:27.917
Coming Sunday. Subbaraj's son
is getting married at the temple.

176
00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.958
<i>As it's our relative's wedding…</i>

177
00:09:30.333 --> 00:09:32.351
Your uncle invited you
and your family to attend it.

178
00:09:32.375 --> 00:09:33.792
Why didn't he call himself?

179
00:09:33.875 --> 00:09:35.583
<i>You know your uncle very well.</i>

180
00:09:35.667 --> 00:09:36.833
You must attend the wedding.

181
00:09:37.208 --> 00:09:38.208
Okay. auntie!

182
00:09:38.833 --> 00:09:39.833
What was the call about?

183
00:09:40.583 --> 00:09:43.144
There's a wedding happening
in the hometown. thus the invitation.

184
00:09:43.208 --> 00:09:44.750
Fine. I'm leaving. I'm running late.

185
00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.958
People in society
will be waiting for me.

186
00:09:47.042 --> 00:09:48.522
Hey. what song are you playing today?

187
00:10:29.083 --> 00:10:30.792
So soon. it reached 50.000 likes.

188
00:10:31.875 --> 00:10:32.917
Forget about the likes.

189
00:10:33.542 --> 00:10:34.708
Did you read the comments?

190
00:10:35.042 --> 00:10:36.333
There's one comment…

191
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:39.958
"They may be old.
but these aunties look ravishing."

192
00:10:40.292 --> 00:10:43.417
"I must kidnap them all
and take them to Andaman Island."

193
00:10:43.583 --> 00:10:45.417
That's nothing.
I read another comment.

194
00:10:45.667 --> 00:10:48.292
"Who's that beauty
in a black saree in the front?"

195
00:10:48.375 --> 00:10:50.500
"Her husband must be a lucky fellow."

196
00:10:50.583 --> 00:10:51.667
Who was in black saree?

197
00:10:51.792 --> 00:10:54.375
Who else do you think?
It's Partha's wife.

198
00:10:55.125 --> 00:10:57.333
Reels like this ruin many families.

199
00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:00.500
Veera is the root cause of this problem.

200
00:11:00.792 --> 00:11:05.042
He's doing weird things
in the name of exercise and aerobics.

201
00:11:05.208 --> 00:11:07.000
He does not stop with just exercise.

202
00:11:07.292 --> 00:11:08.625
How to make onion sambhar.

203
00:11:08.708 --> 00:11:11.250
How to knead flour for chapatis.
He teaches it all.

204
00:11:11.542 --> 00:11:13.059
I can even make peace with these things.

205
00:11:13.083 --> 00:11:14.684
The other day I was returning from work…

206
00:11:14.917 --> 00:11:16.518
Do you know what he was teaching my wife?

207
00:11:16.542 --> 00:11:19.583
What is that "stone. paper. scissors"
you play with your daughter?

208
00:11:19.708 --> 00:11:20.958
It's an easy game.

209
00:11:21.083 --> 00:11:21.958
This is stone.

210
00:11:22.042 --> 00:11:23.042
This is paper.

211
00:11:23.083 --> 00:11:24.083
And this is scissor.

212
00:11:24.292 --> 00:11:25.625
Stone. paper. scissors.

213
00:11:26.292 --> 00:11:27.292
Shall we play?

214
00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.708
Stone. paper. scissors.

215
00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.667
What are you guys doing?

216
00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.500
I'm paper. and he's scissors.

217
00:11:37.583 --> 00:11:38.708
He's scissoring me.

218
00:11:38.833 --> 00:11:39.833
Scissoring?

219
00:11:42.208 --> 00:11:43.708
If we want these problems to end.

220
00:11:43.792 --> 00:11:45.833
- we need to persuade him to start working.
- I agree!

221
00:11:45.958 --> 00:11:48.042
That's why I spent 5.000 rupees
to throw this party.

222
00:11:48.125 --> 00:11:49.125
I understand.

223
00:11:49.917 --> 00:11:51.750
He's living happily with his wife.

224
00:11:52.125 --> 00:11:54.458
I won't spare him. Wait and watch.

225
00:11:54.708 --> 00:11:57.149
I have lot of work in the morning.
I have to go to bed early...

226
00:12:00.917 --> 00:12:01.917
Oh. my!

227
00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.750
Here I come.

228
00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:27.583
What happened. Dad?

229
00:12:27.667 --> 00:12:29.500
Nothing. dear.
Mom dropped the glass.

230
00:12:29.583 --> 00:12:32.167
It's become a habit now.

231
00:12:32.375 --> 00:12:33.375
You go back to sleep.

232
00:12:37.042 --> 00:12:38.958
How many times should I tell you?

233
00:12:39.458 --> 00:12:41.750
Not to sneak up on me
and kiss me on my neck.

234
00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:43.750
I like it.

235
00:12:46.875 --> 00:12:48.625
Dad. please don't sing.

236
00:12:48.833 --> 00:12:50.250
Okay. okay. I won't sing.

237
00:12:50.458 --> 00:12:51.458
Shall I tell you a story?

238
00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.833
I don't want to hear a story.

239
00:12:52.917 --> 00:12:55.333
But I want a younger brother. though.

240
00:12:55.542 --> 00:12:56.667
Younger brother. you say?

241
00:12:59.417 --> 00:13:00.583
Ask Mom! Ask Mom!

242
00:13:00.667 --> 00:13:03.083
- Mom!
- You're not getting a younger brother.

243
00:13:03.542 --> 00:13:05.375
- Shut up and sleep.
- Why not?

244
00:13:06.292 --> 00:13:11.083
My classmates Deepak. Darshan. Diya.
and others have a younger brother.

245
00:13:11.333 --> 00:13:12.458
I want a brother too.

246
00:13:12.542 --> 00:13:13.792
That too. I want it tomorrow.

247
00:13:14.333 --> 00:13:17.667
It's not a product you can get overnight
delivery on from Amazon or Flipkart.

248
00:13:18.292 --> 00:13:19.292
Go back to sleep!

249
00:13:19.792 --> 00:13:21.375
It doesn't happen overnight. dear.

250
00:13:21.542 --> 00:13:22.559
It will take Pathu Maasam.

251
00:13:22.583 --> 00:13:25.333
