Under the 55 kg category.
the winner is Malithi.

340
00:18:51.708 --> 00:18:54.792
Under the 60 kg category.
the winner is Kavya.

341
00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.750
Under the 65 kg category.
the winner is Keerthi.

342
