353
00:19:28.917 --> 00:19:31.542
Wrestling signifies strength.

354
00:19:31.833 --> 00:19:34.250
A strong society
is essential for our nation.

355
00:19:34.958 --> 00:19:36.667
Compared to North India

356
00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:40.292
people taking up wrestling
is lower in South India.

357
