In Tamil Nadu. specifically.

358
00:19:41.792 --> 00:19:44.272
It's evident that people in the Mettur.
Salem and Erode regions

359
00:19:44.417 --> 00:19:46.292
choose wrestling as their sport.

360
00:19:46.542 --> 00:19:48.342
This interest should
spread across our nation.

361
00:19:48.458 --> 00:19:49.939
Numerous opportunities are available.

362
00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.542
Keerthi. to whom
I just presented the shield

363
00:19:52.792 --> 00:19:54.125
she's a mother of a child.

364
00:19:54.542 --> 00:19:57.833
She secured a job in the
Railway Department under sports quota.

365
00:19:58.875 --> 00:20:01.708
She's the face of wrestling
in Tamil Nadu.

366
00:20:02.208 --> 00:20:03.208
Thank you. Sir.

367
00:20:03.667 --> 00:20:05.167
Let her be an inspiration to others.

368
00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:08.083
