372
00:20:16.958 --> 00:20:18.750
The winners of this tournament

373
00:20:18.958 --> 00:20:22.833
can take part in the next
National Championship held in Delhi.

374
00:20:23.125 --> 00:20:25.625
Bear that in mind and play well.

375
00:20:25.875 --> 00:20:27.292
Thank you! Greetings!

376
00:20:29.625 --> 00:20:32.625
