506
00:27:14.417 --> 00:27:16.750
you're not a house husband
but a wrestler.

507
00:27:17.083 --> 00:27:18.750
- Are you a Malayali?
- Yes.

508
00:27:23.417 --> 00:27:25.851
The school called you to report
that our daughter beat up two people.

509
00:27:25.875 --> 00:27:27.667
But you went there
and beat up four people.

510
00:27:29.667 --> 00:27:32.708
The daughter and
father deserve each other.

511
00:27:33.000 --> 00:27:37.708
Darshan and Deepak mocked.
calling Dad a house husband.

512
00:27:37.833 --> 00:27:39.625
That's why I beat them up.

513
00:27:39.833 --> 00:27:41.994
There's nothing wrong with calling him
a house husband.

514
00:27:43.458 --> 00:27:44.792
Let them say it.

515
00:27:45.042 --> 00:27:46.292
Why would you cause problem?

516
00:27:46.375 --> 00:27:49.083
My father is a wrestler just like you.

517
00:27:49.208 --> 00:27:50.208
Check this out.

518
00:27:50.542 --> 00:27:52.208
He defeated a coach!

519
00:27:52.792 --> 00:27:55.417
It's cute for you to think
that what he did was wrestling.

520
00:27:55.625 --> 00:27:57.125
It's just a fight.

521
00:27:57.292 --> 00:27:59.333
That coach spoke ill about me.

522
00:27:59.417 --> 00:28:01.167
So. out of anger. he beat him up.

523
00:28:02.000 --> 00:28:04.542
Back in the hometown.
the President uncle told me.

524
00:28:04.667 --> 00:28:08.667
not to call Dad a house husband.
but to call him a wrestler.

525
00:28:08.792 --> 00:28:10.000
Hey. don't say it.

526
00:28:10.458 --> 00:28:12.226
You must not say
things like that to your mother.

527
00:28:12.250 --> 00:28:14.750
Now I see where my daughter gets it from.

528
00:28:15.250 --> 00:28:18.792
Listen. you may listen to anyone
in this world. but not that man.

529
00:28:19.042 --> 00:28:22.333
He hails from a group
that glorifies patriarchy.

530
00:28:23.000 --> 00:28:24.726
Why would you indulge a child
with such conversation?

531
00:28:24.750 --> 00:28:26.268
She wishes to call her Dad a wrestler.

532
00:28:26.292 --> 00:28:27.292
So be it.

533
00:28:27.750 --> 00:28:30.500
It's our duty as parents
to bring her clarity on matters.

534
00:28:31.208 --> 00:28:33.667
If we fail to do it.
this will be the result.

535
00:28:34.042 --> 00:28:36.875
Listen. dear. your Dad is a house husband.

536
00:28:37.333 --> 00:28:39.083
There's nothing wrong with it.

537
00:28:39.542 --> 00:28:40.542
Understand?

538
00:28:44.083 --> 00:28:45.083
Vani!

539
00:28:45.625 --> 00:28:46.625
Step aside!

540
00:28:46.958 --> 00:28:48.478
Why is he bringing water to our house?

541
00:28:48.625 --> 00:28:51.000
You won't move a muscle.
but you find faults in him.

542
00:28:51.500 --> 00:28:52.500
Annoying!

543
00:28:54.708 --> 00:28:57.500
<i>Goodness gracious. my girl!</i>

544
00:28:57.708 --> 00:28:59.375
I made your favorite brinjal curry.

545
00:28:59.542 --> 00:29:00.917
You'd better finish it all.
Okay?

546
00:29:01.042 --> 00:29:03.500
<i>No way Not this troublemaker.</i>

547
00:29:03.708 --> 00:29:05.625
<i>He's a sly rogue
Who keeps putting on an act.</i>

548
00:29:05.708 --> 00:29:06.583
This is cheating!

549
00:29:06.667 --> 00:29:07.667
Thank you.

550
00:29:08.417 --> 00:29:09.417
Where is he coming from?

551
00:29:10.125 --> 00:29:11.750
I ran out of sugar for coffee.

552
00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:14.125
Why can't you have coffee without sugar?

553
00:29:14.375 --> 00:29:16.292
You have country sugar.
It tastes good!

554
00:29:16.417 --> 00:29:19.208
- Country sugar?
<i>- Hey! Hey! House husband.</i>

555
00:29:19.292 --> 00:29:21.750
<i>My BP shoots up seeing you!</i>

556
00:29:21.833 --> 00:29:23.625
- Are you making chapatis?
- Yes!

557
00:29:24.042 --> 00:29:25.162
Why knead the dough so late?

558
00:29:25.208 --> 00:29:27.208
"Longing to Fly" serial was playing.

559
00:29:27.292 --> 00:29:29.000
I lost track of time watching it.

560
00:29:41.125 --> 00:29:42.333
- Hi. Sir!
- Hello!

561
00:29:43.333 --> 00:29:45.214
I'm going to create an ID
called "House Husband"

562
00:29:45.333 --> 00:29:47.667
I'll keep posting
until he finds an actual job.

563
00:29:48.042 --> 00:29:51.250
In our country. there are fewer
people who work out of passion

564
00:29:51.417 --> 00:29:53.250
than those who work out of humiliation.

565
00:29:53.375 --> 00:29:54.375
Oh!

566
00:29:56.875 --> 00:29:58.542
- House Husband?
- Hey. show me the video.

567
00:29:58.792 --> 00:30:01.292
Veera. your reels are going viral.
Awesome!

568
00:30:01.375 --> 00:30:03.542
Sir. I watched your reels.
They're fantastic!

569
00:30:04.250 --> 00:30:05.625
- Veera!
- Yes. Auntie!

570
00:30:05.708 --> 00:30:07.917
- Your reels are getting a greater reach.
- Thanks!

571
00:30:08.208 --> 00:30:09.601
He's a perfect example of a good husband.

572
00:30:09.625 --> 00:30:11.208
- First let's…
- Comment on the video.

573
00:30:12.208 --> 00:30:14.309
Just because I told our daughter
that you're a house husband

574
00:30:14.333 --> 00:30:15.875
you're started making such reels.

575
00:30:16.333 --> 00:30:17.750
I swear I'm not making them.

576
00:30:17.833 --> 00:30:19.292
I have nothing to do with it.

577
00:30:19.375 --> 00:30:20.655
I don't know who is making them.

578
00:30:21.458 --> 00:30:23.750
Every reel is gaining a lot of views.

579
00:30:24.042 --> 00:30:25.625
Soon we'll be making money from it.

580
00:30:26.750 --> 00:30:28.643
- Shall we continue this as a business?
- It's a good idea.

581
00:30:28.667 --> 00:30:29.667
I ought to!

582
00:30:30.583 --> 00:30:33.667
Among the dishes you make.
which is your wife's favorite dish?

583
00:30:34.542 --> 00:30:35.542
Come with me!

584
00:30:38.833 --> 00:30:41.875
<i>Hey! Hey! House husband.</i>

585
00:30:45.875 --> 00:30:48.333
- It's outstanding. Sir.
- Thank you!

586
00:30:49.875 --> 00:30:53.875
Keerthi will be taking part
in the upcoming South Indian Tournament.

587
00:30:54.417 --> 00:30:56.777
Another player from the same academy
can compete for Team B.

588
00:30:57.292 --> 00:30:58.833
I have suggested your name.

589
00:30:59.958 --> 00:31:00.833
Thank you. Coach!

590
00:31:00.917 --> 00:31:02.542
To hell with your thanks!

591
00:31:03.625 --> 00:31:07.625
This time. you must defeat Keerthi
in the first round.

592
00:31:07.708 --> 00:31:09.417
That's how you'd be thanking me.

593
00:31:10.708 --> 00:31:12.917
First round? How's it possible?

594
00:31:13.875 --> 00:31:15.042
Leave that to me.

595
00:31:21.792 --> 00:31:24.512
Sweetie. who's this at your school
with all that gorgeous thick hair?

596
00:31:25.750 --> 00:31:27.667
Look up! She's my teacher!

597
00:31:32.375 --> 00:31:33.458
Your teacher?

598
00:31:43.542 --> 00:31:44.702
Why is she coming towards me?

599
00:31:44.833 --> 00:31:47.833
I watched your reels.
Very interesting!

600
00:31:47.917 --> 00:31:48.792
You too?

601
00:31:48.875 --> 00:31:50.475
I don't know who's making them. Teacher.

602
00:31:50.708 --> 00:31:53.042
Forget about it.
Where in Kerala are you from?

603
00:31:53.250 --> 00:31:54.250
Cochin!

604
00:31:54.458 --> 00:31:55.458
Are you a Malayali?

605
00:31:56.125 --> 00:31:57.125
Half Malayali!

606
00:31:58.958 --> 00:31:59.958
That's interesting!

607
00:32:00.208 --> 00:32:01.208
What's your name?

608
00:32:01.292 --> 00:32:02.292
Meenu.

609
00:32:02.333 --> 00:32:03.625
Your eyes reveal your name.

610
00:32:05.750 --> 00:32:07.430
If you don't mind.
may I ask you something?

611
00:32:07.792 --> 00:32:08.792
Go ahead!

612
00:32:09.417 --> 00:32:10.750
Are yours original?

613
00:32:10.958 --> 00:32:12.542
What? What do you mean?

614
00:32:13.125 --> 00:32:15.042
No... I meant. is your hair original?

615
00:32:15.417 --> 00:32:16.417
Phew!

616
00:32:20.125 --> 00:32:21.125
Hold it.

617
00:32:22.667 --> 00:32:23.917
I don't mind. Hold it.

618
00:32:24.917 --> 00:32:25.958
- Pull it.
- Sure?

619
00:32:26.042 --> 00:32:27.042
You may pull and check.

620
00:32:33.708 --> 00:32:35.500
- Okay?
- They're original.

621
00:32:35.833 --> 00:32:38.708
I heard that during a fight.
someone pulled your wife's hair

622
00:32:38.792 --> 00:32:41.125
and it came off in front of the crowd.
humiliating her.

623
00:32:47.833 --> 00:32:50.667
So. I reckon you suspect
everyone may have fake hair.

624
00:32:50.958 --> 00:32:53.625
However. don't keep checking people's hair
as you did just now.

625
00:32:57.583 --> 00:32:58.583
I'm leaving!

626
00:33:00.083 --> 00:33:01.083
Hey. Sweetie...

627
00:33:01.292 --> 00:33:02.542
Why is she getting angry?

628
00:33:03.833 --> 00:33:05.583
<i>Let's go together. That'd be best.</i>

629
00:33:06.125 --> 00:33:08.000
Oh. please wait for me to arrive there.

630
00:33:08.333 --> 00:33:09.875
Okay. I'll call you back later.

631
00:33:10.125 --> 00:33:11.125
I'm hanging up.

632
00:33:11.458 --> 00:33:15.792
You speak to your mother
and grandma in Malayalam.

633
00:33:16.333 --> 00:33:18.583
But I don't see you
speaking in Malayalam to Dad.

634
00:33:18.708 --> 00:33:19.708
Why is it. Mom?

635
00:33:20.000 --> 00:33:21.875
Your father doesn't know Malayalam.

636
00:33:22.125 --> 00:33:23.042
Who said so?

637
00:33:23.125 --> 00:33:25.167
He speaks Malayalam well at school.

638
00:33:25.458 --> 00:33:27.292
In Malayalam. you say?
With whom?

639
00:33:27.833 --> 00:33:29.000
He speaks to my Teacher.

640
00:33:30.417 --> 00:33:33.083
- Teacher?
- Yeah. my new Teacher.

641
00:33:33.833 --> 00:33:34.833
Is she a Malayali?

642
00:33:34.917 --> 00:33:37.083
I hear her say she's from Cochin.

643
00:33:40.667 --> 00:33:41.667
Is she married?

644
00:33:42.083 --> 00:33:43.083
No!

645
00:33:46.833 --> 00:33:48.083
How does she look?

646
00:33:48.417 --> 00:33:49.667
She's beautiful.

647
00:33:52.250 --> 00:33:53.875
How beautiful?

648
00:33:55.500 --> 00:33:57.708
She's more beautiful than you.
Enough?

649
00:33:58.917 --> 00:33:59.917
Oh!

650
00:34:01.875 --> 00:34:03.625
How long has this been going on?

651
00:34:03.792 --> 00:34:05.333
It's been just a few days.

652
00:34:10.458 --> 00:34:11.458
Does she have hair?

653
00:34:11.750 --> 00:34:14.167
- Of course. she has hair. Mom.
- Nah!

654
00:34:15.125 --> 00:34:18.250
Like you see thick and fluffy hair
in oil advertisements…

655
00:34:18.542 --> 00:34:20.625
Does she have long hair?

656
00:34:21.875 --> 00:34:22.875
Turn around.

657
00:34:24.458 --> 00:34:25.958
Turn around. I'll show you.

658
00:34:28.958 --> 00:34:30.333
Her hair runs till here.

659
00:34:36.000 --> 00:34:38.333
Now I understand
why the rat is running naked.

660
00:34:38.417 --> 00:34:40.458
And why your Dad is speaking in Malayalam.

661
00:34:41.375 --> 00:34:42.458
Let him come home.

662
00:34:42.625 --> 00:34:44.809
No matter how many years pass by
his brain is still stuck in it.

663
00:34:44.833 --> 00:34:46.292
Oh. God. you've gone mad. Mom.

664
00:34:46.708 --> 00:34:48.458
The moment he sees a woman
with long hair.

665
00:34:49.083 --> 00:34:50.604
What on earth is going on in my house?

666
00:34:57.417 --> 00:34:58.667
So. what are you up to?

667
00:35:00.583 --> 00:35:01.750
How does it matter to you?

668
00:35:01.833 --> 00:35:03.018
You have someone to talk to now.

669
00:35:03.042 --> 00:35:04.042
Go and speak to her.

670
00:35:04.500 --> 00:35:06.333
What are you saying?
I don't understand.

671
00:35:06.417 --> 00:35:08.250
Of course. you wouldn't
understand me anymore.

672
00:35:08.542 --> 00:35:09.792
- What?
- Bloody man.

673
00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:11.042
Loafing around.

674
00:35:14.167 --> 00:35:15.542
Why is she looking at the hair?

675
00:35:21.292 --> 00:35:22.412
Come on. we're running late.

676
00:35:23.458 --> 00:35:24.750
Come on. get on the bike.

677
00:35:25.333 --> 00:35:26.208
Why?

678
00:35:26.292 --> 00:35:27.932
Stop asking questions
and get on the bike.

679
00:35:28.167 --> 00:35:29.967
Hereafter.
I'll be dropping you off at school.

680
00:35:32.125 --> 00:35:34.458
Does that mean
Dad will pick me up in the evening?

681
00:35:37.542 --> 00:35:39.292
Your Dad is an expert pick-up artist!

682
00:35:39.792 --> 00:35:41.167
Get on the bike. girl!

683
00:35:42.292 --> 00:35:43.583
- What happened?
- I don't know.

684
00:35:45.083 --> 00:35:46.375
What did I even pick up?

685
00:35:51.292 --> 00:35:52.292
Get off the bike.

686
00:35:55.208 --> 00:35:56.208
Who is your Teacher?

687
00:35:59.708 --> 00:36:00.708
There she is.

688
00:36:02.375 --> 00:36:04.417
- Everyone. please work hard.
- Yes. Ma'am.

689
00:36:04.500 --> 00:36:05.580
Or else it'll be difficult.

690
00:36:05.708 --> 00:36:06.583
Okay?

691
00:36:06.667 --> 00:36:08.167
- Okay. bye!
- Thank you. Ma'am.

692
00:36:09.833 --> 00:36:11.234
She's not more beautiful than I am.

693
00:36:14.417 --> 00:36:15.917
Hi. Mathi!

694
00:36:16.333 --> 00:36:17.813
Didn't your Dad come to drop you off?

695
00:36:18.583 --> 00:36:20.708
Dad won't be coming.
Hereafter. Mom will be coming.

696
00:36:32.083 --> 00:36:33.083
Let's go!

697
00:36:38.750 --> 00:36:40.208
Why did you stop running?

698
00:36:41.292 --> 00:36:43.042
Enough. Coach.
I am not able to continue.

699
00:36:44.250 --> 00:36:46.375
You'll be taking part
in the South Indian Tournament.

700
00:36:46.917 --> 00:36:50.167
Even if the players are from Andhra.
Karnataka. and Telangana.

701
00:36:50.583 --> 00:36:52.333
the winner will be Keerthi.

702
00:36:54.125 --> 00:36:57.000
You're the only wrestler
who can fight her head-on.

703
00:36:57.958 --> 00:37:00.833
Still. you have lost to her seven times.

704
00:37:01.708 --> 00:37:03.500
She'll win and move to Delhi.

705
00:37:03.833 --> 00:37:05.542
But you'll be left circling locally.

706
00:37:07.500 --> 00:37:09.250
Do you want to go to Delhi
or remain local?

707
00:37:17.125 --> 00:37:22.208
And now. I request our respected
Principal Ma'am to present the prizes.

708
00:37:23.958 --> 00:37:25.500
Niranjan. swimming.

709
00:37:27.917 --> 00:37:29.458
- Well done.
- Hey. Keerthi!

710
00:37:29.875 --> 00:37:31.351
The head of your office is calling you.

711
00:37:31.375 --> 00:37:32.708
Oh! I'll meet her.

712
00:37:35.458 --> 00:37:36.875
G. Prashanth. carrom.

713
00:37:37.292 --> 00:37:39.208
- That's my son.
- That's great!

714
00:37:39.583 --> 00:37:40.904
Hold this and look at the camera.

715
00:37:41.042 --> 00:37:42.042
Very cute!

716
00:37:44.208 --> 00:37:46.529
Where's your daughter?
Didn't she participate in any sport?

717
00:37:46.583 --> 00:37:48.167
Naseer. long jump.

718
00:37:49.750 --> 00:37:51.500
Listen. where's Mathi?

719
00:37:52.292 --> 00:37:54.292
- Surprise!
- Thank you so much. sir and ma'am.

720
00:37:54.375 --> 00:37:55.833
for your lovely gestures.

721
00:37:56.208 --> 00:38:00.708
Finally. our little stars
from first grade. B section.

722
00:38:00.958 --> 00:38:01.958
are ready!

723
00:38:02.417 --> 00:38:05.292
A big applause for all of them!

724
00:38:35.208 --> 00:38:36.208
Hey!

725
00:38:36.458 --> 00:38:37.934
What's this?
Why is she dancing like this?

726
00:38:37.958 --> 00:38:39.599
This is how one could dance to this song.

727
00:39:13.875 --> 00:39:15.875
Your daughter has got great moves!

728
00:39:16.167 --> 00:39:17.167
Super!

729
00:39:31.083 --> 00:39:33.393
Even the laziest parents' kids
are winning prizes in sports.

730
00:39:33.417 --> 00:39:34.417
But you couldn't do it.

731
00:39:34.708 --> 00:39:37.083
How could you not participate
in any sports activity?

732
00:39:37.625 --> 00:39:40.708
But you can dance like a pro
with all that jazz.

733
00:39:41.750 --> 00:39:43.292
I don't know what to do with you.

734
00:39:46.750 --> 00:39:48.292
Kids generally love to dance.

735
00:39:48.792 --> 00:39:49.809
Why are you getting worked up?

736
00:39:49.833 --> 00:39:51.417
I'm not stopping her from dancing.

737
00:39:51.583 --> 00:39:53.292
But she's the daughter
of a State Champion.

738
00:39:53.542 --> 00:39:57.292
It's embarrassing for me when my
daughter doesn't participate in any sport.

739
00:39:59.000 --> 00:40:00.292
She's just in 1st grade now.

740
00:40:00.375 --> 00:40:01.458
Why hurry her with sports?

741
00:40:01.542 --> 00:40:04.000
Sports should be cultivated
from a young age.

742
00:40:04.125 --> 00:40:06.605
If you can't bend when you're 5.
you can't bend when you're 50.

743
00:40:07.667 --> 00:40:08.667
Sir!

744
00:40:09.125 --> 00:40:10.917
Yes. Teacher.

745
00:40:11.708 --> 00:40:13.667
Today. your daughter nailed it.

746
00:40:14.333 --> 00:40:16.417
- Thank you. Teacher.
- She danced well.

747
00:40:16.708 --> 00:40:18.000
Even Simran can't beat her.

748
00:40:18.417 --> 00:40:22.042
I couldn't believe
that she possesses a hidden talent.

749
00:40:22.333 --> 00:40:24.053
Please tell her mother.
She's yelling at us.

750
00:40:24.875 --> 00:40:27.333
You come to the school
only on the Annual Day.

751
00:40:27.500 --> 00:40:29.333
Please don't take me wrong.

752
00:40:29.458 --> 00:40:31.500
Your daughter may be bad at studies…

753
00:40:31.583 --> 00:40:33.125
But she's great at dancing.

754
00:40:33.958 --> 00:40:37.958
If you send her regularly for practice
and train her well

755
00:40:38.125 --> 00:40:40.292
she'll win a title
on the Jodi No.1 reality show.

756
00:40:40.500 --> 00:40:42.250
Did you say she's bad at studies?

757
00:40:42.417 --> 00:40:43.917
You sound as if you're unaware of it.

758
00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:45.667
I thought you were aware of everything.

759
00:40:45.750 --> 00:40:46.934
Teacher. please don't tell her.

760
00:40:46.958 --> 00:40:49.167
Hasn't your husband shown you
her report card yet?

761
00:40:51.917 --> 00:40:53.397
If you aren't aware. let me tell you.

762
00:40:53.458 --> 00:40:54.500
Very talkative!

763
00:41:04.750 --> 00:41:05.750
I'm leaving. Sir.

764
00:41:23.917 --> 00:41:27.333
It's my fault
that I didn't check up on her activities.

765
00:41:28.125 --> 00:41:29.625
From now on. I'll take care of her.

766
00:41:30.917 --> 00:41:33.792
Listen. starting tomorrow.
you'll begin a new life.

767
00:41:34.250 --> 00:41:35.708
Be ready at 06:00 a.m.

768
00:41:39.667 --> 00:41:40.958
New life as in?

769
00:41:56.333 --> 00:41:58.417
Uncle. the South Indian Tournament
is coming up.

770
00:41:58.625 --> 00:42:00.042
I am determined to win it.

771
00:42:00.792 --> 00:42:04.000
I don't have the time to
keep a tab on her activities.

772
00:42:04.708 --> 00:42:06.250
I can't trust anyone. either.

773
00:42:06.667 --> 00:42:08.708
- I understand.
- That's why I asked you to come over.

774
00:42:09.000 --> 00:42:10.000
Good decision!

775
00:42:10.125 --> 00:42:11.875
I forged you into a commendable wrestler.

776
00:42:12.208 --> 00:42:15.042
It's my responsibility
to forge your daughter into a champion.

777
00:42:16.083 --> 00:42:16.958
Are you rattled?

778
00:42:17.042 --> 00:42:18.667
You haven't seen my training.

779
00:42:19.458 --> 00:42:20.458
You'll watch soon!

780
00:42:21.167 --> 00:42:22.292
Hey. ready!

781
00:42:23.500 --> 00:42:24.542
<i>Poor baby!</i>

782
00:42:24.792 --> 00:42:26.958
<i>Hey. Mummy. please.</i>

783
00:42:27.417 --> 00:42:29.208
<i>You know I'm a dummy piece.</i>

784
00:42:29.292 --> 00:42:30.393
- Welcome. Madam.
- My daughter.

785
00:42:30.417 --> 00:42:31.667
Mathimalar. She's in 1st grade.

786
00:42:31.750 --> 00:42:33.542
- You must coach her.
- Sure. I'll coach her.

787
00:42:33.958 --> 00:42:35.268
Does that mean I'm not her coach?

788
00:42:35.292 --> 00:42:38.750
My mother didn't call
you here to train me.

789
00:42:39.125 --> 00:42:42.250
She called you here to be my nanny.

790
00:42:42.417 --> 00:42:46.458
<i>Like ice in the sun.
I couldn't last.</i>

791
00:42:47.250 --> 00:42:51.333
<i>Like jam on a bun
I disappeared without a trace.</i>

792
00:42:52.000 --> 00:42:56.125
<i>Like ice in the sun.
I couldn't last.</i>

793
00:42:56.875 --> 00:43:00.917
<i>Like jam on a bun
I disappeared without a trace.</i>

794
00:43:01.042 --> 00:43:03.417
Mathi! Mathi!
You're late for the training.

795
00:43:04.042 --> 00:43:05.042
Hurry up!

796
00:43:06.458 --> 00:43:08.542
<i>Are you a professional tormentor?</i>

797
00:43:08.625 --> 00:43:10.708
<i>Or are you
Adolf Hitler's granddaughter?</i>

798
00:43:10.792 --> 00:43:11.792
Come on!

799
00:43:11.833 --> 00:43:13.500
NO!

800
00:43:14.458 --> 00:43:15.583
Come on! Come on. fast!

801
00:43:17.292 --> 00:43:19.625
Mom. I'm very tired.

802
00:43:19.708 --> 00:43:21.792
Can we skip training today?

803
00:43:21.875 --> 00:43:23.708
You're a great actor like your father.

804
00:43:23.792 --> 00:43:26.875
<i>Chill. Chill. Chill Mummy Chill</i>

805
00:43:27.000 --> 00:43:32.667
<i>I Say Chill. Chill. Chill
Mummy Chill. Chill. Chill.</i>

806
00:43:33.417 --> 00:43:35.625
- Hurry up! How long would you take?
- Wait! Wait!

807
00:43:36.000 --> 00:43:37.292
Watch out! It's very hot!

808
00:43:37.583 --> 00:43:39.458
Here you go!
Millet ball with onions.

809
00:43:39.750 --> 00:43:40.667
This is your morning diet!

810
00:43:40.750 --> 00:43:42.042
She's too young to be on a diet.

811
00:43:42.167 --> 00:43:44.958
No stone becomes a statue
without enduring the craft of the chisel.

812
00:43:45.125 --> 00:43:47.917
It's obvious the chisel never touched you.

813
00:43:52.000 --> 00:43:53.417
<i>Hey. Mummy please.</i>

814
00:43:56.292 --> 00:43:57.292
Left!

815
00:43:57.708 --> 00:43:58.708
Right!

816
00:44:02.500 --> 00:44:04.542
I scream in pain and ask to be let go.

817
00:44:04.750 --> 00:44:06.458
But she never let go of me.

818
00:44:06.958 --> 00:44:08.478
You're bound to get hurt in wrestling.

819
00:44:08.583 --> 00:44:10.143
Why are you making a big deal out of it?

820
00:44:10.167 --> 00:44:14.125
Dad. is she really my birth mother?

821
00:44:16.250 --> 00:44:20.083
<i>Harry Potter. I'm your daughter
Enough with the torture!</i>

822
00:44:21.000 --> 00:44:22.958
<i>Why does a rabbit need boxing?</i>

823
00:44:23.333 --> 00:44:24.500
<i>Why does a lion need dancing?</i>

824
00:44:24.583 --> 00:44:26.500
Dad. my legs are really hurting a lot.

825
00:44:26.708 --> 00:44:28.458
I don't want to go for training tomorrow.

826
00:44:28.667 --> 00:44:30.833
Please don't say that.
Your mother will get angry.

827
00:44:31.750 --> 00:44:34.292
Why only her?
Even I know how to get angry.

828
00:44:34.500 --> 00:44:39.208
<i>I Say Chill. Chill. Chill
Mummy Chill. Chill. Chill.</i>

829
00:44:39.292 --> 00:44:40.375
Mathi. come!

830
00:44:40.542 --> 00:44:42.000
I'm coming.
Hold your horses!

831
00:44:42.292 --> 00:44:45.000
- What happened. Teacher?
- She's down with a fever.

832
00:44:45.458 --> 00:44:46.458
- Is it?
- Yeah!

833
00:44:47.708 --> 00:44:49.625
<i>You know I'm a dummy piece.</i>

834
00:44:49.833 --> 00:44:52.083
<i>Hey. Mummy please.</i>

835
00:44:52.500 --> 00:44:54.708
<i>You know I'm a dummy piece.</i>

836
00:44:56.208 --> 00:44:57.625
She was doing well in the morning.

837
00:44:58.000 --> 00:44:59.226
How come she's down with a fever now?

838
00:44:59.250 --> 00:45:00.890
She complained last night about leg pain.

839
00:45:01.000 --> 00:45:02.809
She was feeling a bit
under the weather in the morning.

840
00:45:02.833 --> 00:45:04.714
I reckon her legs weren't hurting
while dancing.

841
00:45:05.583 --> 00:45:08.384
Didn't you use to say. "When we
do something we love. it doesn't hurt."

842
00:45:10.292 --> 00:45:11.292
Oh!

843
00:45:11.917 --> 00:45:14.083
So. she likes dancing but not wrestling.

844
00:45:14.333 --> 00:45:15.333
Right?

845
00:45:15.458 --> 00:45:17.458
Whether she likes it or not
is the issue here.

846
00:45:17.542 --> 00:45:20.083
Is she learning wrestling at 6
to become a champion?

847
00:45:20.167 --> 00:45:21.500
Why are you torturing the child?

848
00:45:21.625 --> 00:45:22.625
Torturing. you say?

849
00:45:23.875 --> 00:45:25.792
No one can become a champion overnight.

850
00:45:25.958 --> 00:45:27.439
It takes years of penance to achieve.

851
00:45:28.125 --> 00:45:32.333
In China. they start training
as early as age 3 or 4.

852
00:45:32.458 --> 00:45:34.958
That's why that country tops the Olympics.

853
00:45:35.667 --> 00:45:40.167
But in India. parents like you
coddle their children…

854
00:45:40.250 --> 00:45:42.051
And that results in no medals
for our country.

855
00:45:45.250 --> 00:45:46.333
I'll call you later.

856
00:45:50.875 --> 00:45:52.375
Please bear this in mind.

857
00:45:52.583 --> 00:45:54.208
Times have changed.

858
00:45:54.500 --> 00:45:56.792
The current generation
takes everything lightly.

859
00:45:57.000 --> 00:46:00.083
However. when they encounter
a minor setback. they can't bear it.

860
00:46:00.458 --> 00:46:01.958
Willpower has gone for a toss!

861
00:46:02.417 --> 00:46:05.375
Only sports can instill discipline
and willpower in a person.

862
00:46:06.000 --> 00:46:08.167
Look. Veera. I'm repeating myself.

863
00:46:08.458 --> 00:46:10.958
enough spoiling her
with your love and pampering.

864
00:46:11.375 --> 00:46:13.167
If we let it continue.
she'll turn into you.

865
00:46:14.708 --> 00:46:17.208
I'll take care of her education
and career.

866
00:46:18.292 --> 00:46:19.542
You handle the household.

867
00:46:28.000 --> 00:46:30.333
Veera. is there a problem?

868
00:46:39.583 --> 00:46:40.875
She went overboard. Coach.

869
00:46:41.375 --> 00:46:43.351
She's accusing me of saying
our daughter will become like me.

870
00:46:43.375 --> 00:46:45.000
Why can't she turn out like me?

871
00:46:45.458 --> 00:46:46.458
Let it go. Veera.

872
00:46:46.625 --> 00:46:48.225
Stress is the root cause of the problem.

873
00:46:48.750 --> 00:46:49.833
What are you saying?

874
00:46:50.833 --> 00:46:52.875
See. It's not just Keerthi…

875
00:46:53.500 --> 00:46:56.750
Any sports champion
experiences high stress.

876
00:46:56.917 --> 00:46:59.125
However. those who can't handle the stress

877
00:46:59.375 --> 00:47:02.042
have disappeared from sports
without a trace.

878
00:47:03.167 --> 00:47:04.958
I don't understand what you're saying.

879
00:47:06.167 --> 00:47:08.708
You see. Keerthi gets angry a lot.

880
00:47:08.875 --> 00:47:10.000
You're right. Coach.

881
00:47:10.125 --> 00:47:12.417
Stress is the main factor behind anger.

882
00:47:12.833 --> 00:47:14.353
When you get angry. your BP shoots up.

883
00:47:14.500 --> 00:47:17.667
If BP shoots up.
it'll cause more health problems.

884
00:47:18.750 --> 00:47:20.917
If that happens.
then she must forget about wrestling.

885
00:47:21.042 --> 00:47:22.042
Oh. no!

886
00:47:22.417 --> 00:47:24.625
Of course!
Health is important for players.

887
00:47:24.792 --> 00:47:25.792
That's crucial!

888
00:47:26.708 --> 00:47:29.708
Now what do we do. Coach?
Matches are lined up for her.

889
00:47:29.958 --> 00:47:31.667
How do we bring down
her stress and anger?

890
00:47:32.208 --> 00:47:35.083
If you attend counseling.
everything will be alright.

891
00:47:35.833 --> 00:47:38.208
What's counseling?
And where do we attend it?

892
00:47:39.292 --> 00:47:41.792
There's a famous psychiatrist
named Benjamin Kutty.

893
00:47:43.750 --> 00:47:45.830
<i>You guys consult him.
and everything will be alright.</i>

894
00:47:47.292 --> 00:47:48.417
Tell it's for the child.

895
00:47:48.625 --> 00:47:50.083
Only then will Keerthi step out.

896
00:47:52.042 --> 00:47:53.042
You're right. Coach!

897
00:47:53.542 --> 00:47:55.208
You two. please step outside for a while.

898
00:47:55.917 --> 00:47:56.917
Why?

899
00:47:57.292 --> 00:47:58.476
I don't know what's going to happen.

900
00:47:58.500 --> 00:48:00.208
Why are you sending them outside?

901
00:48:00.333 --> 00:48:02.958
- They both need counseling.
- I will get to it.

902
00:48:03.250 --> 00:48:04.250
Please sit down.

903
00:48:09.125 --> 00:48:11.833
Do you know what Sigmund Freud quoted?

904
00:48:12.125 --> 00:48:13.500
"Anger is a messenger."

905
00:48:13.833 --> 00:48:14.833
It means…

906
00:48:15.083 --> 00:48:17.750
Anger is nothing but a messenger.

907
00:48:18.208 --> 00:48:19.875
It's trying to convey something to us.

908
00:48:20.167 --> 00:48:21.833
Doctor. why are you explaining it to me?

909
00:48:21.917 --> 00:48:23.875
The water inside the pressure cooker…

910
00:48:24.375 --> 00:48:27.458
Keeps boiling up like this.

911
00:48:27.792 --> 00:48:29.083
If the cooker is faulty…

912
00:48:29.875 --> 00:48:30.875
It'll explode!

913
00:48:31.250 --> 00:48:32.667
It bursts!

914
00:48:33.167 --> 00:48:35.125
Hey. idiot!
Have you gone mad?

915
00:48:35.208 --> 00:48:37.417
Don't you get it? I have no issues.

916
00:48:41.000 --> 00:48:43.458
Every patient who comes here
claims the same.

917
00:48:43.625 --> 00:48:45.750
Once we start the treatment
everything will be fine.

918
00:48:48.792 --> 00:48:50.375
- Get lost!
- Come on. catch her!

919
00:48:50.917 --> 00:48:53.625
No. no. no!
Don't be silly like a kid!

920
00:48:53.917 --> 00:48:55.125
Hey. hold her properly.

921
00:48:55.583 --> 00:48:58.333
- Let go of me.
- It's nothing. It's a small injection.

922
00:49:03.333 --> 00:49:04.458
Oh. no!

923
00:49:10.125 --> 00:49:11.208
Let go of me!

924
00:49:22.833 --> 00:49:24.034
<i>What do you think of yourself?</i>

925
00:49:24.375 --> 00:49:26.776
I took you to a psychiatrist
to get your anger under control.

926
00:49:27.125 --> 00:49:28.965
There you broke his furniture
and caused chaos.

927
00:49:30.083 --> 00:49:32.417
So that's your plan
to control my anger?

928
00:49:33.333 --> 00:49:35.625
Does my concern for my daughter
look like anger to you?

929
00:49:35.708 --> 00:49:36.708
Dear. calm down.

930
00:49:36.750 --> 00:49:38.226
Didn't you lie that it's for our child?

931
00:49:38.250 --> 00:49:40.042
Our child has no issues.

932
00:49:40.750 --> 00:49:42.471
It's you who has been
short-tempered lately.

933
00:49:43.000 --> 00:49:44.500
And your anger is affecting her.

934
00:49:44.833 --> 00:49:47.792
A child should be afraid of
at least one parent.

935
00:49:48.167 --> 00:49:49.167
She's not afraid of you.

936
00:49:49.333 --> 00:49:50.768
That's why I'm being the strict parent.

937
00:49:50.792 --> 00:49:53.167
Just because you're a champion
doesn't mean you're right.

938
00:49:53.333 --> 00:49:54.750
Life is different from sports.

939
00:49:55.000 --> 00:49:57.708
To me. sports and life are the same.

940
00:49:58.167 --> 00:49:59.727
I'm saying this to benefit your career.

941
00:50:00.042 --> 00:50:01.208
Why don't you understand?

942
00:50:04.500 --> 00:50:06.167
You'll understand when you face defeat.

943
00:50:06.542 --> 00:50:08.083
You never seem to understand.

944
00:50:08.375 --> 00:50:09.458
What did you just say now?

945
00:50:11.083 --> 00:50:13.208
"I'll understand when I face defeat."

946
00:50:14.583 --> 00:50:15.750
So. you want me to lose?

947
00:50:16.708 --> 00:50:17.708
Isn't that what you want?

948
00:50:18.500 --> 00:50:19.708
That's not how I meant it.

949
00:50:19.792 --> 00:50:21.042
What did you mean then?

950
00:50:21.208 --> 00:50:22.292
Keerthi. let it go!

951
00:50:22.667 --> 00:50:24.125
- He did not mean it that way…
- He…

952
00:50:24.250 --> 00:50:26.333
- Did you not hear him?
- I did!

953
00:50:26.458 --> 00:50:28.000
"I'll understand when I face defeat."

954
00:50:28.250 --> 00:50:29.167
Do you want me to lose?

955
00:50:29.250 --> 00:50:30.625
- Answer me!
- He said it in a flow.

956
00:50:30.708 --> 00:50:32.309
That doesn't mean he could say anything.

957
00:50:32.917 --> 00:50:35.000
I think I'm going mad!

958
00:50:35.375 --> 00:50:37.292
That's why I took you to the psychiatrist.

959
00:50:43.000 --> 00:50:45.500
As it is.
being a husband to a woman isn't easy.

960
00:50:45.875 --> 00:50:48.042
I can't even begin to imagine
if it's a sportswoman…

961
00:50:48.792 --> 00:50:51.042
Hmm… I wonder how you manage.

962
00:50:53.375 --> 00:50:54.917
Why don't we try another technique?

963
00:50:55.500 --> 00:50:59.625
There's a medicine in Ayurveda to
bring anger and stress under control.

964
00:51:00.042 --> 00:51:02.002
It doesn't matter.
She wouldn't come anywhere now.

965
00:51:02.167 --> 00:51:03.708
She doesn't have to come anywhere.

966
00:51:04.000 --> 00:51:05.000
Then how's it possible?

967
00:51:11.958 --> 00:51:14.375
It's 3.500 rupees for the medicine.

968
00:51:14.792 --> 00:51:16.042
How do we take this?

969
00:51:16.250 --> 00:51:17.875
You can mix it in your food.

970
00:51:18.000 --> 00:51:19.458
Or you could mix it in the milk.

971
00:51:21.333 --> 00:51:23.375
How does it work
when we consume this medicine?

972
00:51:24.542 --> 00:51:26.143
For that. you must study
medicine for 5 years.

973
00:51:26.167 --> 00:51:27.167
Would you like to?

974
00:51:31.417 --> 00:51:32.708
Yes. Doctor. how are you?

975
00:51:33.167 --> 00:51:34.542
You met them at the temple. is it?

976
00:51:34.875 --> 00:51:35.750
Bye. Doctor.

977
00:51:35.833 --> 00:51:37.875
Only after visiting
other rituals would follow.

978
00:51:38.500 --> 00:51:41.042
Let me know how you got lucky.
I've been trying for 15 years.

979
00:51:57.333 --> 00:51:58.333
Aren't you eating?

980
00:51:58.417 --> 00:52:00.167
I'll eat later. You eat now.

981
00:52:00.708 --> 00:52:01.833
Here. have some egg.

982
00:52:05.208 --> 00:52:06.208
It tastes good!

983
00:52:07.083 --> 00:52:08.083
Keerthi!

984
00:52:08.708 --> 00:52:11.583
It's a good thing you started
training your daughter at an early age.

985
00:52:11.708 --> 00:52:12.583
Very good!

986
00:52:12.667 --> 00:52:14.375
But my husband is against it.

987
00:52:14.750 --> 00:52:16.500
Don't take me wrong.

988
00:52:16.833 --> 00:52:19.000
But your husband is uneducated.

989
00:52:19.375 --> 00:52:21.375
We should make him understand
the importance of it.

990
00:52:21.458 --> 00:52:22.458
Lock. lock me.

991
00:52:22.792 --> 00:52:23.958
Move quickly. Ready?

992
00:52:24.292 --> 00:52:25.292
Good! Good!

993
00:52:25.625 --> 00:52:26.833
Keep moving. Keep Moving.

994
00:52:26.958 --> 00:52:28.125
Concentrate! Concentrate!

995
00:52:34.000 --> 00:52:35.250
Isn't it unrefined cane sugar?

996
00:52:36.125 --> 00:52:37.667
Then why does it taste weird?

997
00:52:37.958 --> 00:52:39.479
It's organic.
That's how it will taste.

998
00:52:47.042 --> 00:52:48.708
Keerthi. your lunch is ready.

999
00:52:53.375 --> 00:52:54.458
What happened?

1000
00:52:55.750 --> 00:52:57.458
This is our hereditary plate.

1001
00:52:58.208 --> 00:52:59.417
Hereditary plate?

1002
00:53:01.167 --> 00:53:02.875
Good. good. good. Come on!

1003
00:53:05.458 --> 00:53:07.542
What happened. Keerthi?
Are you okay?

1004
00:53:13.042 --> 00:53:14.750
What are you mixing in the milk?

1005
00:53:16.375 --> 00:53:18.417
For the past two days.
my stomach has been upset.

1006
00:53:18.583 --> 00:53:21.042
Me too. I have diarrhea.

1007
00:53:21.333 --> 00:53:22.667
Let me try if this helps.

1008
00:53:26.708 --> 00:53:27.958
It's delicious!

1009
00:53:33.417 --> 00:53:35.000
Come on. lock him.
Lock him!

1010
00:53:39.167 --> 00:53:40.667
Please let me practice with girls.

1011
00:53:41.208 --> 00:53:43.542
Keerthi not only practices in the academy.

1012
00:53:43.667 --> 00:53:45.667
But at home.
she practices with her husband.

1013
00:53:45.750 --> 00:53:48.208
That's why she is able to
win matches against girls.

1014
00:53:48.792 --> 00:53:50.750
Do you wish to go to Delhi or not?

1015
00:53:52.083 --> 00:53:53.083
<i>Wait I'll get it for you.</i>

1016
00:53:57.292 --> 00:53:59.333
She's not eating.
Do we have pickles?

1017
00:53:59.875 --> 00:54:00.875
Wait a second.

1018
00:54:02.667 --> 00:54:04.750
- Where did I keep it?
- What is this?

1019
00:54:09.250 --> 00:54:11.083
It's a herbal powder.

1020
00:54:12.375 --> 00:54:13.792
Mathi often catches a cold.

1021
00:54:14.083 --> 00:54:15.167
It's for her immunity.

1022
00:54:15.250 --> 00:54:17.250
Oh! Why did you store it
in a ceramic jar?

1023
00:54:17.667 --> 00:54:19.375
If we leave it outside.
ants will spoil it.

1024
00:54:19.625 --> 00:54:20.825
- So. I stored it in there.
- Oh!

1025
00:54:21.875 --> 00:54:22.875
Here you go.

1026
00:54:25.625 --> 00:54:26.958
That was a close call.

1027
00:54:37.792 --> 00:54:39.667
Coach. the medications are working well.

1028
00:54:50.208 --> 00:54:51.208
Let's go!

1029
00:54:53.042 --> 00:54:54.167
Wait. I'm getting a call.

1030
00:54:55.333 --> 00:54:56.333
Who's calling?

1031
00:54:57.000 --> 00:54:58.000
Hello!

1032
00:54:58.542 --> 00:54:59.625
Yeah. it's me. Veera.

1033
00:55:00.250 --> 00:55:01.250
When?

1034
00:55:02.583 --> 00:55:03.792
Okay. I'll think about it.

1035
00:55:04.333 --> 00:55:05.333
Who was it. Dad?

1036
00:55:05.875 --> 00:55:08.292
A cooking show is taking place
in Coimbatore tomorrow.

1037
00:55:08.667 --> 00:55:09.958
If I win this competition

1038
00:55:10.042 --> 00:55:12.125
I will get the "Best Cook Award"
of this district.

1039
00:55:12.458 --> 00:55:15.583
They chose me as a contestant
based on my Behindwoods interview.

1040
00:55:15.667 --> 00:55:16.750
Hey. that's great!

1041
00:55:16.833 --> 00:55:18.500
That cooking show is my favorite.

1042
00:55:18.583 --> 00:55:21.292
I cook well.
Take me as well. Please!

1043
00:55:22.000 --> 00:55:23.441
Unfortunately. even I can't make it.

1044
00:55:23.542 --> 00:55:25.042
Keerthi has a match tomorrow.

1045
00:55:25.208 --> 00:55:27.250
Will Dad appear on TV?

1046
00:55:27.375 --> 00:55:28.458
Definitely!

1047
00:55:28.667 --> 00:55:30.792
That show is every household's favorite.

1048
00:55:31.083 --> 00:55:33.084
And your Dad will appear
on every TV in every home.

1049
00:55:33.125 --> 00:55:35.917
Why not. Dad?
You go ahead and take part in the show.

1050
00:55:36.000 --> 00:55:37.583
Hey. it's Mom's match tomorrow.

1051
00:55:37.750 --> 00:55:40.125
Mom has matches all year.

1052
00:55:40.250 --> 00:55:43.250
Moreover. it's not like it's final.

1053
00:55:43.375 --> 00:55:44.667
It's just the first round.

1054
00:55:45.125 --> 00:55:47.833
For me. you must take part in this show

1055
00:55:47.917 --> 00:55:49.417
and win a prize. Dad.

1056
00:55:50.000 --> 00:55:51.542
Why are you so enthused about it?

1057
00:55:52.000 --> 00:55:55.125
So. I could ask Deepak and Darshan.

1058
00:55:55.583 --> 00:55:59.500
"My Dad was on TV.
Were your Dads ever on TV?"

1059
00:55:59.583 --> 00:56:00.864
Everyone's got their own agenda.

1060
00:56:01.458 --> 00:56:04.208
Promise me that you'll win the prize.

1061
00:56:04.708 --> 00:56:05.708
Do it!

1062
00:56:07.375 --> 00:56:08.667
Fine. no need for a promise.

1063
00:56:09.000 --> 00:56:11.917
I will do my best
to take part in the show.

1064
00:56:12.167 --> 00:56:13.167
Okay?

1065
00:56:19.375 --> 00:56:20.542
Let's tell Mom about it.

1066
00:56:22.958 --> 00:56:23.958
Don't tell her yet.

1067
00:56:24.000 --> 00:56:25.333
If you do. she won't let you go.

1068
00:56:25.583 --> 00:56:27.684
If we don't tell her.
she'll yell at me when she sees me on TV.

1069
00:56:27.708 --> 00:56:29.250
When she yells. we'll handle it.

1070
00:56:29.417 --> 00:56:30.833
What are you guys whispering about?

1071
00:56:30.917 --> 00:56:31.957
Why aren't we leaving yet?

1072
00:56:32.125 --> 00:56:33.917
You take Keerthi and go ahead.

1073
00:56:34.042 --> 00:56:35.393
I'll bring Mathi and follow you later.

1074
00:56:35.417 --> 00:56:36.417
Okay!

1075
00:56:36.875 --> 00:56:38.292
Dear. let's go.

1076
00:56:38.375 --> 00:56:39.542
Let them go first.

1077
00:56:42.833 --> 00:56:44.875
- She left! Let's go now.
- Come on. let's go!

1078
00:56:45.375 --> 00:56:46.375
Keerthi!

1079
00:56:46.417 --> 00:56:48.875
We're getting ready to watch your match.

1080
00:56:49.000 --> 00:56:50.333
You must rock it today.

1081
00:56:50.458 --> 00:56:51.458
Thanks. Auntie.

1082
00:56:51.542 --> 00:56:53.000
- All the best. Keerthi!
- Bye!

1083
00:56:56.792 --> 00:56:57.792
<i>Hi. Hello. Vanakkam!</i>

1084
00:56:57.875 --> 00:57:01.500
You're watching Your Kovai Kitchen.
Taste of Coimbatore.

1085
00:57:03.500 --> 00:57:04.601
- Welcome. Sir.
- Where do I leave my phone?

1086
00:57:04.625 --> 00:57:05.833
- Leave it here.
- Over here?

1087
00:57:07.458 --> 00:57:08.458
Let's go!

1088
00:57:09.083 --> 00:57:10.750
And the final contestant for the day…

1089
00:57:10.958 --> 00:57:12.250
Let's welcome. Veera

1090
00:57:12.333 --> 00:57:14.167
and Meenu!

1091
00:57:17.083 --> 00:57:20.458
Not bad. you came to our show
with your wife and kid.

1092
00:57:20.542 --> 00:57:21.750
Oh. she's not my wife.

1093
00:57:21.833 --> 00:57:23.583
- She's my daughter's class teacher.
- Oh!

1094
00:57:23.875 --> 00:57:26.075
Why did you bring your
daughter's teacher to stir gravy?

1095
00:57:26.292 --> 00:57:27.625
She's here for moral support.

1096
00:57:27.958 --> 00:57:29.199
They have a good understanding.

1097
00:57:29.250 --> 00:57:30.809
But it may cause a
misunderstanding in their family.

1098
00:57:30.833 --> 00:57:35.292
<i>South Indian Wrestling Tournament
is about to begin.</i>

1099
00:57:35.375 --> 00:57:40.833
<i>First to fight are Regina in red tracks
and Keerthi in Blue tracks.</i>

1100
00:57:40.917 --> 00:57:41.917
Come on. start!

1101
00:57:42.042 --> 00:57:45.375
<i>The umpire has blown the whistle
to kick start the fight.</i>

1102
00:57:45.458 --> 00:57:47.351
- Come on. Keerthi.
<i>- Both are putting up an equal fight.</i>

1103
00:57:47.375 --> 00:57:49.875
- Keerthi. come on!
<i>- Which fighter will score the first point?</i>

1104
00:57:49.958 --> 00:57:51.708
Don't let go of the grip.
Slam her!

1105
00:57:53.250 --> 00:57:54.375
That's about it!

1106
00:57:54.458 --> 00:57:58.083
<i>Keerthi is leading by 4 points
after using the back throw technique.</i>

1107
00:57:58.417 --> 00:58:01.708
<i>Keerthi continues to show her prowess.</i>

1108
00:58:02.000 --> 00:58:04.375
<i>She's leading with 4 points.</i>

1109
00:58:04.792 --> 00:58:06.792
Your time starts now!

1110
00:58:08.750 --> 00:58:10.184
Hey. everyone. make sure
you're with your own wives.

1111
00:58:10.208 --> 00:58:12.000
Here you go.
The vegetables are out there.

1112
00:58:12.292 --> 00:58:13.292
Here. wear it.

1113
00:58:21.917 --> 00:58:24.292
<i>- Both are attacking each other.</i>
- Hold her down.

1114
00:58:24.375 --> 00:58:26.292
<i>Regina is going for a flip throw.</i>

1115
00:58:26.375 --> 00:58:30.042
<i>Regina did a flip throw
and scored 4 points. tying the score.</i>

1116
00:58:30.417 --> 00:58:31.458
Nice one!

1117
00:58:32.958 --> 00:58:37.708
<i>Keerthi and Regina are at 4 point each.</i>

1118
00:58:37.958 --> 00:58:39.667
<i>Red. 4. Blue. 4.</i>

1119
00:58:41.708 --> 00:58:43.458
<i>- Keerthi is trying to attack.</i>
- Come on!

1120
00:58:43.583 --> 00:58:47.042
- Come on!
<i>- Regina has locked Keerthi from behind.</i>

1121
00:58:47.167 --> 00:58:48.875
<i>Now Keerthi makes her counter move…</i>

1122
00:58:49.792 --> 00:58:53.458
<i>- Keerthi is now leading…</i>
- That was an amazing slam!

1123
00:59:01.042 --> 00:59:04.458
<i>Not sure why Keerthi is staggering.</i>

1124
00:59:04.542 --> 00:59:07.500
<i>Only 1 minutes and 30 seconds are left.</i>

1125
00:59:07.667 --> 00:59:10.333
<i>Right now Keerthi is at 8 points.</i>

1126
00:59:10.417 --> 00:59:13.125
<i>And Regina is at 4 points.</i>

1127
00:59:16.708 --> 00:59:18.625
Wow! It smells yummy!

1128
00:59:18.875 --> 00:59:20.268
Yes. I ground it in Ammi (grinder).

1129
00:59:20.292 --> 00:59:22.750
- She meant yummy. not Ammi.
- Dad. hurry up.

1130
00:59:23.458 --> 00:59:26.500
You have the last 30 minutes left
to finish cooking.

1131
00:59:26.750 --> 00:59:27.625
Hurry up. Teacher.

1132
00:59:27.708 --> 00:59:28.708
Oh. no!

1133
00:59:29.083 --> 00:59:30.083
Hey. hey!

1134
00:59:30.250 --> 00:59:31.250
Careful!

1135
00:59:31.458 --> 00:59:32.458
Dear!

1136
00:59:33.833 --> 00:59:34.833
Attack her!

1137
00:59:36.083 --> 00:59:37.083
Attack!

1138
00:59:37.125 --> 00:59:39.875
<i>Keerthi's uncle is encouraging her.</i>

1139
00:59:40.333 --> 00:59:41.583
Don't lose your grip.

1140
00:59:45.292 --> 00:59:49.167
<i>Regina mustering up her strength.
with front lock and threw her away.</i>

1141
00:59:49.292 --> 00:59:51.000
<i>With this Regina has gained 4 points.</i>

1142
00:59:51.083 --> 00:59:56.958
<i>Once again the points are equal at 8 each.</i>

1143
00:59:57.500 --> 01:00:00.083
<i>Regina once again does the Dhobi Throw.</i>

1144
01:00:00.250 --> 01:00:02.833
<i>Regina scores another 4 points.
making her score 12 now.</i>

1145
01:00:02.917 --> 01:00:04.500
Get up! Get up!

1146
01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:06.792
<i>Regina is in the lead now.</i>

1147
01:00:06.875 --> 01:00:07.875
Oh. no!

1148
01:00:08.875 --> 01:00:09.875
Keerthi!

1149
01:00:11.292 --> 01:00:12.167
Get up!

1150
01:00:12.292 --> 01:00:16.167
<i>Will the undefeated champion
Keerthi recover?</i>

1151
01:00:21.792 --> 01:00:25.125
<i>Time has ended
and the umpire has blown the whistle.</i>

1152
01:00:25.292 --> 01:00:29.708
<i>Based on the points Regina has been
declared as the winner of this match.</i>

1153
01:00:29.792 --> 01:00:30.875
Yes!

1154
01:00:44.500 --> 01:00:45.625
Oh. no!

1155
01:00:59.792 --> 01:01:00.792
Don't cry!

1156
01:01:01.042 --> 01:01:02.642
We'll make it up in the next tournament.

1157
01:01:03.208 --> 01:01:04.417
What happened. Keerthi?

1158
01:01:04.625 --> 01:01:05.792
This is not your game!

1159
01:01:05.875 --> 01:01:07.042
It's very disappointing.

1160
01:01:07.208 --> 01:01:08.248
I don't understand either.

1161
01:01:08.417 --> 01:01:09.792
She's unlikely to lose like this.

1162
01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:11.000
Let it go. dear.

1163
01:01:11.625 --> 01:01:12.625
- Coach!
- Yeah!

1164
01:01:18.042 --> 01:01:20.208
No! There's been a mistake.

1165
01:01:20.500 --> 01:01:21.809
This report does not belong to Keerthi.

1166
01:01:21.833 --> 01:01:23.292
Coach. this is Keerthi's report.

1167
01:01:23.625 --> 01:01:24.667
Why? Why happened?

1168
01:01:26.333 --> 01:01:28.208
Players usually undergo a dope test.

1169
01:01:28.458 --> 01:01:31.167
Keerthi's report states
there were steroids in her bloodstream.

1170
01:01:36.167 --> 01:01:39.917
Keerthi. did you take any painkillers
over the past couple of days?

1171
01:01:42.917 --> 01:01:46.250
Did you make any changes
to your food supplements?

1172
01:01:46.333 --> 01:01:49.000
No. Sir.
She follows a home-cooked diet.

1173
01:01:49.083 --> 01:01:51.723
Does that mean there were any changes
made in the home-cooked diet?

1174
01:01:52.042 --> 01:01:53.875
Son-in-law is the one who cooks at home.

1175
01:01:54.583 --> 01:01:55.708
He…

1176
01:01:55.792 --> 01:01:57.625
Where's Veera?
How come he's not here?

1177
01:01:59.792 --> 01:02:00.792
Wait!

1178
01:02:09.458 --> 01:02:11.250
It's ringing. but he's not answering.

1179
01:02:11.792 --> 01:02:13.042
I wonder where he went.

1180
01:02:21.917 --> 01:02:22.917
What are you looking for?

1181
01:02:27.292 --> 01:02:28.667
Tell me. I'll find it for you.

1182
01:02:29.458 --> 01:02:30.458
Keerthi!

1183
01:02:38.667 --> 01:02:39.958
Why are there so many packets?

1184
01:02:45.125 --> 01:02:46.125
<i>What's this?</i>

1185
01:02:47.333 --> 01:02:48.333
<i>Herbal powder.</i>

1186
01:02:55.000 --> 01:02:56.250
Ask them to test this thing.

1187
01:02:56.333 --> 01:02:57.694
I would like to know what's in it.

1188
01:03:00.875 --> 01:03:02.000
<i>Your time is up!</i>

1189
01:03:18.333 --> 01:03:19.500
Here. take a look at it.

1190
01:03:19.958 --> 01:03:20.958
Look!

1191
01:03:23.792 --> 01:03:25.333
Your suspicion was right.

1192
01:03:25.917 --> 01:03:27.708
Steroids has been mixed in that powder.

1193
01:03:29.500 --> 01:03:30.542
What happened. Keerthi?

1194
01:03:34.333 --> 01:03:35.792
The report says it's positive.

1195
01:03:43.625 --> 01:03:44.875
<i>It tastes weird.</i>

1196
01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:46.761
<i>It's organic.
It's supposed to taste like it.</i>

1197
01:03:46.958 --> 01:03:48.351
I can't believe Veera could do this.

1198
01:03:48.375 --> 01:03:50.667
He's the first person to wish
for Keerthi's victory.

1199
01:03:51.083 --> 01:03:52.667
How could you all suspect him?

1200
01:03:52.792 --> 01:03:54.625
Hey. shut up! Take a look at this.

1201
01:03:55.542 --> 01:03:57.101
I had many videos.
so I missed out on this.

1202
01:03:57.125 --> 01:03:58.667
Look at him mixing meds in food.

1203
01:04:02.958 --> 01:04:04.708
What more proof do we need?

1204
01:04:06.083 --> 01:04:08.458
He'd be the first to show up
at Keerthi's matches.

1205
01:04:08.583 --> 01:04:09.623
But he did not come today.

1206
01:04:10.083 --> 01:04:11.542
Also. he's not answering his phone.

1207
01:04:12.750 --> 01:04:14.583
<i>Your father is indeed a house husband.</i>

1208
01:04:14.917 --> 01:04:16.750
<i>If it continues she'll end up like you.</i>

1209
01:04:19.708 --> 01:04:21.458
<i>You'll understand when you face defeat.</i>

1210
01:04:23.542 --> 01:04:27.625
He could not face you.
So. he went into hiding.

1211
01:04:28.208 --> 01:04:29.083
- I called him many times.
- Sir!

1212
01:04:29.167 --> 01:04:30.042
He didn't answer.

1213
01:04:30.167 --> 01:04:32.292
Sir. he did not disappear.
Look over here.

1214
01:04:32.375 --> 01:04:33.375
<i>Here. taste this as well.</i>

1215
01:04:34.125 --> 01:04:36.583
- Please try this salad.
- I don't eat vegetarian food today.

1216
01:04:39.750 --> 01:04:40.667
What are these dishes called?

1217
01:04:40.750 --> 01:04:43.667
Raw Tamarind Rasam.
Fish fry. parboiled red rice.

1218
01:04:43.750 --> 01:04:45.917
Millet ball. Chintamani chicken gravy.

1219
01:04:46.000 --> 01:04:47.458
Coconut cakes and pickled chicken.

1220
01:04:50.208 --> 01:04:53.500
In today's competition.
everyone did their best.

1221
01:04:53.708 --> 01:04:55.250
The competition was tough.

1222
01:04:55.417 --> 01:04:58.333
But in a competition.
there's only one winner.

1223
01:04:58.583 --> 01:05:02.208
Veera and Meenu
are the title winners today.

1224
01:05:03.000 --> 01:05:05.375
Yayy!

1225
01:05:08.625 --> 01:05:10.250
Oh. no!

1226
01:05:11.875 --> 01:05:12.875
Yes!

1227
01:05:15.833 --> 01:05:18.375
<i>Veera. how do you manage
to cook such tasty dishes?</i>

1228
01:05:18.542 --> 01:05:20.583
My wife Keerthi is my inspiration to cook.

1229
01:05:21.125 --> 01:05:23.542
I want my wife to scale heights in sports.

1230
01:05:23.750 --> 01:05:26.500
So I sent her to the ground
and took charge of the kitchen.

1231
01:05:26.708 --> 01:05:29.417
<i>I researched nutritious food
and started cooking for her.</i>

1232
01:05:29.583 --> 01:05:30.667
<i>No matter what I cook</i>

1233
01:05:30.833 --> 01:05:32.474
<i>she eats it without asking any questions.</i>

1234
01:05:33.667 --> 01:05:34.958
She trusts me a lot.

1235
01:05:35.167 --> 01:05:37.476
- But you broke her trust.
<i>- To be blessed with a husband like Veera</i>

1236
01:05:37.500 --> 01:05:38.708
<i>his wife is a lucky person.</i>

1237
01:05:38.792 --> 01:05:39.792
<i>All the best. Veera!</i>

1238
01:05:39.875 --> 01:05:41.250
<i>- You're the real winner.</i>
- Keerthi!

1239
01:05:42.000 --> 01:05:43.167
Thank you! Thank you!

1240
01:06:04.208 --> 01:06:06.458
Keerthi. I won a title
in the cooking show.

1241
01:06:07.167 --> 01:06:08.567
They gave me the "Best Cook" award.

1242
01:06:12.125 --> 01:06:14.205
After what you did.
how dare you show off your award?

1243
01:06:15.375 --> 01:06:16.809
- What are you looking at?
- What's happening?

1244
01:06:16.833 --> 01:06:18.500
What happened? What did I do?

1245
01:06:18.708 --> 01:06:20.250
You don't know what you did?

1246
01:06:20.917 --> 01:06:21.917
Hand it to me.

1247
01:06:23.417 --> 01:06:24.417
See what you've done.

1248
01:06:24.833 --> 01:06:27.875
<i>At the very first round
of the South India Wrestling Tournament</i>

1249
01:06:27.958 --> 01:06:30.333
<i>wrestler Keerthi lost to wrestler Regina.</i>

1250
01:06:30.625 --> 01:06:31.750
How did you lose?

1251
01:06:31.833 --> 01:06:33.833
<i>A blood test taken
after the match reported</i>

1252
01:06:33.917 --> 01:06:36.375
<i>that Keerthi had taken
a performance drug.</i>

1253
01:06:36.458 --> 01:06:38.875
<i>This news has rattled the world of sports.</i>

1254
01:06:40.292 --> 01:06:41.292
Performance drug?

1255
01:06:46.667 --> 01:06:50.667
<i>Wrestler Keerthi is banned for a year
for using a performance drug.</i>

1256
01:06:51.958 --> 01:06:53.638
<i>The Sports Federation has issued an order.</i>

1257
01:06:59.583 --> 01:07:01.125
Keerthi. what does it mean?

1258
01:07:03.250 --> 01:07:04.625
Keerthi!

1259
01:07:05.208 --> 01:07:06.208
Damn you!

1260
01:07:11.833 --> 01:07:13.125
Isn't this what you expected?

1261
01:07:14.500 --> 01:07:17.292
When you said
only defeat will teach me a lesson…

1262
01:07:17.833 --> 01:07:20.042
I thought you said it in a fit of anger.

1263
01:07:21.625 --> 01:07:26.125
But I never expected you to do this to me.

1264
01:07:26.417 --> 01:07:27.458
I did not. Keerthi.

1265
01:07:27.542 --> 01:07:28.583
In the end.

1266
01:07:29.167 --> 01:07:32.375
you still are holding on to that male ego.

1267
01:07:33.583 --> 01:07:37.042
Your male ego
has ruined my career for good.

1268
01:07:38.542 --> 01:07:40.375
How do I explain it to you?

1269
01:07:42.083 --> 01:07:43.083
Keethy. I did not…

1270
01:07:43.125 --> 01:07:44.792
Who would in this world…

1271
01:07:46.042 --> 01:07:48.792
Would mix steroids in his wife's food?

1272
01:07:48.917 --> 01:07:49.917
Steroid?

1273
01:07:50.917 --> 01:07:53.167
I don't want to see you anymore.

1274
01:07:54.792 --> 01:07:56.417
- Go away!
- Keerthi. hear me out.

1275
01:07:56.500 --> 01:07:58.393
I didn't know how steroids got mixed
into that medicine.

1276
01:07:58.417 --> 01:07:59.917
Leave my daughter and me alone.

1277
01:08:01.000 --> 01:08:02.000
Sweetie!

1278
01:08:02.042 --> 01:08:03.917
Keerthi! Keerthi!

1279
01:08:16.250 --> 01:08:18.542
Keerthi. I don't know
what really happened.

1280
01:08:18.708 --> 01:08:20.333
I didn't do it on purpose.

1281
01:08:20.750 --> 01:08:21.750
Keerthi!

1282
01:09:09.875 --> 01:09:12.500
I thought Veera was a good husband.
How could he do this to you?

1283
01:09:12.833 --> 01:09:14.476
When it comes to a husband.
there is no good or bad.

1284
01:09:14.500 --> 01:09:15.820
A husband is always a bad person.

1285
01:09:16.125 --> 01:09:18.417
He always put up an act
encouraging the wife

1286
01:09:18.583 --> 01:09:20.864
and stabbed her in the back
at her crucial moment in life.

1287
01:09:21.458 --> 01:09:22.458
<i>Well done. Son!</i>

1288
01:09:23.000 --> 01:09:25.375
Until now. I misunderstood you.

1289
01:09:25.583 --> 01:09:28.125
That you've become henpecked
like the rest of the men.

1290
01:09:28.542 --> 01:09:29.726
But you struck her at the right time.

1291
01:09:29.750 --> 01:09:31.417
I'm proud of you!

1292
01:09:31.958 --> 01:09:32.958
You got it wrong. Uncle.

1293
01:09:33.167 --> 01:09:34.500
I did not do it on purpose.

1294
01:09:34.583 --> 01:09:37.458
Even if you did it on purpose.
there's nothing wrong with it.

1295
01:09:37.792 --> 01:09:40.542
Women like her deserve this behavior.
Truly deserve it.

1296
01:09:41.625 --> 01:09:43.750
We had a grandfather. Kanniappan.

1297
01:09:43.875 --> 01:09:46.125
He used to work in Burma.
You may have heard about him.

1298
01:09:46.250 --> 01:09:47.667
- I have!
- Yeah!

1299
01:09:47.792 --> 01:09:49.375
How do you think his wife died?

1300
01:09:50.083 --> 01:09:53.792
The Karupatti Halwa he brought
every time he returned from Burma…

1301
01:09:53.917 --> 01:09:58.667
Used it as a spread on the bread
laced with poison and killed her.

1302
01:10:01.667 --> 01:10:02.792
To be honest.

1303
01:10:03.083 --> 01:10:07.833
I'm just afraid of the Police; If not.
I would've poisoned my wife long ago.

1304
01:10:08.417 --> 01:10:09.417
But you did it!

1305
01:10:09.833 --> 01:10:11.834
You proved you're that
from Kanniappan's bloodline.

1306
01:10:12.708 --> 01:10:13.708
I appreciate it!

1307
01:10:14.333 --> 01:10:16.292
A husband may endure anything.

1308
01:10:16.500 --> 01:10:20.375
But he will never endure
his wife surpassing him in life.

1309
01:10:20.542 --> 01:10:22.083
It's a different case with the wives.

1310
01:10:22.167 --> 01:10:27.500
They always wish their husbands would earn
more than other men and achieve success.

1311
01:10:27.625 --> 01:10:30.250
Because wives are always the martyrs.

1312
01:10:31.500 --> 01:10:33.542
Who is a martyr?
Who the hell is a martyr?

1313
01:10:33.917 --> 01:10:36.042
The men who toil through
blood and sweat every day.

1314
01:10:36.167 --> 01:10:37.847
facing humiliation from
complete strangers.

1315
01:10:37.875 --> 01:10:40.208
and still carrying on
to provide for their families

1316
01:10:40.292 --> 01:10:43.542
this is not the story of one man.
but of millions of men.

1317
01:10:43.625 --> 01:10:44.825
Do you call these men martyrs?

1318
01:10:44.958 --> 01:10:48.125
Sitting idle at home.
eating three square meals a day.

1319
01:10:48.208 --> 01:10:51.083
binge-watching serials.
liking random Instagram posts.

1320
01:10:51.167 --> 01:10:52.750
and growing as stout as a stone mortar.

1321
01:10:52.833 --> 01:10:54.234
Or do you call these women martyrs?

1322
01:10:54.292 --> 01:10:57.792
My husband said taking care
of the kids is a mother's job.

1323
01:10:58.042 --> 01:11:00.417
Really?
Then why do I need you in this house?

1324
01:11:00.500 --> 01:11:02.292
I asked him to leave and divorced him.

1325
01:11:02.375 --> 01:11:03.667
- Divorce?
- Of course!

1326
01:11:03.833 --> 01:11:07.625
In this world.
if a dog is praised for its gratitude.

1327
01:11:08.042 --> 01:11:10.167
then a husband is branded as ungrateful.

1328
01:11:10.292 --> 01:11:11.917
- Do you agree?
- Yes!

1329
01:11:12.167 --> 01:11:14.292
Be strong. We're with you.

1330
01:11:14.625 --> 01:11:17.833
Your husband will claim he gave
you the medicine to calm your temper.

1331
01:11:17.917 --> 01:11:19.083
Don't even let him near you.

1332
01:11:19.458 --> 01:11:22.458
Sattam. that Ayurvedic doctor gave
her medicine to control her temper.

1333
01:11:22.708 --> 01:11:25.208
I have never seen a fool worse than you.

1334
01:11:25.375 --> 01:11:27.018
- Why would you say that?
- What do you expect?

1335
01:11:27.042 --> 01:11:29.542
You believed that a medicine
could control a wife's temper.

1336
01:11:29.750 --> 01:11:30.990
How do I even begin to explain?

1337
01:11:31.792 --> 01:11:34.792
They may even find a cure
for AIDS and cancer in the future.

1338
01:11:34.958 --> 01:11:37.833
Humanity can split atoms
and explore galaxies.

1339
01:11:37.958 --> 01:11:39.398
but a wife's anger remains unsolved.

1340
01:11:39.625 --> 01:11:41.125
If they ever achieve a breakthrough.

1341
01:11:41.250 --> 01:11:43.583
humanity might go extinct
like the dinosaurs.

1342
01:11:43.667 --> 01:11:46.750
For the first time since you became
a lawyer. you spoke like a true one.

1343
01:11:47.167 --> 01:11:48.167
Have a drink!

1344
01:11:48.792 --> 01:11:50.292
- Cheers!
- Cheers. Brother!

1345
01:11:51.000 --> 01:11:52.333
Oh. God. these men!

1346
01:12:00.083 --> 01:12:01.792
Veera! Veera!

1347
01:12:08.583 --> 01:12:10.083
Freshen up. Let's eat.

1348
01:12:22.000 --> 01:12:23.708
I don't know what happened. Auntie.

1349
01:12:24.750 --> 01:12:27.833
That doesn't mean
you leave your wife and kid behind.

1350
01:12:30.500 --> 01:12:32.583
Do you know what she accused me of?

1351
01:12:33.792 --> 01:12:36.292
I'm... I'm still holding on to male ego.

1352
01:12:37.708 --> 01:12:39.417
And that I destroyed her career.

1353
01:12:40.458 --> 01:12:41.750
Do you know how it hurt me?

1354
01:12:42.417 --> 01:12:44.750
You did it for her well-being.
but it backfired.

1355
01:12:45.750 --> 01:12:47.750
The time and circumstances
are against you.

1356
01:12:48.875 --> 01:12:50.715
You claim that you're unaware
of what happened.

1357
01:12:50.875 --> 01:12:52.675
Then. how do you expect
Keerthi to understand?

1358
01:12:53.542 --> 01:12:55.250
Go. meet her and speak to her.

1359
01:12:56.042 --> 01:12:57.042
Console her!

1360
01:13:02.750 --> 01:13:04.125
You carry on. I'll wait here.

1361
01:13:17.292 --> 01:13:19.125
In a day. everything went topsy-turvy.

1362
01:13:19.458 --> 01:13:21.500
You've become the common enemy
of women everywhere.

1363
01:13:22.625 --> 01:13:25.250
In the game of Snakes and Ladders.
the ladder takes you up.

1364
01:13:25.583 --> 01:13:28.125
However. the snake
will be sitting right next to it.

1365
01:13:28.292 --> 01:13:29.625
Stopping yapping like an idiot.

1366
01:13:29.792 --> 01:13:31.152
- Where are my wife and kid?
- Idiot?

1367
01:13:31.250 --> 01:13:32.125
Why is the house locked?

1368
01:13:32.208 --> 01:13:34.042
She went to her mother's house
in Palakkad.

1369
01:13:34.417 --> 01:13:36.375
- Why don't you mind your business?
- He asked.

1370
01:13:36.458 --> 01:13:37.726
- Why are you acting like a fool?
- Fool?

1371
01:13:37.750 --> 01:13:40.667
- Why are you yelling at me?
- Dare you I'd leave to my mother's place.

1372
01:13:40.750 --> 01:13:42.390
- Won't I get angry?
- Get inside the house.

1373
01:13:43.833 --> 01:13:46.583
If you go over there now.
it'll only fuel more anger.

1374
01:13:46.667 --> 01:13:47.667
Let's not go. Veera.

1375
01:13:49.792 --> 01:13:51.000
- One more bit.
- Enough!

1376
01:13:51.083 --> 01:13:54.208
I thought men from Tamil Nadu
are good and I got her married.

1377
01:13:54.458 --> 01:13:56.167
But he ruined everything.

1378
01:13:56.583 --> 01:13:58.083
What's happening. God?

1379
01:13:58.375 --> 01:14:00.083
- Shut up old woman.
- Hey!

1380
01:14:00.542 --> 01:14:02.417
You don't know anything about my father.

1381
01:14:02.625 --> 01:14:04.875
You shouldn't disrespect elders.
Please eat.

1382
01:14:06.250 --> 01:14:07.250
Dad!

1383
01:14:44.917 --> 01:14:46.875
Keerthi… Keerthi!

1384
01:14:50.208 --> 01:14:51.208
Keerthi.

1385
01:14:52.625 --> 01:14:53.792
Keerthi. wait a minute.

1386
01:14:53.875 --> 01:14:56.083
You already ruined it all.
Why are you here now?

1387
01:14:56.500 --> 01:14:57.780
I did not ruin anything. Granny.

1388
01:14:58.167 --> 01:15:00.083
It was unintentional.

1389
01:15:00.500 --> 01:15:02.375
Why haven't you invited him
into the house?

1390
01:15:02.458 --> 01:15:04.476
- Please come in. son-in-law.
- Brother. what are you doing?

1391
01:15:04.500 --> 01:15:05.750
Hey. stop right there!

1392
01:15:05.833 --> 01:15:07.125
Don't you have any shame?

1393
01:15:07.208 --> 01:15:09.292
Are you planning to host a feast for him?

1394
01:15:09.375 --> 01:15:11.708
- Hey. stop talking nonsense!
- Brother. you shut up!

1395
01:15:11.792 --> 01:15:16.167
You ought to have him arrested
for what he did to Keerthi.

1396
01:15:16.250 --> 01:15:17.250
Have him arrested?!

1397
01:15:17.333 --> 01:15:19.292
- I dare you to file a complaint!
- Calm down.

1398
01:15:19.375 --> 01:15:21.000
Did you bring a lawyer to threaten us?

1399
01:15:21.083 --> 01:15:22.458
I will bring a lawyer too.

1400
01:15:22.542 --> 01:15:24.375
- Listen...
- He did not come here as a lawyer.

1401
01:15:24.458 --> 01:15:25.667
He's here as my friend.

1402
01:15:25.875 --> 01:15:28.500
Sure. he's your friend!
But isn't he also a lawyer?

1403
01:15:28.625 --> 01:15:30.351
He's always roaming around
wearing a uniform.

1404
01:15:30.375 --> 01:15:32.018
- Hey. don't you dare disrespect me!
- Damn you!

1405
01:15:32.042 --> 01:15:34.042
- What are you…
- Oh. so you want me to respect you?!

1406
01:15:34.083 --> 01:15:36.292
- That's how I'll speak to you!
- Please hear me out.

1407
01:15:36.375 --> 01:15:37.809
- Uncle. calm down.
- I'll disrespect you even more!

1408
01:15:37.833 --> 01:15:39.083
If you are real men…

1409
01:15:39.167 --> 01:15:41.125
Keerthi. what's wrong with you?

1410
01:15:41.208 --> 01:15:43.875
Why don't you stop them?
There's quite a scene outside!

1411
01:15:44.208 --> 01:15:45.893
- Hey. watch your mouth!
- Uncle. please don't!

1412
01:15:45.917 --> 01:15:46.917
Uncle. please calm down.

1413
01:15:46.958 --> 01:15:49.167
- Please hear me out.
- Get out of here!

1414
01:15:55.792 --> 01:15:56.792
Oh. God!

1415
01:15:57.375 --> 01:15:58.500
- Uncle...
- Hey!

1416
01:15:58.583 --> 01:16:01.000
Son-in-law. why did you slap him?

1417
01:16:01.083 --> 01:16:02.375
I didn't slap him on purpose.

1418
01:16:03.000 --> 01:16:04.208
I slapped him by mistake.

1419
01:16:04.833 --> 01:16:07.143
"I mixed the medicine by mistake.
I slapped him by mistake."

1420
01:16:07.167 --> 01:16:09.018
How many more mistakes
will you make unintentionally?

1421
01:16:09.042 --> 01:16:11.042
I came here seeking peace
for a couple of days.

1422
01:16:11.375 --> 01:16:12.792
But you couldn't leave me alone!

1423
01:16:13.208 --> 01:16:15.708
Keerthi. please hear me out once...

1424
01:16:17.667 --> 01:16:19.500
I've had enough of trusting you.

1425
01:16:19.750 --> 01:16:21.292
I'm not ready to trust you anymore.

1426
01:16:21.375 --> 01:16:23.015
Don't create any trouble.
Get out of here.

1427
01:16:59.708 --> 01:17:03.292
<i>The number you have dialed
is presently not reachable.</i>

1428
01:17:08.167 --> 01:17:09.167
Did you go to the clinic?

1429
01:17:09.333 --> 01:17:11.208
Yeah. there's been a mix-up
with the medicines.

1430
01:17:11.292 --> 01:17:14.125
Only if the Doctor explains it to her
will Keerthi believe me.

1431
01:17:14.708 --> 01:17:17.000
The clinic is locked.
and the doctor is missing too.

1432
01:17:17.542 --> 01:17:20.250
Since Keerthi's case
became sensational news.

1433
01:17:20.417 --> 01:17:23.708
I think the doctor went underground
to avoid a police case.

1434
01:17:24.208 --> 01:17:26.000
He's a very famous Doctor in that area.

1435
01:17:26.375 --> 01:17:29.500
Even I'm confused about
what went wrong with the medicines.

1436
01:17:30.625 --> 01:17:33.226
Coach. please explain the confusion
about the medicines to Keerthi.

1437
01:17:33.250 --> 01:17:34.667
She would believe you.

1438
01:17:36.792 --> 01:17:37.792
Sure. Veera!

1439
01:17:38.292 --> 01:17:40.625
I'll speak to Keerthi.
Please go home.

1440
01:17:41.667 --> 01:17:42.750
Okay. Coach.

1441
01:17:47.208 --> 01:17:48.889
Who gave you permission to go to Palakkad?

1442
01:17:49.083 --> 01:17:52.958
You've gone from begging your wife
to begging her entire family.

1443
01:17:53.375 --> 01:17:56.125
If we're the ones in the wrong.
we have to be submissive. Uncle.

1444
01:17:56.208 --> 01:17:57.458
You've gone mad!

1445
01:17:58.000 --> 01:17:59.917
Husbands should be dominant!

1446
01:18:00.125 --> 01:18:01.833
If we keep being submissive

1447
01:18:01.958 --> 01:18:05.500
the wives will bury the husbands
deep underground.

1448
01:18:06.042 --> 01:18:07.875
How do you suggest we fix this?

1449
01:18:07.958 --> 01:18:09.934
When a fight breaks out
between a husband and a wife

1450
01:18:09.958 --> 01:18:12.208
staying silent
will eventually solve the problem.

1451
01:18:12.292 --> 01:18:13.167
There's nothing we could do.

1452
01:18:13.250 --> 01:18:14.542
Only in our country

1453
01:18:14.625 --> 01:18:17.375
does the husband-and-wife quarrel
continue like local riots.

1454
01:18:17.875 --> 01:18:20.792
Why do husband and wife
often end up fighting?

1455
01:18:21.083 --> 01:18:22.708
You're very innocent.

1456
01:18:23.083 --> 01:18:24.458
Isn't it obvious?

1457
01:18:24.875 --> 01:18:26.750
- Which is our country?
- India.

1458
01:18:26.958 --> 01:18:30.083
- Did India and Germany ever fight?
- No!

1459
01:18:30.208 --> 01:18:32.708
Did India and Australia ever fight?

1460
01:18:33.417 --> 01:18:35.375
- No!
- Who do we fight with?

1461
01:18:35.500 --> 01:18:36.792
With Pakistan and China.

1462
01:18:36.875 --> 01:18:38.083
Where are they located?

1463
01:18:38.292 --> 01:18:40.458
- They're our neighboring countries.
- That's the issue!

1464
01:18:41.542 --> 01:18:43.625
When we're closer. it's always an issue.

1465
01:18:43.833 --> 01:18:47.375
It does not necessarily have to be
India-Pakistan or India-China.

1466
01:18:47.542 --> 01:18:49.182
It's enough if you're a husband and wife.

1467
01:18:49.333 --> 01:18:51.292
- Brother. did you hear the news?
- What news?

1468
01:18:51.375 --> 01:18:53.393
In the upcoming elections. the Panchayat
President seat is reserved for women.

1469
01:18:53.417 --> 01:18:54.792
Who gave them the right to do it?

1470
01:18:54.917 --> 01:18:56.393
I'm the only President of this Panchayat.

1471
01:18:56.417 --> 01:18:57.518
I will contest in the elections.

1472
01:18:57.542 --> 01:18:59.667
I challenge the election commission.

1473
01:18:59.792 --> 01:19:01.042
Stop talking like an idiot.

1474
01:19:01.250 --> 01:19:02.809
Only ladies can contest
in the ladies' constituency.

1475
01:19:02.833 --> 01:19:04.417
Do you mean
that I have become a woman?

1476
01:19:04.625 --> 01:19:06.705
If you speak nonsense.
they'll lock you up in prison.

1477
01:19:07.208 --> 01:19:08.559
Let's contest
from a different constituency.

1478
01:19:08.583 --> 01:19:10.476
- That's part of Tamil Nadu as well.
- Yeah. right!

1479
01:19:10.500 --> 01:19:13.143
No one from our constituency would
vote for you because of your behavior.

1480
01:19:13.167 --> 01:19:14.684
Yet you expect votes
from different constituencies.

1481
01:19:14.708 --> 01:19:17.667
Hey. we'll bribe them with money.
briyani. and liquor.

1482
01:19:17.750 --> 01:19:19.042
That won't work out.

1483
01:19:19.500 --> 01:19:21.792
I've been in power for the past 10 years.

1484
01:19:21.875 --> 01:19:22.750
What do I do now?

1485
01:19:22.833 --> 01:19:24.292
Why don't you let your wife contest?

1486
01:19:24.625 --> 01:19:26.500
All the women will vote for her.

1487
01:19:26.792 --> 01:19:30.042
Do you expect me
to make my wife the President

1488
01:19:30.208 --> 01:19:31.917
and then stay home like an imbecile?

1489
01:19:32.042 --> 01:19:34.667
I'd rather drink poison and die.

1490
01:19:34.750 --> 01:19:36.351
Auntie will be the President for namesake.

1491
01:19:36.375 --> 01:19:37.792
But you will be calling the shots.

1492
01:19:38.958 --> 01:19:41.158
This is what's happening
in many ladies' constituencies.

1493
01:19:42.167 --> 01:19:43.167
What do you say. Sattam?

1494
01:19:43.833 --> 01:19:45.125
Veera is right about it.

1495
01:19:45.708 --> 01:19:47.458
Our only choice now is your wife.

1496
01:19:47.542 --> 01:19:48.542
There's no other option.

1497
01:19:52.792 --> 01:19:54.417
Welcome. Uncle.
This way.

1498
01:19:54.833 --> 01:19:55.833
Please sign this form.

1499
01:19:57.250 --> 01:20:00.333
Do you know how to sign.
or would a thumbprint do?

1500
01:20:00.542 --> 01:20:02.208
- I know how to sign.
- Fine. go ahead.

1501
01:20:02.292 --> 01:20:05.125
Don't sign incorrectly
and humiliate my legacy.

1502
01:20:06.125 --> 01:20:07.708
I have to teach her everything.

1503
01:20:07.792 --> 01:20:08.917
- Hello?
<i>- Dad!</i>

1504
01:20:09.292 --> 01:20:10.292
- My ill fate.
- Mathi!

1505
01:20:12.833 --> 01:20:15.250
- How are you?
- We're back home.

1506
01:20:15.458 --> 01:20:17.958
- I have to go to school tomorrow.
<i>- Yeah!</i>

1507
01:20:18.042 --> 01:20:20.333
So. Mom brought me back home.

1508
01:20:20.458 --> 01:20:22.083
- Did you eat?
- Yeah. I ate.

1509
01:20:22.167 --> 01:20:24.625
- Did you eat?
- Yeah. I ate.

1510
01:20:24.917 --> 01:20:27.333
Hey. Mathi. who are you speaking to?

1511
01:20:27.917 --> 01:20:30.125
I'm speaking to my friend Vinoth.

1512
01:20:30.333 --> 01:20:32.167
I don't trust you. Let me check.

1513
01:20:33.000 --> 01:20:34.750
Come on. give me my phone.

1514
01:20:36.083 --> 01:20:37.164
You were telling the truth.

1515
01:20:37.500 --> 01:20:38.500
Fine. speak to him.

1516
01:20:39.167 --> 01:20:41.958
Okay. it's getting very crowded out here.

1517
01:20:42.125 --> 01:20:43.806
I'll meet you during lunch break tomorrow.

1518
01:20:43.875 --> 01:20:44.750
- Did you call me a crowd?
- Okay?

1519
01:20:44.833 --> 01:20:45.833
Okay.

1520
01:20:56.750 --> 01:20:58.083
Dad!

1521
01:20:58.833 --> 01:20:59.833
Come to me. dear!

1522
01:21:05.250 --> 01:21:07.167
Sambhar rice! Here. take a bite.

1523
01:21:11.000 --> 01:21:12.708
Eat faster.
Or lunch break will end soon.

1524
01:21:12.792 --> 01:21:14.583
Why don't you have a spoon as well?

1525
01:21:15.042 --> 01:21:16.833
- Why?
- Eat!

1526
01:21:20.792 --> 01:21:22.042
There's no salt.

1527
01:21:22.167 --> 01:21:23.583
This is nothing. Dad.

1528
01:21:23.708 --> 01:21:26.458
In the morning. another mayhem happened.

1529
01:21:26.625 --> 01:21:27.625
Mayhem. you say?

1530
01:21:28.708 --> 01:21:29.875
Hurry up!

1531
01:21:32.792 --> 01:21:34.458
Hey. what are you doing?

1532
01:21:34.583 --> 01:21:37.042
When I drop the <i>idlis </i>my father makes

1533
01:21:37.167 --> 01:21:39.208
it'll stick to the plate.

1534
01:21:39.458 --> 01:21:42.417
But Mom's <i>idlis </i>are bouncing.

1535
01:21:42.583 --> 01:21:44.333
Is it an <i>idli </i>or a ball?

1536
01:21:46.500 --> 01:21:47.500
Where's chutney?

1537
01:21:47.833 --> 01:21:50.042
There's no chutney.
Sugar will do. Eat now.

1538
01:21:50.250 --> 01:21:53.833
Dad used to make two chutneys for<i> idlis.</i>

1539
01:21:54.792 --> 01:21:56.875
Coconut chutney and tomato chutney.

1540
01:21:57.208 --> 01:22:00.542
Be thankful that I'm making <i>idlis </i>for you
despite my busy schedule.

1541
01:22:00.792 --> 01:22:02.167
And you're demanding 4 chutneys.

1542
01:22:02.583 --> 01:22:04.167
I don't care if you eat or not.

1543
01:22:04.250 --> 01:22:05.250
You're overdoing it.

1544
01:22:05.542 --> 01:22:07.083
<i>Idlis </i>with sugar are tasty.

1545
01:22:07.333 --> 01:22:08.333
Good combination.

1546
01:22:08.958 --> 01:22:11.875
Mom's cooking is horrible. Dad.

1547
01:22:12.083 --> 01:22:15.083
Please get back with Mom
so that I can eat tasty food.

1548
01:22:22.458 --> 01:22:24.750
- Why didn't you finish your lunch?
- I did finish it.

1549
01:22:24.833 --> 01:22:26.059
You haven't touched your lunch.

1550
01:22:26.083 --> 01:22:26.958
Oh. no!

1551
01:22:27.042 --> 01:22:30.792
My friend brought chicken.
so I ate that.

1552
01:22:31.667 --> 01:22:33.934
- Chicken made you forget sambhar rice.
- Oh. God. I'm caught.

1553
01:22:33.958 --> 01:22:36.333
I woke up early to make you lunch.

1554
01:22:36.417 --> 01:22:38.417
This is for you and this is for me.

1555
01:22:38.792 --> 01:22:40.125
Yayy!

1556
01:22:43.458 --> 01:22:45.458
How do you manage to eat that food?

1557
01:22:45.583 --> 01:22:47.792
It's my wife's cooking.
It'll be delicious.

1558
01:22:48.708 --> 01:22:51.417
- Please have some. Teacher.
- No. Teacher. that's my Mom's cooking.

1559
01:22:51.500 --> 01:22:52.417
Hey. don't be a brat!

1560
01:22:52.500 --> 01:22:54.167
Mom. what are you even doing?

1561
01:22:54.333 --> 01:22:56.708
You can't even braid my hair.

1562
01:22:57.583 --> 01:22:59.917
Dad used to create art with my braids.

1563
01:23:00.125 --> 01:23:02.583
If you bring up your father again.
I'll kill you.

1564
01:23:03.417 --> 01:23:04.458
Dad. my foot!

1565
01:23:05.042 --> 01:23:06.042
Here you go!

1566
01:23:12.458 --> 01:23:15.125
Isn't her mother coming here
every day to pick her up?

1567
01:23:15.208 --> 01:23:16.250
Why don't you talk to her?

1568
01:23:16.667 --> 01:23:19.958
If she knows I'm coming here.
she won't send Mathi to school.

1569
01:23:29.083 --> 01:23:31.250
Please vote for the Bucket symbol…

1570
01:23:31.458 --> 01:23:32.750
<i>Vote for Bucket symbol!</i>

1571
01:23:33.000 --> 01:23:34.167
Vote for Bucket symbol!

1572
01:23:34.333 --> 01:23:35.958
Vote for Bucket and support Padma...

1573
01:23:36.042 --> 01:23:39.750
President. you're here
to ask to vote for your wife.

1574
01:23:39.833 --> 01:23:40.708
Yes!

1575
01:23:40.792 --> 01:23:44.083
But if you have your nephew by your side.
who betrayed his wife

1576
01:23:44.292 --> 01:23:45.583
how do you expect us to vote?

1577
01:23:46.500 --> 01:23:47.500
Uncle!

1578
01:23:47.708 --> 01:23:51.000
Son! If you're here. no
woman is going to vote for us.

1579
01:23:51.083 --> 01:23:52.164
You better scram from here.

1580
01:23:52.208 --> 01:23:53.708
We'll discuss the rest at home.

1581
01:23:53.833 --> 01:23:54.833
Step down!

1582
01:23:55.542 --> 01:23:57.958
Your wish is our wish.

1583
01:23:58.083 --> 01:24:00.917
Please support Padma Rathinam
and vote for her.

1584
01:24:01.000 --> 01:24:02.667
I sincerely request you to support us.

1585
01:24:17.417 --> 01:24:23.625
Hail. Chief!

1586
01:24:23.708 --> 01:24:24.875
Thank you all!

1587
01:24:26.042 --> 01:24:27.375
Where is the President?

1588
01:24:28.208 --> 01:24:30.208
I don't know Hindi.
Talk to me in English.

1589
01:24:30.333 --> 01:24:31.417
Where is Padma?

1590
01:24:32.167 --> 01:24:33.708
Why is he asking about my wife?

1591
01:24:34.208 --> 01:24:36.333
Brother. BDO has come down.

1592
01:24:36.458 --> 01:24:39.018
He might report to the higher officials.
Ask your wife to come right away.

1593
01:24:39.042 --> 01:24:40.250
Why should she come here?

1594
01:24:40.333 --> 01:24:41.667
I'm the President here.

1595
01:24:41.792 --> 01:24:43.500
Ask him to talk to me.

1596
01:24:43.583 --> 01:24:47.333
Just for a day. It's a formality.
Ask her to come.

1597
01:24:49.292 --> 01:24:50.542
Here. take it.

1598
01:24:53.583 --> 01:24:54.583
Come.

1599
01:24:55.833 --> 01:24:58.208
It's my wife. Padma.
Speak to her.

1600
01:24:58.750 --> 01:25:01.708
Do you know the key roles and
responsibilities of a Panchayat President?

1601
01:25:05.708 --> 01:25:07.208
- Why not?
- No. why not?

1602
01:25:07.708 --> 01:25:08.708
She's uneducated.

1603
01:25:10.542 --> 01:25:12.000
Administrative functions.

1604
01:25:12.250 --> 01:25:14.542
Financial Management
of the village administration.

1605
01:25:14.625 --> 01:25:16.500
Welfare and development programs.

1606
01:25:17.250 --> 01:25:21.042
And dispute resolution.
and also public representation.

1607
01:25:21.542 --> 01:25:24.042
Panchayat President
is a sole executive power

1608
01:25:24.250 --> 01:25:26.650
which holds the integrity
and the development of the Village.

1609
01:25:27.042 --> 01:25:28.708
Okay. okay. if you know so much

1610
01:25:28.792 --> 01:25:30.875
why would you let someone else
run the office?

1611
01:25:31.292 --> 01:25:34.833
You're well aware of how our system works.

1612
01:25:35.458 --> 01:25:37.167
What would women do in this situation?

1613
01:25:37.333 --> 01:25:39.500
Hey. she's speaking in Hindi.

1614
01:25:40.833 --> 01:25:42.851
I'm yet to recover from the shock
of her speaking English.

1615
01:25:42.875 --> 01:25:45.125
I thought she never studied
beyond 4th grade.

1616
01:25:45.375 --> 01:25:46.895
But she's excelling in every language.

1617
01:25:47.375 --> 01:25:48.375
Come in.

1618
01:25:48.625 --> 01:25:49.625
Step aside.

1619
01:25:53.833 --> 01:25:54.708
Please sit.

1620
01:25:54.792 --> 01:25:59.250
PRESIDENT.

1621
01:25:59.917 --> 01:26:00.917
Sign!

1622
01:26:01.208 --> 01:26:03.333
R. PADMA

1623
01:26:04.542 --> 01:26:05.542
Who is he?

1624
01:26:07.667 --> 01:26:08.667
My husband.

1625
01:26:08.792 --> 01:26:09.792
House husband?

1626
01:26:12.333 --> 01:26:13.333
Yes!

1627
01:26:13.458 --> 01:26:16.208
For the next 5 years.
he must not step inside this office.

1628
01:26:16.292 --> 01:26:17.958
If he steps in. we'll get him arrested.

1629
01:26:18.333 --> 01:26:19.958
- Understand? All the best!
- Alright!

1630
01:26:20.125 --> 01:26:21.125
Thank you.

1631
01:26:28.750 --> 01:26:31.625
How come you spoke to him
in both Hindi and English?

1632
01:26:31.708 --> 01:26:33.601
You'd better tell me the truth.
How far are you educated?

1633
01:26:33.625 --> 01:26:34.625
Speak up!

1634
01:26:35.000 --> 01:26:36.500
- B.A.
- Who's PA?

1635
01:26:37.417 --> 01:26:39.250
- B.A. English Literature.
- What?!

1636
01:26:42.125 --> 01:26:43.708
B.A. English Literature. she says.

1637
01:26:43.792 --> 01:26:46.875
Hail. Padma!

1638
01:26:54.333 --> 01:26:56.833
- Sweetie!
- Hi. Dad. how are you?

1639
01:26:56.917 --> 01:26:58.667
I'm doing well. How are you?

1640
01:26:58.917 --> 01:27:00.750
I'm doing okay. Did you eat?

1641
01:27:00.833 --> 01:27:01.875
I ate! What about you?

1642
01:27:02.083 --> 01:27:04.708
I ate four <i>idlis.</i>

1643
01:27:05.500 --> 01:27:06.500
Hey…

1644
01:27:07.792 --> 01:27:09.125
<i>Did you finish your homework?</i>

1645
01:27:10.833 --> 01:27:12.083
Who is she speaking to?

1646
01:27:12.333 --> 01:27:13.934
She's speaking to her classmate. Vinoth.

1647
01:27:15.750 --> 01:27:17.583
- I'll call you later.
<i>- What happened?</i>

1648
01:27:19.542 --> 01:27:20.542
Come here.

1649
01:27:27.208 --> 01:27:28.208
Hand me the phone.

1650
01:27:29.667 --> 01:27:30.667
Hand it over right now.

1651
01:27:31.083 --> 01:27:32.083
Hand it. Mathi.

1652
01:27:32.625 --> 01:27:33.917
- Come on!
- Give it to me.

1653
01:27:36.917 --> 01:27:38.792
I told you right. It's Vinoth.

1654
01:27:39.042 --> 01:27:40.542
I've been checking on her daily.

1655
01:27:41.333 --> 01:27:43.292
Come on. dear. tell your mother.

1656
01:27:45.750 --> 01:27:48.167
When your mother asks.
you must hand it over right away.

1657
01:27:54.458 --> 01:27:56.299
Why did you hang up?
Was your uncle around you?

1658
01:27:56.792 --> 01:27:59.167
- Oh. no. you girl!
<i>- Hello? Hello?</i>

1659
01:28:00.083 --> 01:28:01.083
Sweetie!

1660
01:28:01.583 --> 01:28:02.583
Hello?

1661
01:28:04.333 --> 01:28:06.125
Is this how you check on her?

1662
01:28:08.542 --> 01:28:09.833
How long has this been going on?

1663
01:28:11.458 --> 01:28:13.226
I'm speaking to you.
How long has this been going on?

1664
01:28:13.250 --> 01:28:14.125
Speak up!

1665
01:28:14.208 --> 01:28:16.542
I'm talking to my father.
How does it bother you?

1666
01:28:16.917 --> 01:28:18.125
How does it bother me?

1667
01:28:18.625 --> 01:28:21.750
For what your father did to me.
I should've divorced him.

1668
01:28:21.958 --> 01:28:23.750
First. divorce me.

1669
01:28:23.875 --> 01:28:25.958
I don't like to live with you anymore.

1670
01:28:27.625 --> 01:28:28.917
You don't like to live with me?

1671
01:28:30.042 --> 01:28:32.375
- Did you see how insensitive she is?
- You're right.

1672
01:28:32.458 --> 01:28:33.476
It's all because of this phone.

1673
01:28:33.500 --> 01:28:35.060
I'll see how you're going to speak now.

1674
01:28:35.292 --> 01:28:37.125
Oh. no! Hey!

1675
01:28:40.125 --> 01:28:42.167
Hey! Little devil!

1676
01:28:44.375 --> 01:28:48.542
<i>The number you're trying to call
is currently not reachable. Please try...</i>

1677
01:28:53.833 --> 01:28:54.833
Get off the bike.

1678
01:28:58.583 --> 01:28:59.583
Bye.

1679
01:29:01.042 --> 01:29:02.042
Mathi!

1680
01:29:12.125 --> 01:29:13.125
Sweetie!

1681
01:29:15.208 --> 01:29:16.292
Dad!

1682
01:29:18.125 --> 01:29:19.208
Hey. what happened?

1683
01:29:21.208 --> 01:29:23.208
Hey. what happened?
Why are you crying?

1684
01:29:23.292 --> 01:29:25.042
Mom and I got into a fight.

1685
01:29:25.125 --> 01:29:26.500
And Mom beat me.

1686
01:29:26.708 --> 01:29:28.458
- Did she beat you?
- Yes!

1687
01:29:28.542 --> 01:29:30.667
I called you last night. remember.

1688
01:29:30.750 --> 01:29:32.958
So. she broke the phone.

1689
01:29:33.083 --> 01:29:33.958
Oh. no!

1690
01:29:34.042 --> 01:29:36.125
It's Uncle's phone. so don't bother.

1691
01:29:36.500 --> 01:29:38.667
I'm not going back to Mom anymore.

1692
01:29:38.792 --> 01:29:40.792
You come and get me
in the evening after school.

1693
01:29:40.875 --> 01:29:42.917
Just a few days. dear.
Everything will be alright.

1694
01:29:43.875 --> 01:29:46.417
Then. take me out somewhere.

1695
01:29:46.500 --> 01:29:48.125
I want to spend time with you.

1696
01:29:48.208 --> 01:29:49.625
Now? What about school?

1697
01:29:49.708 --> 01:29:50.792
Let's bunk school!

1698
01:29:50.875 --> 01:29:52.375
- Bunk?
- Who's bunking school?

1699
01:29:52.875 --> 01:29:53.875
Teacher!

1700
01:29:54.708 --> 01:29:57.125
Teacher. you see.
she and her mother got into a fight.

1701
01:29:57.333 --> 01:29:59.250
- She's very upset...
- So?

1702
01:30:01.750 --> 01:30:03.542
If you grant her half a day permission

1703
01:30:03.625 --> 01:30:06.625
I'll take her out. calm her down.
and bring her back during the lunch break.

1704
01:30:07.375 --> 01:30:08.375
Please. Teacher.

1705
01:30:11.333 --> 01:30:13.542
- Fine. bring her back soon.
- Thank you. Teacher.

1706
01:30:54.500 --> 01:30:57.917
<i>My sweet little darling
Smiles and dances playfully.</i>

1707
01:30:58.333 --> 01:31:01.417
<i>The thunderous sky joins the rhythm.</i>

1708
01:31:01.875 --> 01:31:05.083
<i>Her little feet
Hopping along in delight.</i>

1709
01:31:05.458 --> 01:31:08.458
<i>Even the breeze sings a folk tune.</i>

1710
01:31:08.708 --> 01:31:12.083
<i>You're the moonlight of this home.</i>

1711
01:31:12.250 --> 01:31:15.750
<i>You're the rainbow
That walked into my life.</i>

1712
01:31:15.833 --> 01:31:19.292
<i>You're my mirror image. my love.</i>

1713
01:31:19.375 --> 01:31:22.875
<i>The magic in your eyes lingers on me.</i>

1714
01:31:22.958 --> 01:31:26.333
<i>My daughter. my treasure.</i>

1715
01:31:26.500 --> 01:31:29.917
<i>Let's leap with joy and share stories.</i>

1716
01:31:30.042 --> 01:31:33.375
<i>My daughter. my treasure.</i>

1717
01:31:33.625 --> 01:31:37.167
<i>Let's leap with joy
And share stories.</i>

1718
01:31:51.333 --> 01:31:54.750
<i>The moment hunger strikes.
She starts demanding attention.</i>

1719
01:31:54.917 --> 01:31:58.208
<i>Challenge her. she'll fight back.</i>

1720
01:31:58.500 --> 01:32:01.917
<i>One moment. and it's all forgotten.</i>

1721
01:32:02.042 --> 01:32:05.458
<i>A mother's warmth by my side.</i>

1722
01:32:05.625 --> 01:32:09.000
<i>Resting in the comfort of my lap.</i>

1723
01:32:09.208 --> 01:32:12.500
<i>Curled up there from dawn to dusk.</i>

1724
01:32:12.708 --> 01:32:16.125
<i>Playful toes upon my forehead.</i>

1725
01:32:16.292 --> 01:32:19.625
<i>She cheers me on When I'm down.</i>

1726
01:32:19.833 --> 01:32:23.250
<i>You're my mirror image. my love.</i>

1727
01:32:23.375 --> 01:32:26.875
<i>The magic in your eyes lingers on me.</i>

1728
01:32:26.958 --> 01:32:30.375
<i>My daughter. my treasure.</i>

1729
01:32:30.458 --> 01:32:33.917
<i>Let's leap with joy
And share stories.</i>

1730
01:32:34.042 --> 01:32:37.458
<i>My daughter. my treasure.</i>

1731
01:32:37.583 --> 01:32:41.125
<i>Let's leap with joy
And share stories.</i>

1732
01:32:55.958 --> 01:32:57.458
Daughters are always a father's pet.

1733
01:32:57.833 --> 01:32:59.000
That's how they'll react.

1734
01:32:59.500 --> 01:33:02.292
Don't overthink.
Wash your hands. and we'll have lunch.

1735
01:33:03.208 --> 01:33:04.208
Go!

1736
01:33:04.458 --> 01:33:08.167
She was angry. so I don't know if she ate.

1737
01:33:08.500 --> 01:33:10.333
Let me feed her and console her.

1738
01:33:10.500 --> 01:33:11.740
If I don't. I'll feel terrible.

1739
01:33:12.250 --> 01:33:13.875
- You carry on.
- Okay.

1740
01:33:27.167 --> 01:33:28.208
Auntie!

1741
01:33:28.625 --> 01:33:30.542
Mathi did not attend the class today.

1742
01:33:30.958 --> 01:33:32.542
- She was absent.
- What do you mean?

1743
01:33:32.875 --> 01:33:35.292
I went to her class
during the second period

1744
01:33:35.542 --> 01:33:36.917
but she was not in the classroom.

1745
01:33:37.000 --> 01:33:38.917
I dropped her off myself in the morning.

1746
01:33:39.375 --> 01:33:41.417
Please call her class teacher. Meenu.

1747
01:33:47.000 --> 01:33:49.417
Did her daughter. Mathi Malar
make it to school today?

1748
01:33:50.167 --> 01:33:52.750
- You see…
- Why are you hesitating?

1749
01:33:54.000 --> 01:33:55.333
She did come to school. Ma'am.

1750
01:33:55.875 --> 01:33:57.101
But she did not attend any classes.

1751
01:33:57.125 --> 01:33:59.792
What do you mean by that?
Where the hell did she go?

1752
01:34:28.375 --> 01:34:29.792
So. you let her go with her Dad?

1753
01:34:29.875 --> 01:34:32.333
Ma'am. she was very upset and dull.

1754
01:34:32.708 --> 01:34:35.208
- So…
- It doesn't matter how she is feeling.

1755
01:34:35.500 --> 01:34:37.125
Are you her mother. or am I?

1756
01:34:37.583 --> 01:34:39.833
- Ma'am...
- Keerthi. I insisted on taking her out.

1757
01:34:40.000 --> 01:34:41.083
It's not her fault.

1758
01:34:42.500 --> 01:34:44.125
I dropped her off at the school.

1759
01:34:44.500 --> 01:34:46.351
Who gave her the right
to send her off with him?

1760
01:34:46.375 --> 01:34:48.000
Is this how you run your school?

1761
01:34:48.083 --> 01:34:49.603
Ma'am. don't be loose with your words.

1762
01:34:49.708 --> 01:34:52.625
She did not send her off
with some stranger.

1763
01:34:53.000 --> 01:34:54.958
It's her father who took her out.

1764
01:34:55.458 --> 01:34:57.917
Keep your familial fights
limited to your family.

1765
01:34:58.083 --> 01:34:59.625
Please don't drag it to school.

1766
01:35:01.750 --> 01:35:03.500
- Mathi. let's go.
- I'm not coming.

1767
01:35:03.708 --> 01:35:05.559
Mathi. please come with me.
Don't get me worked up.

1768
01:35:05.583 --> 01:35:07.583
I won't come with you.
You'll beat me.

1769
01:35:07.917 --> 01:35:09.208
I won't beat you. Come with me.

1770
01:35:09.583 --> 01:35:11.000
You sound very angry.

1771
01:35:11.083 --> 01:35:12.833
I'm not angry. Come with me.

1772
01:35:12.958 --> 01:35:14.208
I'm going with Dad.

1773
01:35:14.500 --> 01:35:16.083
- Go with your Mom.
- I won't go with her.

1774
01:35:16.417 --> 01:35:18.351
- Keerthi. I'll bring her. You leave.
- You better come with me.

1775
01:35:18.375 --> 01:35:19.518
- Didn't I tell you earlier?
- I'll bring her Keerthi.

1776
01:35:19.542 --> 01:35:20.893
- Not to leave the school.
- I'll bring her.

1777
01:35:20.917 --> 01:35:22.393
- Why did you go out?
- Why are you beating her?

1778
01:35:22.417 --> 01:35:23.559
- Why did you go out?
- Don't beat her.

1779
01:35:23.583 --> 01:35:24.934
Don't beat. Keerthi.
Please don't beat her.

1780
01:35:24.958 --> 01:35:26.393
- Hey. Keerthi!
- Are you coming with me or not?

1781
01:35:26.417 --> 01:35:28.417
Keerthi. don't beat her.
Don't you hear me?

1782
01:35:32.292 --> 01:35:33.292
Keerth...

1783
01:35:34.583 --> 01:35:35.583
Kee...

1784
01:35:36.417 --> 01:35:37.417
Sorry.

1785
01:36:05.500 --> 01:36:07.333
<i>You slapped her in front of many people.</i>

1786
01:36:09.417 --> 01:36:10.542
I did not do it on purpose.

1787
01:36:11.042 --> 01:36:12.202
She was beating our daughter.

1788
01:36:12.458 --> 01:36:14.958
I couldn't control myself
and raise my hand at her.

1789
01:36:15.125 --> 01:36:16.726
It's her daughter
and she has every right to.

1790
01:36:16.750 --> 01:36:18.393
That does not give you the right
to slap her.

1791
01:36:18.417 --> 01:36:19.792
What you did isn't justified.

1792
01:36:20.417 --> 01:36:22.917
He hit his wife.
What's wrong with it?

1793
01:36:23.333 --> 01:36:25.500
Isn't he her husband?
What if she slaps him back?

1794
01:36:27.833 --> 01:36:29.625
Do you think she can't?

1795
01:36:29.792 --> 01:36:32.000
- Isn't she a wrestler?
- Why not?

1796
01:36:32.083 --> 01:36:33.375
Time have changed.

1797
01:36:34.625 --> 01:36:35.625
Wait a minute.

1798
01:36:36.250 --> 01:36:39.042
I don't want lunch.
Make it just for yourself.

1799
01:36:41.583 --> 01:36:43.544
I'll be done with the meeting
only in the evening.

1800
01:36:43.792 --> 01:36:47.000
Crisps are drying on the terrace.
Bring them down before it rains.

1801
01:36:47.208 --> 01:36:49.042
Also. bring water to the cows.

1802
01:36:49.583 --> 01:36:52.333
Most importantly.
don't sleep with the doors open.

1803
01:36:52.542 --> 01:36:53.822
Stray dogs will enter the house.

1804
01:37:00.125 --> 01:37:01.726
<i>Auntie will be the President for namesake.</i>

1805
01:37:01.750 --> 01:37:03.167
<i>But you will be calling the shots.</i>

1806
01:37:05.417 --> 01:37:08.208
Veera. come with me.
I want to talk to you.

1807
01:37:09.917 --> 01:37:12.000
Go. go!
You've already ruined it for me.

1808
01:37:15.458 --> 01:37:16.333
Go!

1809
01:37:16.458 --> 01:37:17.458
To hell with him!

1810
01:37:20.500 --> 01:37:22.917
I wonder when she learned to drive.

1811
01:37:23.750 --> 01:37:26.458
I'm not sure what else I have to
endure in my life.

1812
01:37:27.792 --> 01:37:30.000
He slapped our daughter in public.

1813
01:37:30.292 --> 01:37:32.333
Does he think no one would question him?

1814
01:37:34.792 --> 01:37:36.292
Your daughter is crying her eyes out.

1815
01:37:36.458 --> 01:37:38.299
But you're sitting idle
like a statue out here.

1816
01:37:39.792 --> 01:37:42.458
Mom. she's not crying
because her husband slapped her.

1817
01:37:42.625 --> 01:37:44.305
She's crying because she hit her daughter.

1818
01:37:46.875 --> 01:37:48.500
I shouldn't have hit her.

1819
01:37:50.458 --> 01:37:53.042
I was angry with my husband
and took it out on her.

1820
01:37:54.250 --> 01:37:55.333
Poor thing. Mathi.

1821
01:37:56.333 --> 01:37:57.958
She must be in pain.

1822
01:38:03.458 --> 01:38:06.750
The conflict between you two
began over how to raise your child.

1823
01:38:06.875 --> 01:38:08.500
Now you have blew up the problem.

1824
01:38:09.917 --> 01:38:13.125
The biggest challenge for parents
is raising a child.

1825
01:38:13.500 --> 01:38:16.542
But if you don't raise the child right…

1826
01:38:17.042 --> 01:38:19.667
All the parents drown in guilt.

1827
01:38:20.167 --> 01:38:21.767
That we did not raise the children well.

1828
01:38:21.792 --> 01:38:23.333
We pampered them too much.

1829
01:38:23.625 --> 01:38:26.250
To avoid those regrets.
parents raise them strictly.

1830
01:38:26.333 --> 01:38:28.250
VILLAGE HEAD
KEELA AMBUR PANCHAYAT.

1831
01:38:33.000 --> 01:38:34.000
Listen. Veera.

1832
01:38:34.750 --> 01:38:35.750
I don't have children.

1833
01:38:36.583 --> 01:38:39.250
If I had.
I would've raised it the way Keerthi is.

1834
01:38:39.917 --> 01:38:42.237
In today's world. we must raise
our daughters to be strong.

1835
01:38:42.500 --> 01:38:45.875
We should start teaching them martial arts
or wrestling when they're 6 years old.

1836
01:38:46.333 --> 01:38:48.125
We see a lot of news day in and out.

1837
01:38:48.458 --> 01:38:51.208
While going to study.
or work. or going out

1838
01:38:51.625 --> 01:38:54.458
every day. women face danger
in many forms.

1839
01:38:55.458 --> 01:38:57.917
Parents can't accompany them everywhere.

1840
01:38:58.167 --> 01:39:00.047
The Police won't be
at guard everywhere. either.

1841
01:39:00.292 --> 01:39:01.958
Women have to save themselves.

1842
01:39:02.917 --> 01:39:05.917
Anyone who learns Karate during
childhood doesn't become a master in it.

1843
01:39:06.250 --> 01:39:07.417
It's just for self defense.

1844
01:39:07.625 --> 01:39:08.917
Similarly. wrestling.

1845
01:39:09.125 --> 01:39:11.226
Once she grows up.
if she feels wrestling is not her calling

1846
01:39:11.250 --> 01:39:12.958
she can move on to pursue something else.

1847
01:39:13.417 --> 01:39:16.708
But the wrestling she learned
will protect her for life.

1848
01:39:28.458 --> 01:39:31.000
Dad. why are you not sleeping?

1849
01:39:31.625 --> 01:39:33.958
Nothing much. dear.

1850
01:39:34.417 --> 01:39:38.250
You seemed happy
when you came to see me at school.

1851
01:39:38.458 --> 01:39:43.250
I'm here with you now.
but you don't seem happy.

1852
01:39:43.333 --> 01:39:44.333
Why?

1853
01:39:44.875 --> 01:39:48.833
I'm happy. dear.
But Mom will be sad without you.

1854
01:39:49.083 --> 01:39:50.750
She won't be suffering. though.

1855
01:39:51.000 --> 01:39:53.708
She does not like me.
I'm sure she must be having fun.

1856
01:39:54.917 --> 01:39:55.958
Do you think so?

1857
01:39:59.375 --> 01:40:00.667
Shall I tell you a story?

1858
01:40:00.750 --> 01:40:03.250
Is it a story of a lion or a fox?

1859
01:40:04.125 --> 01:40:05.125
It's neither!

1860
01:40:05.417 --> 01:40:07.708
It's a story about a Dora Baby like you.

1861
01:40:07.792 --> 01:40:09.542
Dora Baby? Please tell me.

1862
01:40:11.833 --> 01:40:14.042
Dora Baby was five years old.

1863
01:40:14.208 --> 01:40:15.667
How does she look?

1864
01:40:15.875 --> 01:40:18.958
She is beautiful and cute like you.

1865
01:40:23.875 --> 01:40:26.417
<i>That baby was very interested in wrestling
at that young age.</i>

1866
01:40:27.292 --> 01:40:28.750

1867
1866
01:40:30.250 --> 01:40:31.917
<i>She had her first match at 10 years old.</i>

1868
01:40:32.958 --> 01:40:34.708
<i>At 15 she was a school champion.</i>

1869
01:40:35.250 --> 01:40:36.768
Hereafter. you should not
take part in wrestling.

1870
01:40:36.792 --> 01:40:39.125
- Focus on your studies.
<i>- Her father restricted her.</i>

1871
01:40:39.708 --> 01:40:41.269
But she did not pay heed to her father.

1872
01:40:41.375 --> 01:40:44.042
<i>She started wrestling in college
without her parents' knowledge.</i>

1873
01:40:48.375 --> 01:40:49.667
<i>She was old enough for marriage.</i>

1874
01:40:50.250 --> 01:40:51.333
<i>But could not find a match.</i>

1875
01:40:51.500 --> 01:40:53.500
<i>They rejected her
because she is a wrestler.</i>

1876
01:40:55.708 --> 01:40:58.750
For the women of our country.
family comes first.

1877
01:40:59.750 --> 01:41:02.750
On seeing her father's health.
she quit wrestling and got married.

1878
01:41:05.167 --> 01:41:06.667
<i>Her husband was not understanding.</i>

1879
01:41:08.625 --> 01:41:10.726
Once he knew she was a wrestler.
he asked her to leave.

1880
01:41:10.750 --> 01:41:11.750
Dear. listen...

1881
01:41:12.792 --> 01:41:15.375
<i>Later. he challenged her
to a wrestling match.</i>

1882
01:41:17.792 --> 01:41:20.792
<i>Only then did he realize
wrestling is a tough sport.</i>

1883
01:41:21.542 --> 01:41:23.875
<i>And how much she has
sacrificed in her life.</i>

1884
01:41:27.208 --> 01:41:31.750
Despite having no support from her family.
she excelled in wrestling.

1885
01:41:32.250 --> 01:41:33.500
It must not go to waste. right?

1886
01:41:34.833 --> 01:41:37.458
So. he decided to support her dreams.

1887
01:41:38.875 --> 01:41:41.000
That's when she gave birth to a child.

1888
01:41:44.750 --> 01:41:47.542
After giving birth.
continuing wrestling is tough.

1889
01:41:48.792 --> 01:41:50.375
<i>The body and health won't be the same.</i>

1890
01:41:52.083 --> 01:41:54.323
<i>Still. she overcame it
and continued to pursue wrestling.</i>

1891
01:41:55.875 --> 01:41:58.292
The child had mother's milk for 2 years.

1892
01:41:59.667 --> 01:42:03.625
She used to pump milk into the
feeding bottle and head to training.

1893
01:42:06.333 --> 01:42:09.125
<i>She once went to Chandigarh
for a two-month training camp.</i>

1894
01:42:11.042 --> 01:42:12.042
Bye!

1895
01:42:14.375 --> 01:42:16.667
<i>Back home the child was crying
without mother's milk.</i>

1896
01:42:17.083 --> 01:42:19.204
<i>During training.
she suffered from breast engorgement.</i>

1897
01:42:21.000 --> 01:42:23.583
To cope with the engorgement.

1898
01:42:23.667 --> 01:42:26.226
she would express her breast milk
in the bathroom and resume training.

1899
01:42:26.250 --> 01:42:27.410
I am going to quit wrestling.

1900
01:42:28.208 --> 01:42:29.849
I can't stop thinking about our daughter.

1901
01:42:29.958 --> 01:42:31.375
You must not waste your talent.

1902
01:42:31.667 --> 01:42:34.750
You continue to train.
I'll take responsibility of our child.

1903
01:42:38.417 --> 01:42:39.917
<i>Poor thing. that mother.</i>

1904
01:42:40.000 --> 01:42:43.500
She must've suffered
being away from her child.

1905
01:42:45.458 --> 01:42:48.417
Where are the mother and child now?

1906
01:42:49.625 --> 01:42:51.208
Mom Dora is at her house.

1907
01:42:51.875 --> 01:42:53.917
And Baby Dora is with me right here.

1908
01:42:54.958 --> 01:42:59.042
Wait. were you telling me
my mother's story all along?

1909
01:43:10.667 --> 01:43:15.208
<i>My golden girl.
The treasure of my heart.</i>

1910
01:43:15.625 --> 01:43:19.667
<i>I long to see your innocent face.</i>

1911
01:43:21.208 --> 01:43:25.792
<i>My precious girl. my treasure!</i>

1912
01:43:26.250 --> 01:43:30.875
<i>I long to hear
Your sweet. endearing voice.</i>

1913
01:43:31.875 --> 01:43:33.833
<i>Oh. dear! Oh. dear!</i>

1914
01:43:34.208 --> 01:43:39.000
<i>My dear friend who playfully quarrels
With me every day.</i>

1915
01:43:39.583 --> 01:43:41.958
<i>My dear friend.</i>

1916
01:43:42.542 --> 01:43:44.375
<i>Oh. dear! Oh. dear!</i>

1917
01:43:44.958 --> 01:43:51.833
<i>You're the sweet friend who defeats me
Without even saying a word.</i>

1918
01:43:53.333 --> 01:43:57.708
<i>Tears surge within me like the sea.</i>

1919
01:43:58.042 --> 01:44:03.208
<i>Come be the shore
That brings me home.</i>

1920
01:44:03.958 --> 01:44:08.458
<i>The night scorches the sky within me.</i>

1921
01:44:08.625 --> 01:44:13.667
<i>Come. little moon.
And shine beside me.</i>

1922
01:44:33.500 --> 01:44:34.500
Ma'am. courier!

1923
01:44:39.000 --> 01:44:40.000
What is this?

1924
01:44:44.292 --> 01:44:45.833
You wanted me to quit wrestling.

1925
01:44:46.125 --> 01:44:47.125
I did not listen to you.

1926
01:44:48.292 --> 01:44:50.833
Now. I'm pushing my daughter
to pursue wrestling.

1927
01:44:51.250 --> 01:44:52.583
But she is refusing it.

1928
01:44:52.750 --> 01:44:54.030
And she's interested in dancing.

1929
01:44:55.000 --> 01:44:59.542
It is the duty of parents to understand
what their child is passionate about.

1930
01:45:00.458 --> 01:45:04.333
Not to impose our passion on to our child.

1931
01:45:04.750 --> 01:45:06.625
I learnt it from you. my dear.

1932
01:45:07.167 --> 01:45:08.167
But you.

1933
01:45:10.125 --> 01:45:12.667
Sports gave me everything I have today.

1934
01:45:15.833 --> 01:45:19.083
My self confidence. happiness.

1935
01:45:20.125 --> 01:45:22.625
I wanted my child to enjoy
the same opportunities.

1936
01:45:23.458 --> 01:45:25.375
That's why I sent her
to train in wrestling.

1937
01:45:27.542 --> 01:45:29.083
But when I think about it now…

1938
01:45:31.208 --> 01:45:34.042
Whether I did the right thing or not…

1939
01:45:34.958 --> 01:45:35.958
I'm not sure!

1940
01:45:37.250 --> 01:45:41.208
Parents can guide children
only up to the age of 14 or 15.

1941
01:45:41.750 --> 01:45:45.042
After 14 or 15.
children start making their own choices.

1942
01:45:46.292 --> 01:45:49.500
Until then. it's enough to teach them
the difference between right and wrong.

1943
01:45:50.208 --> 01:45:52.917
As parents that's our duty.

1944
01:45:55.875 --> 01:45:58.750
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

1945
01:46:03.667 --> 01:46:05.042
<i>Why isn't Mathi coming to school?</i>

1946
01:46:05.208 --> 01:46:07.750
Teacher. she's not herself. lately.

1947
01:46:07.833 --> 01:46:09.458
So. she refuses to come to school.

1948
01:46:13.667 --> 01:46:15.542
- Mom. do you like this serial?
- People!

1949
01:46:15.792 --> 01:46:17.708
He did not send Mathi to school
for 4 days.

1950
01:46:17.792 --> 01:46:18.667
Matter needs attention.

1951
01:46:18.750 --> 01:46:21.708
If you don't question him
he'll destroy her life. too.

1952
01:46:23.792 --> 01:46:27.083
Listen. the only way to get our
child back is through legal means.

1953
01:46:27.417 --> 01:46:28.958
I spoke to the lawyer. already.

1954
01:46:29.208 --> 01:46:31.000
Let's end this circus.

1955
01:46:31.083 --> 01:46:32.083
Hey. shut up!

1956
01:46:32.125 --> 01:46:33.768
It's not even a month
since they got separated.

1957
01:46:33.792 --> 01:46:35.018
And you want to consult a lawyer.

1958
01:46:35.042 --> 01:46:36.458
Let's meet him and discuss further.

1959
01:46:36.542 --> 01:46:39.042
Are you going to question him
why he slapped Keerthi?

1960
01:46:39.125 --> 01:46:40.000
We must question him!

1961
01:46:40.125 --> 01:46:42.708
In the past 6 years
he has never slapped her.

1962
01:46:42.833 --> 01:46:45.250
If he slapped her now
there must be a reason.

1963
01:46:45.583 --> 01:46:48.458
So. if there's a reason you'd slap her.

1964
01:46:49.000 --> 01:46:50.208
That's not what I meant.

1965
01:46:50.792 --> 01:46:54.125
The way she's upset for hitting her child

1966
01:46:54.292 --> 01:46:57.833
similarly. son-in-law
must be upset for hitting her.

1967
01:46:58.917 --> 01:47:01.958
Let's all go together
and discuss this matter further.

1968
01:47:03.042 --> 01:47:06.125
Why are you being stubborn?
Please get in the car.

1969
01:47:06.833 --> 01:47:10.333
Do you really think they're upset
because I'm not with them?

1970
01:47:10.417 --> 01:47:11.500
How would they not?

1971
01:47:11.792 --> 01:47:13.583
The way this situation upsets you

1972
01:47:13.667 --> 01:47:17.875
your child and your husband
will feel that pain twice as much.

1973
01:47:19.333 --> 01:47:22.042
You'd believe me only
when you see it for yourself.

1974
01:47:22.417 --> 01:47:23.417
Get in!

1975
01:47:24.917 --> 01:47:26.583
I can't believe you're paying heed to me.

1976
01:47:26.708 --> 01:47:27.708
One important matter.

1977
01:47:27.958 --> 01:47:29.601
No one should utter a word
when we get there.

1978
01:47:29.625 --> 01:47:30.833
- Why?
- I'll speak to him.

1979
01:47:31.375 --> 01:47:32.375
Start the vehicle.

1980
01:47:35.000 --> 01:47:37.500
She's upset all the time.
She's not smiling.

1981
01:47:38.542 --> 01:47:40.375
Making a child smile isn't a big deal.

1982
01:47:45.792 --> 01:47:46.792
Step aside!

1983
01:48:01.583 --> 01:48:02.625
Class Teacher.

1984
01:48:07.208 --> 01:48:08.792
Why aren't you coming to school?

1985
01:48:13.958 --> 01:48:14.958
Here you go.

1986
01:48:16.083 --> 01:48:17.208
You don't want it?

1987
01:48:21.667 --> 01:48:22.667
I don't want it.

1988
01:49:25.458 --> 01:49:26.458
Hello!

1989
01:50:50.375 --> 01:50:51.708
First. put them down.

1990
01:50:53.042 --> 01:50:54.042
Did you notice

1991
01:50:54.417 --> 01:50:55.833
who he is letting down first.

1992
01:50:56.458 --> 01:50:57.819
When are you going to get her off?

1993
01:51:07.167 --> 01:51:08.875
<i>The way this situation upsets you</i>

1994
01:51:09.042 --> 01:51:13.292
<i>your child and your husband
will feel that pain twice as much.</i>

1995
01:51:17.042 --> 01:51:20.500
You asked us not to utter word
and claimed to handle the situation.

1996
01:51:20.833 --> 01:51:22.958
But you're not talking now.

1997
01:51:23.250 --> 01:51:24.410
Didn't you see what happened?

1998
01:51:27.333 --> 01:51:28.500
There's nothing left to say.

1999
01:51:28.583 --> 01:51:30.167
Son-in-law put up show for us.

2000
01:51:30.375 --> 01:51:31.833
It's not what you think it is.

2001
01:51:32.083 --> 01:51:33.500
What do you mean?

2002
01:51:33.917 --> 01:51:35.583
Were you planning to use another step?

2003
01:51:36.250 --> 01:51:37.750
It's my fault I had faith in you.

2004
01:51:38.417 --> 01:51:41.458
Before you got here
we were truly sad.

2005
01:51:41.708 --> 01:51:42.917
I don't get it. though.

2006
01:51:43.042 --> 01:51:45.442
The song you were dancing to
is not meant for sad situations.

2007
01:51:47.667 --> 01:51:50.167
Any husband away from his wife
tends to dance with joy.

2008
01:51:50.250 --> 01:51:54.250
That doesn't mean
you should be dancing with such joy.

2009
01:51:54.542 --> 01:51:57.292
Coming here opened our eyes to the truth.

2010
01:51:58.792 --> 01:52:00.542
- Let's leave.
- Disgusting.

2011
01:52:03.583 --> 01:52:05.000
What are you waiting for?

2012
01:52:05.292 --> 01:52:07.250
Next is legal route.
Let's go!

2013
01:52:07.417 --> 01:52:08.417
Keerthi…

2014
01:52:09.042 --> 01:52:10.042
Keerthi!

2015
01:52:10.833 --> 01:52:11.833
Keerthi!

2016
01:52:12.500 --> 01:52:13.500
I'm doomed!

2017
01:52:20.083 --> 01:52:22.583
Look at this. Uncle.
She has sent me a divorce notice.

2018
01:52:22.833 --> 01:52:24.500
Why would she go this far?

2019
01:52:24.583 --> 01:52:26.917
You're handing it to him
as if he knows English!

2020
01:52:28.000 --> 01:52:29.333
I had to read it out to you.

2021
01:52:29.583 --> 01:52:31.917
Veera. if we go to court.

2022
01:52:32.000 --> 01:52:33.643
they will rule that the daughter
must live with her mother.

2023
01:52:33.667 --> 01:52:34.768
That's why they sent you
the divorce notice.

2024
01:52:34.792 --> 01:52:35.792
That's not fair.

2025
01:52:35.833 --> 01:52:37.667
So. when you withdraw cash from an ATM.

2026
01:52:37.750 --> 01:52:40.292
does it belong to the machine
or the person who withdrew it?

2027
01:52:40.542 --> 01:52:41.417
Gosh!

2028
01:52:41.500 --> 01:52:44.125
Brother. don't talk nonsense
in court like you do here.

2029
01:52:44.208 --> 01:52:45.500
The judge will get you arrested.

2030
01:52:46.375 --> 01:52:48.417
Veera. there's no point in getting angry.

2031
01:52:48.500 --> 01:52:49.917
The court demands evidence.

2032
01:52:50.000 --> 01:52:52.208
Only if you produce
the Ayurvedic doctor in court

2033
01:52:52.292 --> 01:52:53.875
can you prove your innocence.

2034
01:52:54.250 --> 01:52:56.292
I'm not sure where he's hiding.

2035
01:52:56.500 --> 01:52:57.900
He's not opening his clinic either.

2036
01:53:06.417 --> 01:53:08.750
What the hell?
We could've easily won.

2037
01:53:09.958 --> 01:53:11.799
- It's okay. Coach.
- We'll make it up next time.

2038
01:53:15.208 --> 01:53:17.125
Doctor. over here!

2039
01:53:18.208 --> 01:53:21.375
You can reopen the clinic now.
He won't come looking for you.

2040
01:53:22.458 --> 01:53:26.333
He'll be running back and forth
between court and home.

2041
01:53:33.958 --> 01:53:36.667
Doctor. why is your face swollen?

2042
01:53:49.750 --> 01:53:51.792
He somehow sought me out from hiding.

2043
01:53:56.042 --> 01:53:58.292
<i>Only if you present
the Ayurveda Doctor in the court</i>

2044
01:53:58.375 --> 01:53:59.958
<i>can you prove yourself innocent.</i>

2045
01:54:03.000 --> 01:54:04.400
<i>It's 3.500 rupees for the medicine.</i>

2046
01:54:05.417 --> 01:54:06.777
<i>You met them at the temple. is it?</i>

2047
01:54:08.000 --> 01:54:10.208
<i>Only after visiting
other rituals would follow.</i>

2048
01:54:10.792 --> 01:54:11.893
<i>Let me know how you got lucky.</i>

2049
01:54:11.917 --> 01:54:13.375
<i>I've been trying for 15 years.</i>

2050
01:54:17.375 --> 01:54:18.792
Bless me. God!

2051
01:54:25.000 --> 01:54:26.917
Hey. please don't harm me.

2052
01:54:27.125 --> 01:54:28.806
The Coach is the
cause of all the problems.

2053
01:54:29.083 --> 01:54:30.083
The Coach?

2054
01:54:31.417 --> 01:54:32.417
I ought to!

2055
01:54:35.667 --> 01:54:37.083
I blindly trusted you.

2056
01:54:39.042 --> 01:54:41.875
Wrestling is a sport
that you play face to face.

2057
01:54:44.625 --> 01:54:47.083
You're not fit to be
called a sportsperson.

2058
01:54:47.167 --> 01:54:49.708
You're right!
I shouldn't be in the field of sports.

2059
01:54:50.000 --> 01:54:51.600
Only your wife deserves to be in sports.

2060
01:54:51.833 --> 01:54:54.958
Only she plays. wins medals.
and gets promotions.

2061
01:54:55.083 --> 01:54:56.483
But I should be just sitting ducks.

2062
01:54:58.042 --> 01:54:59.917
Neither they respect me at the office.

2063
01:55:00.250 --> 01:55:02.417
Nor do they respect me at the Academy.
In fact.

2064
01:55:03.792 --> 01:55:05.667
I don't get respect even at my home.

2065
01:55:05.750 --> 01:55:08.417
The other day. she said.
"My husband is the reason for my success."

2066
01:55:09.917 --> 01:55:11.393
Just because you cook three meals a day

2067
01:55:11.417 --> 01:55:12.976
doesn't mean you're the reason
for her success.

2068
01:55:13.000 --> 01:55:14.375
That's not what she meant.

2069
01:55:18.417 --> 01:55:19.417
I'm the Coach!

2070
01:55:20.042 --> 01:55:21.962
Giving me some credit
wouldn't make her any less.

2071
01:55:22.042 --> 01:55:23.208
- That's why…
- Stop!

2072
01:55:23.417 --> 01:55:26.208
I wanted to defeat her
in wrestling this time.

2073
01:55:28.917 --> 01:55:30.317
Just defeating her won't be enough.

2074
01:55:31.083 --> 01:55:33.958
So. I decided to drive her
out of the field altogether.

2075
01:55:35.625 --> 01:55:37.833
Now her career has been destroyed.

2076
01:56:36.958 --> 01:56:38.958
Keerthi! Keerthi!

2077
01:56:42.125 --> 01:56:43.125
Keerthi!

2078
01:56:44.250 --> 01:56:45.250
Keerthi!

2079
01:56:46.417 --> 01:56:48.125
Do you know who's behind all our problems?

2080
01:56:48.708 --> 01:56:49.708
It's the Coach. right?

2081
01:56:51.292 --> 01:56:52.292
How did you know?

2082
01:56:53.417 --> 01:56:54.417
The Coach told himself.

2083
01:56:57.458 --> 01:57:00.375
<i>Keerthi. look at what your husband
has done to me.</i>

2084
01:57:01.708 --> 01:57:03.750
<i>He's threatening
me into telling you</i>

2085
01:57:03.833 --> 01:57:05.708
<i>that I influenced him
to give you the meds.</i>

2086
01:57:05.833 --> 01:57:08.250
<i>I refused to say it. and I got beaten up.</i>

2087
01:57:08.750 --> 01:57:09.625
He's lying!

2088
01:57:09.708 --> 01:57:12.509
I'm going to wait and see what else
you would do to hide your mistakes.

2089
01:57:12.583 --> 01:57:13.934
- Keerthi...
- You beat him up mercilessly.

2090
01:57:13.958 --> 01:57:15.583
Trust me. Keerthi. He's lying!

2091
01:57:16.333 --> 01:57:18.476
- I swear he asked me to give you the meds.
- Don't say anything.

2092
01:57:18.500 --> 01:57:19.667
Please don't say anything.

2093
01:57:19.750 --> 01:57:21.268
- Trust me. Keerthi.
- I trusted you enough.

2094
01:57:21.292 --> 01:57:22.809
If you have anything to say.
say it in court.

2095
01:57:22.833 --> 01:57:24.274
I don't wish to talk to you anymore.

2096
01:57:25.208 --> 01:57:26.708
Keerthi! Keerthi!

2097
01:57:27.875 --> 01:57:28.875
You believe in his words.

2098
01:57:29.208 --> 01:57:30.569
But you're refusing to believe me.

2099
01:57:30.833 --> 01:57:34.167
Being uneducated.
I foolishly trusted everything he told me.

2100
01:57:34.417 --> 01:57:37.000
Aren't you educated?
But you're a bigger fool than me.

2101
01:57:37.667 --> 01:57:39.187
Going to court won't fix our problems.

2102
01:57:40.333 --> 01:57:42.792
I don't know
how else to make you understand.

2103
01:57:51.375 --> 01:57:52.625
Dad. Mom's out there.

2104
01:58:12.208 --> 01:58:15.542
- Sir. Judge Vishwanathan is on leave.
- Who is replacing him?

2105
01:58:15.625 --> 01:58:16.792
Raja Rajeshwari.

2106
01:58:16.958 --> 01:58:18.542
Oh. no. not her!

2107
01:58:18.917 --> 01:58:20.333
PRINCIPAL DISTRICT JUDGE
COIMBATORE.

2108
01:58:27.375 --> 01:58:28.975
It's our bad luck she's the judge today.

2109
01:58:29.000 --> 01:58:30.000
What happened. sir?

2110
01:58:30.125 --> 01:58:31.685
That Judge won't let the lawyers argue.

2111
01:58:31.750 --> 01:58:33.768
She'll speak for herself.
whatever the lawyer has to say.

2112
01:58:33.792 --> 01:58:36.625
If she questions you be straight forward
and ask for divorce.

2113
01:58:36.917 --> 01:58:38.667
She's a very tricky person.

2114
01:58:52.750 --> 01:58:56.667
Lately. in our country. divorce cases are
on the rise more than theft and murder.

2115
01:58:57.000 --> 01:58:58.208
Not sure where it's headed.

2116
01:59:03.542 --> 01:59:04.542
Proceed!

2117
01:59:04.583 --> 01:59:10.083
HMOP 1520/2026 Veera - Keerthi.

2118
01:59:11.958 --> 01:59:13.708
Your Honor. my client...

2119
01:59:13.792 --> 01:59:16.112
Why should there be a 3rd party
between a husband and wife.

2120
01:59:16.708 --> 01:59:18.125
Didn't they get married?

2121
01:59:18.375 --> 01:59:20.917
- Madam. I'm a lawyer.
- Even lawyer shouldn't interfere.

2122
01:59:21.292 --> 01:59:22.292
Sit down!

2123
01:59:26.958 --> 01:59:27.958
Please proceed. dear.

2124
01:59:28.917 --> 01:59:31.083
- What do you want?
- I want my daughter.

2125
01:59:32.542 --> 01:59:34.042
I want my father.

2126
01:59:35.292 --> 01:59:36.500
I want my wife.

2127
01:59:40.375 --> 01:59:41.625
Then what am I doing here?

2128
01:59:42.542 --> 01:59:44.292
What are client's demand?

2129
01:59:44.625 --> 01:59:46.386
That's what I was trying to
tell you earlier.

2130
01:59:46.792 --> 01:59:48.542
Why wouldn't you tell now?

2131
01:59:48.792 --> 01:59:49.792
Sure. My Lord!

2132
01:59:50.958 --> 01:59:54.875
My client's husband has been working
as a house husband for the past 7 years.

2133
01:59:55.167 --> 01:59:57.042
They had their differences.

2134
01:59:57.167 --> 01:59:59.434
And the reason was a disagreement
over how to raise the child.

2135
01:59:59.458 --> 02:00:03.833
Envious of my client's achievements
in wrestling.

2136
02:00:03.917 --> 02:00:05.708
Veera. a house husband.

2137
02:00:05.875 --> 02:00:10.042
plotted repeatedly to ensure her defeat.

2138
02:00:10.542 --> 02:00:15.667
So. I request that he be
sentenced to death. Your Honor.

2139
02:00:18.792 --> 02:00:20.976
Enough! I'm not surprised
because you brought this lawyer to us.

2140
02:00:21.000 --> 02:00:22.240
- What's happening. Sattam?
- Hey!

2141
02:00:26.000 --> 02:00:28.250
Sorry. Your Honor. I said it in a flow.

2142
02:00:28.458 --> 02:00:30.579
Pegs himself to be Tiger Dayanidhi.
Sit down. damn it!

2143
02:00:35.083 --> 02:00:37.875
If you didn't like to
remain a house husband.

2144
02:00:37.958 --> 02:00:39.458
why didn't you tell your wife?

2145
02:00:39.667 --> 02:00:40.792
Why did you spoil her life?

2146
02:00:42.458 --> 02:00:44.833
- Your Honor. my client...
- Don't you see I'm talking to him?

2147
02:00:45.208 --> 02:00:46.708
Stop interfering! Sit down!

2148
02:00:50.583 --> 02:00:51.583
Go ahead!

2149
02:00:51.667 --> 02:00:55.000
The respect I received
when I was lurking like a loafer

2150
02:00:55.375 --> 02:00:58.000
I did not receive it
when I became a house husband.

2151
02:00:58.625 --> 02:01:01.875
That being said. even my uncle
has not spoken to me for years now.

2152
02:01:05.458 --> 02:01:06.958
A man should do household chores.

2153
02:01:07.042 --> 02:01:10.000
And sharing other work with your wife
is what society preaches.

2154
02:01:10.250 --> 02:01:12.375
But mock the men who do household chores.

2155
02:01:12.958 --> 02:01:16.208
It's because we have never
respected a housewife.

2156
02:01:17.625 --> 02:01:20.167
We keep pointing out that
they stay at home idle. doing nothing.

2157
02:01:20.625 --> 02:01:22.208
People go out to do a job.

2158
02:01:22.458 --> 02:01:27.208
But for the ones who stay home.
they work from dawn till dusk.

2159
02:01:27.375 --> 02:01:30.458
They don't have holidays
or weekends to relax and enjoy.

2160
02:01:31.042 --> 02:01:32.292
All days are the same to them.

2161
02:01:32.417 --> 02:01:34.083
TRUTH ALONE TRIUMPHS

2162
02:01:34.167 --> 02:01:38.042
If a man is achieving in his career.
then his wife is behind his success.

2163
02:01:38.542 --> 02:01:40.167
Many don't realize it.

2164
02:01:41.708 --> 02:01:44.917
There's a woman behind
every man's success.

2165
02:01:45.125 --> 02:01:47.458
Imagine if there's a man behind
a woman's success

2166
02:01:47.583 --> 02:01:48.708
and it's the husband.

2167
02:01:49.042 --> 02:01:51.417
That woman would be
the happiest in the world.

2168
02:01:52.917 --> 02:01:54.875
I wish to be that man in Keerthi's life.

2169
02:01:56.625 --> 02:01:58.042
You spoke a lot.

2170
02:01:58.250 --> 02:02:00.125
Then. why did you poison her food?

2171
02:02:00.958 --> 02:02:02.750
I did not poison her. It was medicine.

2172
02:02:02.875 --> 02:02:04.417
That's what I meant.
Why did you do it?

2173
02:02:05.000 --> 02:02:06.542
May I ask you one question. Madam?

2174
02:02:07.583 --> 02:02:10.917
- Proceed!
- Madam. what is toughest job in the world?

2175
02:02:11.083 --> 02:02:12.268
Why don't you answer it yourself?

2176
02:02:12.292 --> 02:02:14.000
- It's being a husband.
- What?

2177
02:02:14.375 --> 02:02:15.536
I'm telling the truth. Madam.

2178
02:02:15.792 --> 02:02:18.833
Being a husband is tough job
than being a Judge.

2179
02:02:19.250 --> 02:02:21.292
You had to graduate to become a Judge.

2180
02:02:21.458 --> 02:02:23.375
Because there books to learn about law.

2181
02:02:23.750 --> 02:02:25.458
So. you know what to do and when.

2182
02:02:25.583 --> 02:02:28.833
But there is no study material or degree
that teaches you how to be a husband.

2183
02:02:29.042 --> 02:02:31.482
There's no specific book available
that teaches you to be one.

2184
02:02:31.542 --> 02:02:33.750
We're clueless in what to do and when.

2185
02:02:33.917 --> 02:02:35.958
Day in and day out.
we get yelled at by our wives.

2186
02:02:37.167 --> 02:02:39.250
I've made plenty of mistakes
in my role as a husband.

2187
02:02:39.375 --> 02:02:40.375
I am not denying it.

2188
02:02:40.917 --> 02:02:42.958
But I'm slowly rectifying it
one after another.

2189
02:02:43.958 --> 02:02:45.500
Please give me some time.

2190
02:02:46.000 --> 02:02:47.500
Not divorce me.

2191
02:02:50.750 --> 02:02:54.000
Do you think any husband would
go to such lengths to plead as he did?

2192
02:02:54.250 --> 02:02:55.850
Find a way to work out your differences.

2193
02:02:56.167 --> 02:02:58.458
Ma'am he ruined everything.

2194
02:02:58.625 --> 02:03:00.833
Just speaking modestly
won't make him a good man.

2195
02:03:05.292 --> 02:03:06.708
Please ask them to play this.

2196
02:03:07.833 --> 02:03:08.833
What is this?

2197
02:03:29.917 --> 02:03:32.375
- Uncle. why are you recording?
- For proof!

2198
02:03:38.208 --> 02:03:39.208
Who's that woman?

2199
02:03:40.458 --> 02:03:41.818
She's my daughter's Class Teacher.

2200
02:03:42.208 --> 02:03:44.969
While going to pick up our daughter.
he picked up the teacher as well.

2201
02:03:48.333 --> 02:03:50.917
What's the guarantee
that she won't be my daughter's stepmom?

2202
02:03:51.083 --> 02:03:53.143
Then. my daughter would
have to endure stepmom tortures.

2203
02:03:53.167 --> 02:03:55.527
I don't want that for my daughter.
Please give me a divorce.

2204
02:03:56.417 --> 02:03:58.917
Mister. you did everything possible

2205
02:03:59.000 --> 02:04:01.833
but churning our dialogues
about supporting your wife.

2206
02:04:03.667 --> 02:04:04.875
Bloody rascal!

2207
02:04:04.958 --> 02:04:06.518
- It's not what it looks like...
- Shut up!

2208
02:04:08.458 --> 02:04:09.458
Please come here.

2209
02:04:09.667 --> 02:04:10.667
Come here!

2210
02:04:14.958 --> 02:04:16.708
Your husband has put you through a lot.

2211
02:04:17.417 --> 02:04:19.577
Do you want him to be happy
or be worried all his life?

2212
02:04:20.458 --> 02:04:21.818
He should be worried all his life.

2213
02:04:25.708 --> 02:04:26.958
Then don't divorce him.

2214
02:04:28.000 --> 02:04:30.625
What if he resumes dancing
with the teacher after the divorce?

2215
02:04:31.042 --> 02:04:32.042
Keep him with you.

2216
02:04:32.458 --> 02:04:34.259
Only then will he be on his toes
all the time.

2217
02:04:35.042 --> 02:04:36.417
I'm speaking out of experience.

2218
02:04:37.042 --> 02:04:38.583
I don't get what you're saying.

2219
02:04:40.208 --> 02:04:43.500
My husband did the same thing
as your husband did.

2220
02:04:44.708 --> 02:04:46.309
Do you see the typist sitting out there?

2221
02:04:49.375 --> 02:04:51.000
- He had an affair with her.
- Oh. no!

2222
02:04:51.083 --> 02:04:53.333
I told him to stay home
and not come to the court.

2223
02:04:53.708 --> 02:04:55.458
I could've chased him out of the house.

2224
02:04:55.750 --> 02:04:56.750
But I didn't do it.

2225
02:04:56.917 --> 02:04:58.893
Instead. keep him beside you
and make his life hell.

2226
02:04:58.917 --> 02:05:00.042
I don't think so. Ma'am.

2227
02:05:01.042 --> 02:05:02.833
Let him dance with whomever he wants to.

2228
02:05:03.208 --> 02:05:04.750
I don't care a damn about it.

2229
02:05:05.083 --> 02:05:08.000
Please give me a divorce right away
and give my daughter back.

2230
02:05:08.167 --> 02:05:10.125
- Please!
- What do you think of yourself?

2231
02:05:11.750 --> 02:05:13.333
You're repeating like a broken record.

2232
02:05:13.417 --> 02:05:15.792
You want me.
but you don't want Dad. is it?

2233
02:05:18.208 --> 02:05:21.208
Dear. you must not yell inside the court.

2234
02:05:21.625 --> 02:05:24.250
If you run your court properly.
why would I be screaming?

2235
02:05:24.333 --> 02:05:25.333
Mathi!

2236
02:05:25.583 --> 02:05:27.375
You're asking only what they both want.

2237
02:05:27.500 --> 02:05:30.917
I'm their daughter.
Why aren't you asking me?

2238
02:05:31.792 --> 02:05:32.958
You have a point. dear.

2239
02:05:33.917 --> 02:05:34.917
Fine.

2240
02:05:35.667 --> 02:05:36.667
Now. tell me.

2241
02:05:36.833 --> 02:05:39.542
With whom do you like to live
after your parents get divorced?

2242
02:05:39.708 --> 02:05:42.042
Husband and wife can divorce each other.

2243
02:05:42.333 --> 02:05:43.792
That's their wish.

2244
02:05:44.000 --> 02:05:46.500
But my parents must not divorce.

2245
02:05:46.625 --> 02:05:47.917
That's my wish!

2246
02:05:51.500 --> 02:05:53.541
The child's approval
is very important in this case.

2247
02:05:54.750 --> 02:05:56.167
I'm giving you both some time.

2248
02:05:56.750 --> 02:05:58.708
The next hearing will be after 3 months.

2249
02:05:59.042 --> 02:06:01.875
Until then. I order you both
to attend family counseling.

2250
02:06:02.458 --> 02:06:03.667
This is my decree!

2251
02:06:04.000 --> 02:06:05.500
And my decree is law!

2252
02:06:08.250 --> 02:06:10.500
Ma'am. this is not a kingdom?

2253
02:06:10.625 --> 02:06:11.917
To churn out punchlines.

2254
02:06:12.042 --> 02:06:13.833
I cannot wait for three months.

2255
02:06:14.083 --> 02:06:16.292
Please let me take my daughter home.

2256
02:06:17.708 --> 02:06:19.167
How dare you bark orders at me?

2257
02:06:19.833 --> 02:06:21.458
Who's the judge here. you or me?

2258
02:06:23.167 --> 02:06:25.292
I can't pass a verdict
at your convenience.

2259
02:06:25.458 --> 02:06:27.559
Only now has this dispute
been brought before the court.

2260
02:06:27.583 --> 02:06:29.000
It's not a mutual divorce. either.

2261
02:06:29.208 --> 02:06:31.726
Until you are divorced. who would have
the custody of your daughter

2262
02:06:31.750 --> 02:06:33.917
is something
the family must discuss and decide.

2263
02:06:35.458 --> 02:06:37.792
My head is spinning
after listening to you people speak.

2264
02:06:39.042 --> 02:06:40.562
I'm stepping out to have a cup of tea.

2265
02:06:40.792 --> 02:06:42.268
And when I return.
I'll tell you when the next hearing is.

2266
02:06:42.292 --> 02:06:44.333
Velu. bring the flask to my chamber.

2267
02:06:45.417 --> 02:06:47.583
Hey. I'm talking to you.
Come with me.

2268
02:06:47.667 --> 02:06:48.542
- Yes. Madam!
- Go.

2269
02:06:48.667 --> 02:06:49.987
Hey. keep moving.
Stop being lazy.

2270
02:06:53.292 --> 02:06:55.792
How dare you yell at the Judge?

2271
02:06:56.417 --> 02:06:57.833
Can't you maintain discipline?

2272
02:06:58.042 --> 02:06:59.143
Who taught you this behavior?

2273
02:06:59.167 --> 02:07:00.625
We come from a brave bloodline.

2274
02:07:01.792 --> 02:07:04.073
Tell her that we are not afraid
of the court or the Judge.

2275
02:07:04.167 --> 02:07:05.684
Please keep this nonsense to yourself.

2276
02:07:05.708 --> 02:07:07.000
Don't influence my daughter.

2277
02:07:07.750 --> 02:07:08.875
What do you mean?

2278
02:07:09.208 --> 02:07:11.542
She's our blood.

2279
02:07:11.958 --> 02:07:15.208
I hate these words. blood and legacy.

2280
02:07:15.375 --> 02:07:16.576
Just because you don't like it

2281
02:07:16.958 --> 02:07:18.159
we can't do anything about it.

2282
02:07:18.583 --> 02:07:19.958
I don't care. Bro!

2283
02:07:20.542 --> 02:07:22.143
Why are you
running your mouth unnecessarily?

2284
02:07:22.167 --> 02:07:24.292
- What?
- Have you forgotten the slap

2285
02:07:24.375 --> 02:07:25.833
that you got for speaking nonsense?

2286
02:07:26.292 --> 02:07:27.772
Would you like another slap from her?

2287
02:07:30.542 --> 02:07:34.792
My nephew returned that slap
with interest that very moment.

2288
02:07:36.500 --> 02:07:38.518
Just because you're stronger
doesn't mean you beat up everyone.

2289
02:07:38.542 --> 02:07:41.542
If she's a wrestler.
my nephew is a wrestler too.

2290
02:07:41.625 --> 02:07:43.167
- Oh. God!
- Got it?

2291
02:07:43.333 --> 02:07:45.875
Bro. we're having
a serious discussion here.

2292
02:07:46.042 --> 02:07:48.792
But you're joking in court
by calling him a wrestler.

2293
02:07:48.917 --> 02:07:50.000
Joking?

2294
02:07:50.208 --> 02:07:53.167
My nephew would've kicked her
like a football in the Palakkad match.

2295
02:07:53.333 --> 02:07:55.708
She escaped because she got pregnant.

2296
02:07:55.792 --> 02:07:57.000
Who was saved on that day.

2297
02:07:57.083 --> 02:07:58.333
- your nephew or me?
- It's you!

2298
02:07:58.583 --> 02:08:00.625
The people saw my nephew's match.

2299
02:08:01.167 --> 02:08:03.375
Do you even know who he won against?

2300
02:08:03.750 --> 02:08:05.875
Coach! A male Coach!

2301
02:08:06.250 --> 02:08:09.083
Compared to the Coach.
you're an ordinary player.

2302
02:08:09.333 --> 02:08:10.875
That too. you're a women player.

2303
02:08:11.083 --> 02:08:12.518
- Are you going to shut up or not?
- Uncle!

2304
02:08:12.542 --> 02:08:13.917
Please stop talking unnecessarily.

2305
02:08:14.000 --> 02:08:14.875
Why did we come to court?

2306
02:08:14.958 --> 02:08:17.250
She's been challenging.
yet you're asking me to back down.

2307
02:08:17.333 --> 02:08:18.417
Indeed. I'm a woman player.

2308
02:08:18.792 --> 02:08:20.875
But I'm ready to fight again.

2309
02:08:21.125 --> 02:08:23.292
Why don't you check
if your male player is ready?

2310
02:08:23.375 --> 02:08:24.292
Now you're talking. my girl.

2311
02:08:24.375 --> 02:08:26.059
- Keerthi. what's this nonsense?
- What did I do?

2312
02:08:26.083 --> 02:08:27.083
I'll speak now!

2313
02:08:27.875 --> 02:08:29.155
My father is ready to fight you.

2314
02:08:29.708 --> 02:08:32.000
Hey. sweetie. please stay quiet.

2315
02:08:32.250 --> 02:08:33.833
Why are you dragging me into this?

2316
02:08:33.917 --> 02:08:37.625
We can beat her only
if we play her game.

2317
02:08:37.708 --> 02:08:39.989
Please don't say anything
for a while and stand out there.

2318
02:08:40.250 --> 02:08:41.500
Go! Go and stand out there.

2319
02:08:41.583 --> 02:08:43.042
I'm not blowing up this problem.

2320
02:08:43.667 --> 02:08:45.067
I don't know what you have in mind.

2321
02:08:45.708 --> 02:08:46.708
Go!

2322
02:08:46.750 --> 02:08:48.684
- It'll be humiliating for us.
- How do we get our child back?

2323
02:08:48.708 --> 02:08:52.625
My father did not train for 15 years
to become a wrestler.

2324
02:08:52.750 --> 02:08:54.708
He only trained for 15 days.

2325
02:08:54.917 --> 02:08:56.458
Yet he won't the match.

2326
02:08:56.958 --> 02:08:59.792
Your father won once in his lifetime.

2327
02:09:00.167 --> 02:09:02.333
That's called luck not talent.

2328
02:09:02.417 --> 02:09:04.958
My father took part in only one match.

2329
02:09:05.125 --> 02:09:07.000
Yet he won that match.

2330
02:09:07.167 --> 02:09:08.458
- Hey. Baby...
- Hey!

2331
02:09:08.583 --> 02:09:10.417
We're discussing about wrestling.

2332
02:09:10.708 --> 02:09:12.458
You have nothing to do with it.

2333
02:09:12.708 --> 02:09:15.125
Hey. you're going overboard.
Apologize to him.

2334
02:09:15.375 --> 02:09:16.667
Why should I apologize to him?

2335
02:09:16.792 --> 02:09:18.708
What does he know about wrestling?

2336
02:09:18.792 --> 02:09:20.542
Hey. fake candy.

2337
02:09:20.958 --> 02:09:23.559
All these years. you fooled people
by calling yourself a wrestler.

2338
02:09:23.708 --> 02:09:25.768
But a young kid smeared you
with dung and humiliated you.

2339
02:09:25.792 --> 02:09:27.792
Had it been me.
I would have killed myself.

2340
02:09:28.083 --> 02:09:30.875
You claim
that my client won by luck. right?

2341
02:09:31.083 --> 02:09:32.792
We'll prove it wrong.
When is the match?

2342
02:09:32.875 --> 02:09:34.250
- Sattam!
- We'll have it tomorrow.

2343
02:09:35.167 --> 02:09:37.250
- But one condition.
- What's the condition?

2344
02:09:38.250 --> 02:09:39.625
If he wins the match…

2345
02:09:40.125 --> 02:09:41.292
Mathi can live with him.

2346
02:09:41.542 --> 02:09:42.833
But if I win…

2347
02:09:43.292 --> 02:09:44.542
You should send Mathi with me.

2348
02:09:48.292 --> 02:09:51.250
- That's not right. Pick something else.
- Now. I challenge you to talk.

2349
02:09:52.583 --> 02:09:54.750
What? Are you scared?

2350
02:09:55.000 --> 02:09:56.560
My father is ready for the competition.

2351
02:09:57.250 --> 02:09:59.458
But there's a change in the condition.

2352
02:09:59.667 --> 02:10:00.667
What change?

2353
02:10:00.750 --> 02:10:03.792
If you win. I'll come with you.
Okay!

2354
02:10:03.875 --> 02:10:07.708
But if my father wins.
you should come with us.

2355
02:10:09.250 --> 02:10:11.333
Sweetie. stop talking nonsense.

2356
02:10:11.708 --> 02:10:14.333
I don't want a competition.
Let her go with her.

2357
02:10:14.542 --> 02:10:15.643
I don't have any qualms about it.

2358
02:10:15.667 --> 02:10:17.333
I don't want your charity.

2359
02:10:17.542 --> 02:10:19.333
I'll win in the competition
and then take her.

2360
02:10:19.625 --> 02:10:20.750
You. people. fix the venue.

2361
02:10:20.833 --> 02:10:22.500
We'll conduct at the Temple ground.

2362
02:10:22.792 --> 02:10:24.250
Uncle. why are you doing this?

2363
02:10:24.958 --> 02:10:28.208
If you insist let's conduct it
inside our house.

2364
02:10:28.417 --> 02:10:29.292
Not at a ground.

2365
02:10:29.375 --> 02:10:32.333
Oh. he is avoid the humiliation
in front of the people.

2366
02:10:32.500 --> 02:10:34.208
Uncle. this is a family matter.

2367
02:10:34.375 --> 02:10:36.250
It won't look good
if we fight in public.

2368
02:10:36.333 --> 02:10:39.208
Didn't you fight your wife
in front of people before?

2369
02:10:39.333 --> 02:10:40.654
- What happened now?
- How dare you?

2370
02:10:40.750 --> 02:10:42.250
You're disrespecting him.

2371
02:10:42.333 --> 02:10:43.583
You better speak with respect.

2372
02:10:43.667 --> 02:10:44.667
This is how I speak.

2373
02:10:44.792 --> 02:10:46.434
Are you trying to cheat
by holding the match inside the house?

2374
02:10:46.458 --> 02:10:48.018
The match will take place
at the ground.

2375
02:10:48.042 --> 02:10:48.917
No one can change it...

2376
02:10:49.000 --> 02:10:50.518
- Sattam. please make them understand.
- Be respectful!

2377
02:10:50.542 --> 02:10:52.292
- Ask him to keep quiet.
- Please be quiet.

2378
02:10:52.375 --> 02:10:53.458
Uncle. please!

2379
02:10:53.667 --> 02:10:54.958
Please hear me out.

2380
02:10:55.042 --> 02:10:56.934
- Please don't yell inside the court.
- We'll talk it out.

2381
02:10:56.958 --> 02:10:58.018
Everyone. please calm down.

2382
02:10:58.042 --> 02:10:59.309
- Lawyer. tell them to keep quiet.
- He is going on and on!

2383
02:10:59.333 --> 02:11:01.054
- How can I keep quiet?
- Order! Order! Order!

2384
02:11:02.042 --> 02:11:03.722
Do you think you're in a court
or a market?

2385
02:11:04.667 --> 02:11:06.250
What did I instruct you people to do?

2386
02:11:07.375 --> 02:11:08.935
Did you discuss and come to a decision?

2387
02:11:09.208 --> 02:11:10.542
Who's taking the kid?

2388
02:11:10.792 --> 02:11:12.872
We're not going to discuss
to make a decision. Ma'am.

2389
02:11:13.042 --> 02:11:14.922
Instead. we're going to
play against each other.

2390
02:11:15.417 --> 02:11:16.917
Play against each other. you say?

2391
02:11:18.500 --> 02:11:20.542
- What game?
- Wrestling!

2392
02:11:21.292 --> 02:11:23.708
Whoever wins can get the child's custody.

2393
02:11:25.375 --> 02:11:28.250
Never before have I passed
such an unusual verdict.

2394
02:11:31.125 --> 02:11:33.208
You should officiate this competition.

2395
02:11:33.333 --> 02:11:34.750
They will cheat us.

2396
02:11:35.125 --> 02:11:36.792
There's no space for such a decision.

2397
02:11:39.208 --> 02:11:41.042
You may conduct the competition.

2398
02:11:42.792 --> 02:11:44.208
I'll come there as an audience.

2399
02:11:45.458 --> 02:11:47.917
I have a long standing wish
to watch a wrestling match live.

2400
02:11:49.542 --> 02:11:52.125
And if the match is between
a husband and a wife

2401
02:11:53.042 --> 02:11:54.042
quite exciting!

2402
02:11:54.125 --> 02:11:55.458
I'm also excited. Madam.

2403
02:11:59.250 --> 02:12:00.250
Case dismissed!

2404
02:12:13.458 --> 02:12:15.583
THE HUSBAND OR THE WIFE?

2405
02:12:18.167 --> 02:12:19.434
NOT JUST IN INDIAN HISTORY!
THIS IS A FIRST IN WORLD HISTORY!

2406
02:12:19.458 --> 02:12:21.625
OPEN WRESTLING MATCH
BETWEEN HUSBAND AND WIFE

2407
02:12:40.208 --> 02:12:42.143
Why are you charging 100 bucks
to watch a husband and wife fight?

2408
02:12:42.167 --> 02:12:43.042
How's this fair?

2409
02:12:43.167 --> 02:12:44.809
It's 100 bucks when
you buy at the counter.

2410
02:12:44.833 --> 02:12:45.708
If you're late by half an hour

2411
02:12:45.792 --> 02:12:47.434
it'll be sold in black for 500 bucks.
Scoot!

2412
02:12:47.458 --> 02:12:48.738
- Come on. pay up.
- Three tickets.

2413
02:12:49.458 --> 02:12:50.625
Give me a 140ml.

2414
02:12:50.792 --> 02:12:52.917
140? The ticket cost is only 100 bucks.

2415
02:12:53.000 --> 02:12:54.309
Lining up immediately
looking at the queue.

2416
02:12:54.333 --> 02:12:56.958
Oh. he mistook it for another shop.

2417
02:12:57.542 --> 02:12:58.750
Are you happy now?

2418
02:12:59.208 --> 02:13:01.518
I wanted to finish this competition
without anyone's knowledge.

2419
02:13:01.542 --> 02:13:04.708
You suggested temple ground and
now see the crowd it has gathered.

2420
02:13:04.875 --> 02:13:05.875
Sorry. Son.

2421
02:13:05.917 --> 02:13:07.597
We didn't expect
so many people to show up.

2422
02:13:07.750 --> 02:13:09.542
How did everyone come to know about it?

2423
02:13:10.000 --> 02:13:12.708
Sattam told his wife all about
what happened in court.

2424
02:13:12.917 --> 02:13:15.750
She's an admin of four
or five WhatsApp group.

2425
02:13:15.833 --> 02:13:16.893
She put out a broadcast message.

2426
02:13:16.917 --> 02:13:18.750
People won't spread the good news.

2427
02:13:18.875 --> 02:13:21.275
But if it's a bad news
they'll compete to spread the message.

2428
02:13:21.458 --> 02:13:23.042
But why are you selling tickets?

2429
02:13:23.292 --> 02:13:25.458
Or else we won't be able to
control the crowd.

2430
02:13:25.875 --> 02:13:28.083
I'm not going to take this money.
Look over there.

2431
02:13:29.333 --> 02:13:31.625
- Who are they?
- Cheers girls!

2432
02:13:31.708 --> 02:13:35.250
No game can be held without cheer girls.
as per the new Government rule.

2433
02:13:35.333 --> 02:13:37.583
There are a group of fans for cheer girls.

2434
02:13:37.708 --> 02:13:40.417
Look. the Judge is also eager
to watch the fight.

2435
02:13:45.917 --> 02:13:46.917
Greetings. Madam Judge.

2436
02:13:47.208 --> 02:13:49.417
I reckon you'll win this match.

2437
02:13:50.875 --> 02:13:52.083
What are you thinking about?

2438
02:13:52.333 --> 02:13:54.375
Your daughter has faith in you
and have placed bets.

2439
02:13:55.083 --> 02:13:57.583
Win this fight
and bring the family back together.

2440
02:13:59.292 --> 02:14:01.333
- Show me your ticket!
- Hey. it's the Judge!

2441
02:14:02.750 --> 02:14:03.893
I'll handle you when
you come to the court.

2442
02:14:03.917 --> 02:14:04.997
Oh. no. please don't Madam.

2443
02:14:18.292 --> 02:14:20.708
Hey. Sweetie. are you ready
to watch Mom and Dad's match?

2444
02:14:23.083 --> 02:14:25.833
Don't forget you're up against
a State Champion.

2445
02:14:25.917 --> 02:14:28.708
The same State Champion trained with me
to spar with her.

2446
02:14:29.167 --> 02:14:30.708
I know her all movements.

2447
02:14:31.250 --> 02:14:33.833
Dad. speaking about it here
is not important.

2448
02:14:33.958 --> 02:14:35.159
It should reflect in the ring.

2449
02:14:35.458 --> 02:14:37.833
Dad. please manage to win the match.

2450
02:14:37.917 --> 02:14:38.917
I will. dear.

2451
02:14:38.958 --> 02:14:42.625
Don't say you'd try your best.
So. make a promise.

2452
02:14:42.792 --> 02:14:44.792
And prove that my Dad is a Hero.

2453
02:14:48.125 --> 02:14:49.125
Please do it. Dad.

2454
02:14:50.500 --> 02:14:52.417
Promise! For you!

2455
02:14:52.792 --> 02:14:56.208
The most anticipated competition
is about to begin!

2456
02:14:56.333 --> 02:14:58.333
- I'm going in. Take care.
- You carry on.

2457
02:14:58.458 --> 02:14:59.917
Uncle. please hand me your phone.

2458
02:15:00.125 --> 02:15:01.958
My phone? Here you go.

2459
02:15:04.125 --> 02:15:06.083
- Who are you calling?
- Meenu Teacher.

2460
02:15:06.375 --> 02:15:08.500
- I'm inviting her to watch the match.
- Oh. no!

2461
02:15:08.583 --> 02:15:10.167
You're going to mess everything up.

2462
02:15:10.458 --> 02:15:13.417
As it is your mother is going to
knead your father to ground.

2463
02:15:13.583 --> 02:15:17.042
If your teacher shows up
then your father will be a minced parotta.

2464
02:15:17.292 --> 02:15:21.250
Cricket commentators
were once successful players.

2465
02:15:21.375 --> 02:15:25.042
So. to begin this match
and to render commentary…

2466
02:15:25.125 --> 02:15:27.005
We welcome former Punjab Wrestler.
Balbir Singh.

2467
02:15:27.125 --> 02:15:29.958
Please give him a warm welcome.

2468
02:15:35.333 --> 02:15:38.375
<i>He's the direct successor of
Undertaker from the world of wrestling.</i>

2469
02:15:38.458 --> 02:15:40.625
<i>No one calls him
but he claims it himself.</i>

2470
02:15:41.708 --> 02:15:43.250
Greetings to all!

2471
02:15:43.833 --> 02:15:46.750
A group is waiting to watch
if the husband would beat up the wife.

2472
02:15:46.833 --> 02:15:49.674
Another group is waiting to watch
if the wife would beat up the husband.

2473
02:15:49.958 --> 02:15:52.583
In fact. to see other families
fight with each other

2474
02:15:52.875 --> 02:15:55.208
all of you are here to enjoy the match.

2475
02:15:56.292 --> 02:15:58.083
You shouldn't be applauding
but feel ashamed.

2476
02:15:59.750 --> 02:16:00.750
Bring them out!

2477
02:16:16.292 --> 02:16:17.684
You're going to fight
with your wife. right?

2478
02:16:17.708 --> 02:16:18.949
Then. why are you hyping it up?

2479
02:16:19.042 --> 02:16:20.042
Don't bother about it.

2480
02:16:20.417 --> 02:16:22.583
You seem like a true bred Tamilian.

2481
02:16:22.667 --> 02:16:24.143
But they're calling you a Punjab wrestler.

2482
02:16:24.167 --> 02:16:25.607
Dinesh Karthick plays for Bengaluru.

2483
02:16:25.708 --> 02:16:27.292
Even Nataraj plays for Delhi.

2484
02:16:27.500 --> 02:16:29.792
What's wrong if I go to Punjab to wrestle?

2485
02:16:29.875 --> 02:16:31.500
Are you here to fight
or to interview me?

2486
02:16:31.583 --> 02:16:32.583
Call out your wife!

2487
02:16:36.750 --> 02:16:38.792
Oh! She's not even wearing a track suit.

2488
02:16:40.083 --> 02:16:42.404
I think she believes she can
take you down even in a saree.

2489
02:16:53.333 --> 02:16:56.333
Hey. I know what's running on your mind.

2490
02:16:56.500 --> 02:16:57.958
Why is she wearing a saree?

2491
02:16:58.292 --> 02:17:00.412
She's going to sprinkle you
like the dung on the wall.

2492
02:17:02.042 --> 02:17:03.958
Posing won't help you win the match.

2493
02:17:04.042 --> 02:17:05.059
Just because I was posing.

2494
02:17:05.083 --> 02:17:07.143
the Biharis beat me up.
stripping me down to underwear.

2495
02:17:07.167 --> 02:17:08.726
I'm helping you get away.
Escape on the bike.

2496
02:17:08.750 --> 02:17:09.750
I won't!

2497
02:17:10.750 --> 02:17:11.911
Fate has never spared anyone.

2498
02:17:12.083 --> 02:17:14.458
He won't back down. it seems.
Woman. hurry up.

2499
02:17:14.667 --> 02:17:17.250
Keerthi! Keerthi!

2500
02:17:19.042 --> 02:17:22.083
Keerthi! Keerthi!

2501
02:17:22.542 --> 02:17:23.542
Welcome. Dear!

2502
02:17:26.208 --> 02:17:27.417
I think she just did push ups.

2503
02:17:28.208 --> 02:17:30.684
The only request I would like to
put forward to the Government is…

2504
02:17:30.708 --> 02:17:32.792
It's simple.
Conduct husband and wife fights…

2505
02:17:32.958 --> 02:17:37.042
On a stage yearly like a IPL match

2506
02:17:37.333 --> 02:17:39.684
they wouldn't have to go to court
and save up on lawyer's fee.

2507
02:17:39.708 --> 02:17:42.542
The Judge Madam
should approve this request.

2508
02:17:43.000 --> 02:17:44.500
He keeps yapping nonsense!

2509
02:17:44.625 --> 02:17:46.833
In today's 20-20 wrestling match

2510
02:17:47.125 --> 02:17:49.292
whoever scores 20 points first

2511
02:17:49.375 --> 02:17:50.851
they will be the winner of the match.

2512
02:17:50.875 --> 02:17:53.250
Red colour cheer girls support Keerthi.

2513
02:17:53.875 --> 02:17:56.292
Blue colour cheer girls support Veera.

2514
02:17:56.917 --> 02:17:59.000
Hey. I'm red too. Same family.

2515
02:17:59.083 --> 02:18:01.208
Hey. the colour on
the side of the jersey is yours.

2516
02:18:01.542 --> 02:18:03.684
You don't even know the basics and you're
here to fight wearing a swimming costume.

2517
02:18:03.708 --> 02:18:05.000
Ready. first round.

2518
02:18:05.208 --> 02:18:06.625
Come on. break his jaw.

2519
02:18:09.083 --> 02:18:10.204
Is she taking his blessings?

2520
02:18:11.583 --> 02:18:14.833
Like she dusted her hands.
she's about to dust off her husband…

2521
02:18:15.000 --> 02:18:16.309
I'm giving you the warrior princess.

2522
02:18:16.333 --> 02:18:18.000
Hey. you too pull up a stance.

2523
02:18:18.083 --> 02:18:19.393
Why are you standing idle
like you're waiting for a bus?

2524
02:18:19.417 --> 02:18:20.417
Huh! People!

2525
02:18:20.750 --> 02:18:22.000
Shout out your cheers!

2526
02:18:22.750 --> 02:18:23.750
Come on. cheer!

2527
02:18:24.375 --> 02:18:25.375
Oh. God!

2528
02:18:26.542 --> 02:18:28.417
Fight your wife. damn it.
Not me!

2529
02:18:28.958 --> 02:18:29.958
Ready!

2530
02:18:30.125 --> 02:18:32.000
It's a wonderful spectacle to watch.

2531
02:18:32.208 --> 02:18:34.125
This is what you call a great fight.

2532
02:18:37.958 --> 02:18:40.375
Hey. instead of fighting.
why are you giving her weird looks?

2533
02:18:40.458 --> 02:18:43.458
Woman. hit him so hard that
he should not stand up for his life.

2534
02:18:43.542 --> 02:18:44.542
Oh. God!

2535
02:18:44.958 --> 02:18:46.999
Since he got in the ring.
he's only been beating me.

2536
02:19:05.458 --> 02:19:08.958
His gaze it not a fighter's gaze.

2537
02:19:09.625 --> 02:19:12.833
He must fight and explain his gaze.

2538
02:19:13.000 --> 02:19:15.125
Woman. do a somersault.
Damn you!

2539
02:19:15.625 --> 02:19:18.833
Instead of fighting each other
they're throwing sand at me.

2540
02:19:18.958 --> 02:19:20.958
Hey. stop! First round over.

2541
02:19:21.042 --> 02:19:23.458
I shall go up to the stage
to continue the commentary.

2542
02:19:30.625 --> 02:19:32.292
- How's my game. Sattam?
- Super. Veera!

2543
02:19:34.833 --> 02:19:36.417
I underestimated you.

2544
02:19:36.625 --> 02:19:38.000
You haven't lost touch.

2545
02:19:51.667 --> 02:19:53.125
Second round. start!

2546
02:19:56.583 --> 02:19:57.667
Veera. keep it up!

2547
02:20:09.958 --> 02:20:10.958
That's it!

2548
02:20:14.792 --> 02:20:16.708
Twist his arms.
Don't spare him.

2549
02:20:22.333 --> 02:20:24.125
Just like you flip a parotta…

2550
02:20:24.292 --> 02:20:26.333
She flipped her husband in the air.

2551
02:20:26.625 --> 02:20:27.625
Wonderful shot!

2552
02:20:27.875 --> 02:20:29.792
- 4 points!
- Dad!

2553
02:20:29.875 --> 02:20:32.417
Hey. get up.
You're lying down as if you're chilling.

2554
02:20:48.458 --> 02:20:50.708
Hey. is he an old fighter?

2555
02:20:50.792 --> 02:20:52.708
You can't teach him.
Take him away.

2556
02:21:07.125 --> 02:21:08.351
She's thrashing him like washing clothes.

2557
02:21:08.375 --> 02:21:09.458
- Oh. no!
- Hey!

2558
02:21:09.667 --> 02:21:12.875
No man has ever won a battle
against his wife.

2559
02:21:18.167 --> 02:21:20.000
Mathi. do you think your father will win?

2560
02:21:20.083 --> 02:21:21.833
I'm clueless just like you. Ma'am.

2561
02:21:29.000 --> 02:21:30.917
Yeah. Keerthi. that's it.
That's super!

2562
02:21:38.167 --> 02:21:40.083
Second rounds. ends.

2563
02:21:40.750 --> 02:21:43.333
I pity the blue colour cheer girls.

2564
02:21:44.667 --> 02:21:46.792
He's not going to
give you the opportunity to dance.

2565
02:21:46.875 --> 02:21:48.708
Please have your food
and sleep at home.

2566
02:21:49.833 --> 02:21:50.833
Have it.

2567
02:21:51.708 --> 02:21:54.542
Damn. she exhausted her husband
by the second round.

2568
02:21:54.750 --> 02:21:56.191
And he's shamelessly drinking water.

2569
02:21:57.750 --> 02:21:59.559
I wonder if in the third round he would
drink water again

2570
02:21:59.583 --> 02:22:01.333
or ride in the ambulance.

2571
02:22:01.417 --> 02:22:03.000
Hey. stop with the yapping.

2572
02:22:03.083 --> 02:22:03.958
I don't need it anymore.

2573
02:22:04.042 --> 02:22:05.722
Hey. Veera.
I'm giving you a second chance.

2574
02:22:05.792 --> 02:22:06.792
Escape from here.

2575
02:22:06.958 --> 02:22:09.167
They're trolling you.
Next round thrash her.

2576
02:22:09.250 --> 02:22:10.708
Uncle. be careful. it's hurting.

2577
02:22:10.833 --> 02:22:12.917
Why aren't you thrashing her?

2578
02:22:13.000 --> 02:22:14.167
She's using a new technique.

2579
02:22:14.250 --> 02:22:16.210
- You can do it!
- He has started to shiver in pain.

2580
02:22:16.417 --> 02:22:18.417
- Don't give up. Veera.
- Come on! Come on!

2581
02:22:18.500 --> 02:22:19.625
He's only full of theatrics.

2582
02:22:19.708 --> 02:22:21.917
Either way. he's going to get beaten up.

2583
02:22:35.417 --> 02:22:36.417
What just happened?

2584
02:22:36.917 --> 02:22:38.250
He scored a point!

2585
02:22:39.917 --> 02:22:40.917
Hey!

2586
02:23:10.875 --> 02:23:11.875
How's my game now?

2587
02:23:12.125 --> 02:23:14.583
You just scored two points
didn't win the match yet.

2588
02:23:14.792 --> 02:23:17.192
She has scored 12 points.
You need 10 more to level with her.

2589
02:23:24.958 --> 02:23:27.292
That's like it. my boy!

2590
02:23:40.667 --> 02:23:42.458
Hey. Keerthi!

2591
02:23:42.583 --> 02:23:44.000
That was a wonderful shot!

2592
02:23:44.125 --> 02:23:45.333
Keerthi back to form!

2593
02:23:56.417 --> 02:23:57.417
Come on!

2594
02:24:05.708 --> 02:24:07.458
This fight is not circumstantial.

2595
02:24:07.667 --> 02:24:12.125
It was years of suppressed anger
that Keerthi finally let out on him.

2596
02:24:12.208 --> 02:24:13.958
Dad. come on. get up!

2597
02:24:16.292 --> 02:24:17.292
Oh. God!

2598
02:24:26.750 --> 02:24:28.125
Third round. ends.

2599
02:24:37.000 --> 02:24:38.417
Dad must win.

2600
02:24:38.542 --> 02:24:39.833
Dad must win.

2601
02:24:40.333 --> 02:24:41.667
Dad must win.

2602
02:24:42.042 --> 02:24:43.417
Dad must win.

2603
02:24:43.792 --> 02:24:45.167
Dad must win.

2604
02:24:45.458 --> 02:24:47.000
Dad must win.

2605
02:24:47.208 --> 02:24:48.458
Dad must win.

2606
02:24:48.542 --> 02:24:50.458
<i>My father is also a</i>

2607
02:24:51.292 --> 02:24:52.167
<i>wrestler!</i>

2608
02:24:52.250 --> 02:24:54.375
<i>My father is a wrestler. just like you.</i>

2609
02:24:54.583 --> 02:24:56.208
<i>He won against a coach.</i>

2610
02:24:56.708 --> 02:24:58.125
Dad must win.

2611
02:24:58.333 --> 02:25:00.375
<i>Prove that you're a Hero.</i>

2612
02:25:04.292 --> 02:25:06.667
Dad must win.
Dad must win.

2613
02:25:13.750 --> 02:25:15.250
Dad must win.

2614
02:25:21.583 --> 02:25:23.500
Fourth round. start!

2615
02:25:23.958 --> 02:25:25.833
You need to score only one more point.

2616
02:25:25.917 --> 02:25:26.917
Finish him off!

2617
02:25:46.167 --> 02:25:47.292
4 points!

2618
02:26:29.917 --> 02:26:31.375
What happened?

2619
02:26:33.417 --> 02:26:34.583
What is wrong with her?

2620
02:26:37.917 --> 02:26:39.875
Aren't you ashamed
to score points like this?

2621
02:26:40.167 --> 02:26:42.487
Among husband and wife.
it doesn't matter who scores first.

2622
02:26:54.042 --> 02:26:55.167
Keep it coming!

2623
02:27:04.625 --> 02:27:06.375
Veera was weak
in all the previous rounds.

2624
02:27:07.042 --> 02:27:10.417
But how is he performing so well
in the last round?

2625
02:27:10.917 --> 02:27:13.250
Even I. a heavyweight wrestler.
don't understand it.

2626
02:27:23.375 --> 02:27:24.375
Dad!

2627
02:27:29.125 --> 02:27:30.375
19-19. equal!

2628
02:27:37.667 --> 02:27:39.167
Why is she stepping back?

2629
02:27:39.625 --> 02:27:41.667
Is Veera using a new technique?

2630
02:27:41.750 --> 02:27:44.708
Keerthi. come on. come on!
Ready. ready. ready!

2631
02:27:44.792 --> 02:27:45.792
One more point to win.

2632
02:27:45.833 --> 02:27:47.875
Time is running out.
Don't miss it.

2633
02:27:55.083 --> 02:27:56.917
That's it. Cross the line!

2634
02:27:57.000 --> 02:27:58.375
One more point. Cross the line.

2635
02:27:58.458 --> 02:27:59.851
Quit fooling around and cross the line!

2636
02:27:59.875 --> 02:28:01.167
He's back in the ring.

2637
02:28:06.583 --> 02:28:08.125
- Keerthi!
- Why did she faint?

2638
02:28:08.958 --> 02:28:09.958
Keerthi!

2639
02:28:14.542 --> 02:28:15.708
Kee... Keerthi!

2640
02:28:17.542 --> 02:28:18.667
Keerthi. what happened?

2641
02:28:20.875 --> 02:28:21.875
Keerthi!

2642
02:28:23.208 --> 02:28:24.500
Hey. Sattam!

2643
02:28:24.708 --> 02:28:25.708
Mom!

2644
02:28:25.792 --> 02:28:27.292
- Keerthi!
- What happened to Mom?

2645
02:28:27.375 --> 02:28:28.375
Mom!

2646
02:28:28.750 --> 02:28:30.250
- Mom!
- She was playing well.

2647
02:28:30.917 --> 02:28:31.917
Dear!

2648
02:28:32.125 --> 02:28:34.250
I suspect Veera has something
to do with it.

2649
02:28:34.875 --> 02:28:38.125
Was he actually playing a fair match?
Or was he resorting to tricks?

2650
02:28:38.208 --> 02:28:39.958
Oh. God! Don't just stand there.
Help me!

2651
02:28:40.042 --> 02:28:41.667
Lift her.
Let's take her to the hospital.

2652
02:28:41.750 --> 02:28:44.208
Wait a minute.
Let me check what's wrong.

2653
02:28:50.750 --> 02:28:52.208
Nothing to worry.

2654
02:28:52.292 --> 02:28:53.708
It's good news!

2655
02:28:54.042 --> 02:28:55.083
She's pregnant.

2656
02:28:58.375 --> 02:28:59.375
What does that mean?

2657
02:28:59.792 --> 02:29:01.667
You're going to have a baby brother. dear.

2658
02:29:03.625 --> 02:29:04.625
She's pregnant?!

2659
02:29:05.000 --> 02:29:06.000
Why are you anxious?

2660
02:29:06.292 --> 02:29:07.851
He wouldn't go to work
when they had only one child.

2661
02:29:07.875 --> 02:29:08.893
Now they're having another!

2662
02:29:08.917 --> 02:29:10.458
I think I must quit my job.

2663
02:29:10.542 --> 02:29:11.542
Pregnant?

2664
02:29:12.125 --> 02:29:15.042
Bloody sinners!
In my years of wrestling experience.

2665
02:29:15.125 --> 02:29:18.125
this is the first time someone has
gotten pregnant during a fight.

2666
02:29:19.125 --> 02:29:20.500
You two were in this together.

2667
02:29:20.583 --> 02:29:22.750
and you still had the audacity
to file for divorce!

2668
02:29:22.833 --> 02:29:24.458
Bloody rascals!

2669
02:29:25.833 --> 02:29:27.101
No matter how big the problem is.

2670
02:29:27.125 --> 02:29:29.208
my nephew solves it
by getting her pregnant.

2671
02:29:29.292 --> 02:29:30.292
Hey. Uncle!

2672
02:29:30.333 --> 02:29:31.333
Guys!

2673
02:29:31.792 --> 02:29:34.458
First they wrestled in bed.

2674
02:29:34.542 --> 02:29:36.125
then came here to wrestle in the ring.

2675
02:29:36.208 --> 02:29:37.958
We must learn something from this.

2676
02:29:38.833 --> 02:29:42.542
A quarrel between husband and wife
isn't a third person's business.

2677
02:29:42.875 --> 02:29:44.625
That's the moral of this story.

2678
02:29:45.083 --> 02:29:46.583
Everyone. get going! Leave!

2679
02:29:52.708 --> 02:29:53.708
Are you happy?

2680
02:30:07.792 --> 02:30:08.792
Two babies?

2681
02:30:09.500 --> 02:30:10.792
I only asked for one.

2682
02:30:11.208 --> 02:30:12.250
Another one is a bonus.

2683
02:30:15.792 --> 02:30:17.917
You promised to make me
the Mary Kom of sports.

2684
02:30:18.000 --> 02:30:20.958
Instead. you gave me three kids
and turned me into a homemaker Mary Kom.

2685
02:30:27.000 --> 02:30:28.375
I won't go back on my word.

2686
02:30:28.917 --> 02:30:31.167
I won't rest until I make you
the Mary Kom of sports.

2687
02:30:31.625 --> 02:30:33.583
I swear on my three children.

2688
02:30:37.708 --> 02:30:42.042
Since you're pregnant.
I didn't want to hide the truth from you.

2689
02:30:43.000 --> 02:30:46.667
The coach devised a plan to defeat you.

2690
02:30:49.292 --> 02:30:50.500
Today. I may have won.

2691
02:30:51.458 --> 02:30:54.250
But this victory belongs to you.

2692
02:30:57.042 --> 02:31:00.167
I was in love with a guy for four years.

2693
02:31:00.792 --> 02:31:04.500
He said. "I don't like you wearing
this costume and playing this game."

2694
02:31:05.042 --> 02:31:08.333
"It makes me uncomfortable
when other men look at you."

2695
02:31:08.958 --> 02:31:12.875
He said. "Please quit wrestling
after we get married."

2696
02:31:14.625 --> 02:31:18.000
I told him. "I don't mind leaving you.
but I can't quit wrestling."

2697
02:31:19.667 --> 02:31:23.000
He was well-educated.
but his thinking was flawed.

2698
02:31:23.917 --> 02:31:26.708
But your husband is uneducated.

2699
02:31:28.000 --> 02:31:32.500
Even after you gave birth.
he wanted you to succeed in wrestling.

2700
02:31:33.875 --> 02:31:34.995
Don't miss this opportunity.

2701
02:31:53.042 --> 02:31:54.042
Wow!

2702
02:31:57.083 --> 02:31:58.458
Come on. Keerthi!

2703
02:31:59.833 --> 02:32:01.333
- Cheer for Mom.
- Mom!

2704
02:32:03.042 --> 02:32:04.625
Hey. Mom is looking at you guys.

2706
02:32:05.305 --> 02:33:05.895
